<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">5 Mose (Deuteronomium)</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mose Nwoma A Ɛtɔ So Enum (Deuteronomium)</para>
  <para style="toc2">5 Mose</para>
  <para style="toc3">5 Mose</para>
  <para style="mt3">Deuteronomium</para>
  <para style="mt4">Anaasɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mose Nwoma A Ɛtɔ So Enum</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔtu Firi Horeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1"/>Yei ne nsɛm a Mose ka kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ nyinaa wɔ ɛserɛ no so wɔ Yordan apueeɛ. Wɔbɔɔ atenaeɛ wɔ Yordan bɔnhwa a ɛbɛn Suf, wɔ Paran, Tofel, Laban, Haserot ne Di-Sahab ntam no. <verse eid="DEU 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2"/>Ɛfiri Horeb de kɔ Kades-Barnea no, ɛkwan a ɛfa bepɔ Seir no yɛ nnafua dubaako kwan.<verse eid="DEU 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3"/>Israelfoɔ firii Bepɔ Sinai no, afe a ɛtɔ so aduanan no bosome dubaako no ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan no, Mose kaa nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnka nkyerɛ Israelfoɔ no pɛpɛɛpɛ kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4"/>Ɔkaa saa asɛm yi wɔ ɛberɛ a na wɔadi Amorifoɔ ɔhene Sihon a na ɔdi adeɛ wɔ Hesbon ne Basanhene Og a na ɔdi adeɛ wɔ Astarot ne Edrei so nkonim.<verse eid="DEU 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5"/>Yordan agya a ɛwɔ Moab asase so na Mose firii aseɛ kyerɛkyerɛɛ mmara no mu sɛ:<verse eid="DEU 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ yɛn wɔ Horeb sɛ: “Moatena saa bepɔ yi so akyɛre dodo. <verse eid="DEU 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7"/>Montutu nkɔtena Amorifoɔ nkokoɔ so; monkɔtena nnipa a wɔbemmɛn Araba mmepɔ no mu ne atɔeɛ mmepɔ ayaase nyinaa mu; monkɔ Negeb na momfa mpoano nkɔsi Kanaanfoɔ asase so ne Lebanon nkɔduru Asubɔnten Eufrate ho. <verse eid="DEU 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8"/>Montie! Mede saa asase yi ama mo. Monkɔ na monkɔfa asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ bɔ sɛ ɔde bɛma mo agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob ne wɔn asefoɔ no.”<verse eid="DEU 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akannifoɔ No Yie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, meka kyerɛɛ nnipa no sɛ, “Me nko ara merentumi nyɛ mo ho adwuma. <verse eid="DEU 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ama moadɔre enti ɛnnɛ yi, mo ase afɛe te sɛ ɔsoro nsoromma. <verse eid="DEU 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo agyanom Onyankopɔn mma mo nnɔre mmɔho mpempem na ɔnhyira mo sɛdeɛ wahyɛ mo bɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12"/>Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na me nko mɛtumi masoa mo haw ne mo nnesoa ne mo aperedie? <verse eid="DEU 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13"/>Monyi mmarima bi a wɔwɔ nyansa, nteaseɛ, na wɔwɔ edin pa mfiri abusuakuo biara mu na memfa wɔn ntuatua mo ano.”<verse eid="DEU 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14"/>Mobuaa me sɛ, “Dwuma a woasusu sɛ wobɛdi no yɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15"/>Enti, mede mo mmusuakuo mu mmarima atitire, anyansafoɔ a wɔn anim wɔ nyam no tuatuaa mo ano apem apem, ɔha ɔha, aduonum aduonum ne edu edu so mpanin ne mo mmusuakuo so sɛ ahwɛfoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16"/>Na atemmufoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ saa ɛberɛ no nso, mehyɛɛ wɔn sɛ, sɛ akasakasa ba anuanom ntam, sɛ asɛm no yɛ Israelni ne ne nua bi anaa Israelni ne ɔhɔhoɔ bi a, monhwɛ na mommu atɛntenenee. <verse eid="DEU 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17"/>Mo atemmuo mu, mommmu ntɛnkyea. Montie ɔketewa ne ɔkɛseɛ pɛ. Monnsuro onipa biara, ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn na ɔbu atɛn. Asɛm a ɛyɛ den ma mo no, momfa mmrɛ me na menni. <verse eid="DEU 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18"/>Na saa ɛberɛ no, mekaa biribiara a ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ kyerɛɛ mo.<verse eid="DEU 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsoma Akwansrafoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19"/>Na sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ yɛn no, yɛfirii Horeb de yɛn ani kyerɛɛ Amorifoɔ bepɔ a yɛnam ɛserɛ pradada a moahunu no so kɔduruu Kades-Barnea. <verse eid="DEU 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20"/>Afei, meka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, “Moaduru Amorifoɔ bepɔman a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de rema yɛn no so. <verse eid="DEU 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de asase no ama mo. Momforo nkɔfa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo agyanom Onyankopɔn, ka kyerɛɛ mo no. Monnsuro: mommma obi ntu mo aba mu.”<verse eid="DEU 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22"/>Ɛnna mo nyinaa baa me nkyɛn bɛkaa sɛ, “Momma yɛnsoma mmarima nni yɛn anim na wɔnkɔsra asase no mma yɛn na wɔmmɛka deɛ wɔbɛhunu nkyerɛ yɛn na ɛno na ɛbɛkyerɛ yɛn ɛkwan ne nkuro ko a yɛbɛfa so.”<verse eid="DEU 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23"/>Na saa nsusuiɛ yi yɛ ma me enti meyii akwansrafoɔ dumienu a ɔbaako biara firi mo mmusuakuo dumienu no mu. <verse eid="DEU 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24"/>Wɔforoo bepɔ no na wɔkɔduruu Eskol subɔnhwa mu sraa hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25"/>Na wɔfaa asase no so aba bi de brɛɛ yɛn. Na wɔkaa sɛ, asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn de ama yɛn no yɛ asase pa.<verse eid="DEU 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israelfoɔ Anwiinwii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26"/>Nanso, na mompɛ sɛ moforo kɔ soro. Motee <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm so atua. <verse eid="DEU 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27"/>Monwiinwii wɔ mo ntomadan mu kaa sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> tan yɛn enti na ɔde yɛn firi Misraim de yɛn abɛhyɛ Amorifoɔ nsam sɛ wɔnkunkum yɛn. <verse eid="DEU 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28"/>Yɛrekɔ no sɛn? Yɛn akwansrafoɔ no amanneɛbɔ no abu yɛn aba mu. ‘Wɔka sɛ asase no so nnipa yɛ atentene ahoɔdenfoɔ sene yɛn. Wɔn nkuro yɛ akɛseɛ a afasuo a wɔatoto afa ho no kɔ ɔsorosoro. Na mpo, yɛhunuu Anakfoɔ mma no bi wɔ hɔ!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29"/>Na meka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, “Monnsuro! <verse eid="DEU 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> di mo anim. Ɔbɛko ama mo sɛdeɛ mohunuu no sɛ ɔyɛɛ wɔ Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31"/>Na mohunuu nso sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kɔɔ so hwɛɛ mo ntoatoasoɔ wɔ ɛserɛ so ha sɛdeɛ agya hwɛ ne ba no. Afei, ɔde mo abɛduru beaeɛ ha.”<verse eid="DEU 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32"/>Nanso, deɛ ɔyɛ maa mo no nyinaa akyi no, moannye <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anni. <verse eid="DEU 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33"/>Ɔdii mo anim pɛɛ beaeɛ pa maa mo tenaeɛ, de ogyadum kyerɛɛ mo ɛkwan anadwo de omununkum dum kyerɛɛ mo ɛkwan awia.<verse eid="DEU 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tee sɛ morenwiinwii no, ne bo fuu yie na ɔkaa ntam sɛ, <verse eid="DEU 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35"/>“Saa awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ bɔne yi mu, onipa baako koraa nni hɔ a ɔbɛhunu asase pa a maka ho ntam sɛ mede bɛma mo agyanom <verse eid="DEU 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36"/>agye Yefune babarima Kaleb. Ɔno na ɔbɛhunu saa asase yi. Mede asase a ne nan sii so no bɛma ɔne nʼasefoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, wadi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyi nokorɛm.”<verse eid="DEU 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37"/>Me nso, ɛsiane mo enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu me. Ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Wo nan rensi Bɔhyɛ Asase no so da! <verse eid="DEU 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38"/>Na mmom, wo ɔboafoɔ Nun babarima Yosua na ɔbɛdi ɔmanfoɔ no anim akɔ asase no so. Na sɛ ɔreboa ne ho akɔ hɔ a, hyɛ no nkuran. <verse eid="DEU 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39"/>Mede asase no bɛma wo mma a wɔnnim biribiara. Wo mma a wɔnnim papa nnim bɔne no. Na mosuro sɛ wɔbɛfa wɔn nnommum, nanso wɔn na mede asase no bɛma wɔn. Wɔn na wɔbɛtena asase no so. <verse eid="DEU 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40"/>Na mo deɛ, monnane mo ani nkɔ ɛserɛ so a ɛrekɔ Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ no so hɔ.”<verse eid="DEU 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41"/>Ɛnna mogye too mu sɛ “Yɛayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Yɛbɛkɔ asase no so akɔko sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ yɛn no.” Enti, wɔfaa wɔn akodeɛ miaeɛ. Na wɔgye di sɛ ɛhɔ sodie bɛyɛ mmerɛ ama wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42"/>Nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Mma wɔnnkɔko, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔkɔ a merenni wɔn akyi. Wɔn atamfoɔ no bɛdi wɔn so.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43"/>Asɛm a meka kyerɛɛ mo ni, nanso moantie. Na mmom, mosɔre tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛdeɛ no bio nam ahomasoɔ so kɔɔ asase no so kɔkoeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44"/>Amorifoɔ a wɔte bepɔ no so nso sɔre baa sɛ nwowa ne mo koeɛ. Wɔtaa mo kunkumm mo firii Seir kɔduruu Horma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45"/>Afei, mosane baa mo akyi bɛsuu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, nanso wantie. <verse eid="DEU 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46"/>Enti, motenaa Kades nna bebree.<verse eid="DEU 1:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɛserɛ So Ananteananteɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1"/>Afei, yɛsane yɛn akyi de yɛn ani kyerɛɛ ɛserɛ so wɔ baabi a Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ no da hɔ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ me sɛ menyɛ no. Yɛnantenante faa Seir bepɔ ho nna bebree.<verse eid="DEU 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2"/>Akyire no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3"/>“Moatwa afa saa bepɔ yi ho akyɛre yie enti monnane mo ani nkyerɛ atifi fam. <verse eid="DEU 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4"/>Hyɛ ɔman no sɛ, ‘Mobɛfa mo nuanom Edomfoɔ a wɔyɛ Esau asefoɔ a wɔte Seir no asase so. Edomfoɔ no bɛsuro mo, nanso monhwɛ yie. <verse eid="DEU 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5"/>Monnhyɛ wɔn abufuo a ɛde ɔko bɛba, na meremfa wɔn nsase no mu biara mma mo; mpo, baabi a mode mo nan bɛtia, ɛfiri sɛ, mede Seir bepɔ kuro ama Esau sɛ nʼatenaeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6"/>Aduane biara a mobɛdi ne nsuo biara a mobɛnom no, montua wɔn ho ka.’ ”<verse eid="DEU 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyira mo nsa ano nnwuma nyinaa. Wahwɛ mo so wɔ mo akwantuo wɔ ɛserɛ kakraa yi nyinaa so. Saa mfeɛ aduanan yi nyinaa mu, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka mo ho na hwee ho anhia mo.<verse eid="DEU 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8"/>Yɛtwa faa yɛn nuanom a wɔyɛ Esau asefoɔ a wɔte Seir no ho. Yɛfaa Araba subɔnhwa ɛkwan no a ɛfiri Elat ne Esion-Geber no so na yɛbɛfaa Moab ɛserɛ so ɛkwan no so.<verse eid="DEU 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Monnha Moabfoɔ no anaa monnteetee wɔn sɛdeɛ ɛde ɔko bɛba, na meremfa wɔn nsase no mu biara mma mo. Ɛfiri sɛ, mede Ar ama Lot asefoɔ sɛ agyapadeɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10"/>Kane no na Emifoɔ na wɔte hɔ. Na wɔsoso na wɔdɔɔso a wɔwoware te sɛ Anakfoɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11"/>Wɔn nso, na wɔyɛ abrane sɛ Anakfoɔ no ara pɛ, a na wɔfrɛ wɔn Refaimfoɔ, nanso Moabfoɔ deɛ, na wɔfrɛ wɔn Emifoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12"/>Kane no na Horifoɔ na wɔte Seir, nanso Esau asefoɔ tuu wɔn firii hɔ. Wɔsɛee Horifoɔ no tenaa wɔn ananmu sɛdeɛ Israel yɛɛ wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de maa wɔn sɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ no so no pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="DEU 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa sɛ, “Afei, sɔre na kɔtwa asuwa Sered no.” Na yɛkɔtwaa asuwa Sered.<verse eid="DEU 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14"/>Na nna dodoɔ a yɛde nante firi Kades-Barnea bɛsii sɛ yɛtwaa asuwa Sered no yɛ mfirinhyia aduasa nwɔtwe. Saa ɛberɛ no, na mmarima a wɔanyinyini yie a wɔbɛtumi akɔ ɔko no nyinaa awuwu wɔ ɛserɛ no so sɛdeɛ Awurade kaeɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsa tiaa wɔn ara kɔsi sɛ wɔn nyinaa bɛwuwuu wɔ wɔn atenaeɛ hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16"/>Akofoɔ no nyinaa wuwu firii nnipa no mu pɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18"/>“Ɛnnɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wofa Ar kɔsi Moab mantam mu. <verse eid="DEU 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19"/>Na sɛ woduru Amonfoɔ mu a, nha wɔn anaa nhyɛ wɔn ahometeɛ a ɛde wɔn bɛkɔ ɔko mu, ɛfiri sɛ, meremma mo Amorifoɔ nsase no bi. Mede ama Lot asefoɔ sɛ agyapadeɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20"/>Saa beaeɛ hɔ na abrane akɛseɛ a na Amonfoɔ frɛ wɔn Samsumin no na wɔte kane no. <verse eid="DEU 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21"/>Na wɔyɛ nnipa ahoɔdenfoɔ a wɔdɔɔso na wɔwoware te sɛ Anakfoɔ no. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee Samsumifoɔ no wɔ Amonfoɔ anim ma wɔtuu wɔn tenaa wɔn anan mu. <verse eid="DEU 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22"/>Saa ara na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee Horifoɔ wɔ Esau asefoɔ a na wɔte Seir no anim ma wɔtuu wɔn, tenaa wɔn anan mu de bɛsi ɛnnɛ yi. <verse eid="DEU 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23"/>Na Awifoɔ nso a wɔtenaa nkuraa nkuraa hwete kɔduruu Gasa no nso, Kaftorfoɔ a wɔfiri Kaftor bɛsɛee wɔn, tenaa wɔn anan mu.<verse eid="DEU 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔdi Amorihene Sihon So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24"/>“Sɔre kɔtwa Arnon subonhwa. Mede Hesbonhene Sihon a ɔyɛ Amorini no ne nʼasase ahyɛ wo nsa. Kɔto hyɛ ne so, na monko, na fa nʼasase no. <verse eid="DEU 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25"/>Ɛfiri ɛnnɛ yi ara, mede mo ho suro ne hu bɛhyɛ aman a wɔwɔ ɔsoro ase nyinaa mu. Wɔbɛte mo ho nsɛm na wɔn ho bɛpopo na mo enti, wɔanya adwenemhaw.”<verse eid="DEU 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26"/>Metuu abɔfoɔ firii Kedemot ɛserɛ so kɔɔ Hesbonhene Sihon nkyɛn asomdwoeɛ so kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <verse eid="DEU 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27"/>“Ma yɛntwam wʼasase so ha. Yɛbɛfa ɛkwan tempɔn mu a yɛremmane mfa benkum anaa nifa so baabiara. <verse eid="DEU 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28"/>Tɔn aduane ma yɛnni na tɔn nsuo nso ma yɛnnom. Deɛ yɛrehwehwɛ ara ne ɛkwan a wobɛma yɛn ama yɛatwam wɔ wʼasase so, <verse eid="DEU 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29"/>sɛdeɛ Esau asefoɔ a na wɔte Seir ne Moabfoɔ a na wɔte Ar yɛɛ yɛn no. Ma yɛntwam nkɔsi sɛ yɛbɛtwam Yordan akɔsi asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ama yɛn no so.” <verse eid="DEU 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30"/>Nanso, Hesbonhene Sihon amma yɛamfa nʼasase so antwam. Ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛɛ ne honhom sisirii, pirim nʼakoma sɛdeɛ ɔnam so de no bɛhyɛ wo nsam nam so adi wɔn so nkonim sɛdeɛ wayɛ no ɛnnɛ yi.<verse eid="DEU 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Mafiti aseɛ de Sihon ne ne ɔman ahyɛ wo nsam. Afei, fiti aseɛ na di wɔn so, na fa nʼasase no.”<verse eid="DEU 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32"/>Ɛberɛ a Sihon ne ne dɔm bɛhyiaa yɛn ɔko so wɔ Yahas no, <verse eid="DEU 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de no maa yɛn ma yɛdii ɔno, ne ne manfoɔ nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34"/>Na yɛfaa ne nkuro nyinaa saa ɛberɛ no sɛee ne mmarima, mmaa ne mmɔfra a wɔwɔ kuropɔn biara mu a yɛannya obiara, <verse eid="DEU 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35"/>gye afieboa nko na yɛfomm wɔn faeɛ, ɛnna nkuro a yɛfaeɛ no mu asadeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36"/>Ɛfiri Aroer a ɛda Arnon subɔnhwa ano ne kuro a ɛda subɔnhwa no mu no so de kɔsi Gilead no, kuro biara nni hɔ a na ɛsodie yɛ den ma yɛn; <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ne nyinaa hyɛɛ yɛn nsa. <verse eid="DEU 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37"/>Nanso, yɛammɛn Amorifoɔ a na wɔwɔ Asubɔnten Yabok ho ne mmepɔ no so nkuro no baabiara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ yɛn sɛ yɛnnkɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 2:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Basanhene Og So Nkonimdie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1"/>Afei, yɛde yɛn ani kyerɛɛ Basan ɛkwan so. Basanhene Og ne nʼasraadɔm firi bɛhyiaa yɛn wɔ Edrei ne yɛn koeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2"/>Nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Nsuro no, ɛfiri sɛ, mede ɔno ne nʼakodɔm ne nʼasase nyinaa ahyɛ wo nsa. Asɛm a ɛtoo Amorifoɔhene Sihon wɔ Hesbon no, saa asɛm korɔ no ara bi na ɛbɛto no.”<verse eid="DEU 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3"/>Enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn, sane de Basanhene Og ne nʼakodɔm nyinaa hyɛɛ yɛn nsa. Yɛbɔɔ wɔn guiɛ a anka wɔn mu baako koraa. <verse eid="DEU 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, yɛfaa wɔn nkuropɔn nyinaa. Nkuropɔn aduosia no mu baako koraa nni hɔ a yɛannye amfiri wɔn nsam. Argob mantam a ɛyɛ Og ahenkuro wɔ Basan nyinaa ka ho. <verse eid="DEU 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5"/>Saa nkuropɔn yi nyinaa, na wɔato afasuo atentene afa ho de nnadeɛ apono atoto ano. Saa ɛberɛ korɔ no ara mu, yɛfaa nkuraa a na wɔntoo afasuo mfaa ho bebree. <verse eid="DEU 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6"/>Yɛsɛee Basan kuropɔn no korakora sɛdeɛ yɛsɛee Hesbonhene Sihon no. Yɛsɛee nkuro no ne emu mmarima, mmaa ne mmɔfra nyinaa pasapasa. <verse eid="DEU 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7"/>Nanso, afieboa nyinaa ne nkuro no mu asadeɛ deɛ, yɛfom faeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8"/>Amorifoɔ ahemfo baanu nsase a na ɛdeda Asubɔnten Yordan apueeɛ fam no nyinaa, yɛfaeɛ—nsase a ɛfiri Arnon subɔnhwa kɔsi bepɔ Hermon so nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9"/>Sidonfoɔ frɛ no Hermon Sirion ɛnna Amorifoɔ frɛ no Senir. <verse eid="DEU 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10"/>Yɛadi nkuropɔn a ɛwɔ bepɔ no apampam no nyinaa so a Gilead ne Basan ka ho de kɔsi nkuro a ɛwɔ Saleka ne Edrei, a na ɛyɛ Og ahemman wɔ Basan no nso ka ho bi. <verse eid="DEU 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11"/>Abrane no deɛ, Basanhene Og nko na na waka. Ne dadeɛ mpa tenten boro anammɔn dumiɛnsa ɛnna ne tɛtrɛtɛ yɛ anammɔn nsia. Ɛda so wɔ Amonfoɔ kuropɔn Raba mu seesei ara.<verse eid="DEU 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsase No Mu Kyekyɛ Wɔ Yordan Apueeɛ Fam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12"/>Yɛfaa asase no, mede asase no fa a ɛda firi Aroer Arnon subɔnhwa mu ne Gilead bepɔ fa ne ne nkuro no maa Rubenfoɔ ne Gadfoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13"/>Afei, mede asase no nkaeɛ a ɛyɛ Gilead ne Basan nyinaa a ɛyɛ na anka ɛyɛ Og ahemman no maa Manase abusua fa no. Saa Basan no nyinaa na wɔfrɛ no abrane asase. <verse eid="DEU 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14"/>Manase abusua ɔkannifoɔ Yair faa Argob asase no nyinaa a ɛne Basan kɔsii Gesurfoɔ ne Maakatfoɔ hyeɛ so. Ɔde ne din too asase no frɛɛ hɔ Hawot-Yair de bɛsi ɛnnɛ. <verse eid="DEU 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15"/>Mede Gilead maa Makir, <verse eid="DEU 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16"/>Rubenfoɔ ne Gadfoɔ no, memaa wɔn asase bi a ɛfiri Gilead fa bi, kɔsi Arnon subɔnhwa ho, de kɔsi Asubɔnten Yabok a ɛyɛ Amonfoɔ hyeɛ no so. <verse eid="DEU 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17"/>Atɔeɛ hyeɛ no firi Asubɔnten Yordan a ɛda Araba a ɛfiri Kineret kɔsi Nkyene Ɛpo a ɛda Pisga bepɔ ayaase no.<verse eid="DEU 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18"/>Na mehyɛɛ mo saa ɛberɛ no sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de asase yi ama mo sɛ momfa. Nanso mo mmarima akofoɔ nyinaa nhyɛ akodeɛ nni mo nuanom Israelfoɔ anim ntwa Yordan. <verse eid="DEU 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19"/>Mo yerenom, mo mma ne mo afieboa bebrebe no deɛ, monnya wɔn wɔ mo akyi wɔ nkuro a mede ama mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔ Israelfoɔ a wɔaka no ho ban na wɔtena asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ama wɔn a ɛtwam Asubɔnten Yordan no so a, afei motumi sane mo akyi ba asase a mede ama mo no so.”<verse eid="DEU 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔamma Mose Ankɔ Asase No So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, meka kyerɛɛ Yosua sɛ, “Woahunu deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Onyankopɔn ayɛ saa ahemfo baanu yi. Saa ara na ɔbɛyɛ ahemman a ɛwɔ Yordan atɔeɛ fam no nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22"/>Nsuro aman a wɔwɔ hɔ no na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛko ama wo.”<verse eid="DEU 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, mesrɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, <verse eid="DEU 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24"/>“Ao Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, meyɛ wʼakoa. Afei, na worekyerɛ me wo kɛseyɛ ne wo tumi. Onyame bɛn na ɔwɔ ɔsoro anaa asase so a ɔbɛtumi ayɛ mmaninneɛ te sɛ wo? <verse eid="DEU 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25"/>Mesrɛ wo, ma me ntwa Yordan nkɔhwɛ asase nwanwa a ɛda ɛfa hɔ, ɔman fɛfɛ no ne Lebanon mmepɔ no.”<verse eid="DEU 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26"/>Nanso ɛsiane mo enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu me. Na wantie me. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ “Ɛyɛ, nka saa asɛm yi ho hwee bio nkyerɛ me. <verse eid="DEU 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27"/>Foro kɔ Pisga na hwɛ atɔeɛ ne atifi ne anafoɔ ne apueeɛ. Esiane sɛ, worentwa Yordan no enti, wʼankasa fa wʼani hwɛ asase no. <verse eid="DEU 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28"/>Nanso, tu Yosua na bɔ nʼaba so, na hyɛ no den na ɔno na ɔbɛdi saa nnipa yi anim atwa na wama wɔadi asase a wʼani tua yi so.” <verse eid="DEU 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29"/>Ɛno enti, yɛtenaa subɔnhwa a ɛbɛn Bet-Peor.<verse eid="DEU 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsetie Ho Afotuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1"/>Afei, Israel montie mmara ne nhyehyɛeɛ a merebɛkyerɛkyerɛ mo yi yie. Monni so na moanya nkwa, na moatumi akɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo agyanom Onyankopɔn de rema mo no so na moatena hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2"/>Mommfa bi nka ho, na monnyi biribiara nso mfiri mmara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de ama me sɛ memfa mma mo no mu, na mmom monni so.<verse eid="DEU 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3"/>Mode mo ani hunuu deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛɛ mo wɔ Baal-peor no. Ɔsɛee nnipa pii a na wɔsom abosom no. <verse eid="DEU 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4"/>Nanso, wɔn a na wɔdi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn nokorɛ nyinaa da so te ase bɛsi ɛnnɛ.<verse eid="DEU 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5"/>Sɛ moduru asase a mobɛtena so no so a, yeinom ne mmara a ɛsɛ sɛ modi so. Ɛfiri Awurade, yɛn Onyankopɔn, nkyɛn. Ɔde ama me sɛ memfa mma mo. <verse eid="DEU 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6"/>Sɛ modi so a, ɛbɛma mo agye nim wɔ adwene ne nyansa mu. Na sɛ aman a wɔatwa mo ho ahyia no te saa mmara yi a, wɔbɛteam sɛ, “Ɔman bɛn na wɔwɔ nyansa ne adwene sɛ Israel!” <verse eid="DEU 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7"/>Ɔman kɛseɛ bɛn na ɛwɔ onyame a ɔbɛn wɔn pɛɛ te sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn, a yɛfrɛ no a ɔgye yɛn so yi? <verse eid="DEU 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8"/>Na ɔman bɛn na ɛwɔ edin sei a ɛwɔ mmara pa te sɛ saa mmara yi a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi?<verse eid="DEU 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9"/>Monhwɛ yie! Monhwɛ yie pa ara na mo werɛ amfiri deɛ moahunu sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ ma mo. Sɛ mote ase yi, mommma saa nsɛm yi mfiri mo adwene mu da! Na monhwɛ nso sɛ mo mma ne mo nananom nso bɛte. <verse eid="DEU 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10"/>Ka kyerɛ wɔn, ne titire no, ɛda a mokɔgyinaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn anim wɔ bepɔ Horeb a ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Frɛ ɔmanfoɔ no wɔ mʼanim na mɛkyerɛ wɔn deɛ wɔnyɛ no. Sɛ ɛba saa a, wɔbɛsua sɛdeɛ wɔbɛdi me ni berɛ dodoɔ a wɔte ase no, na ɛnam so ma wɔatumi akyerɛ wɔn mma mmara no.” <verse eid="DEU 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11"/>Mobɛgyina bɛnee bepɔ no ayaase ɛberɛ a na bepɔ no rehye no. Egyaframa no tu kɔɔ soro a omununkum ne esum kabii aduru no. <verse eid="DEU 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kasa faa ogya no mu kyerɛɛ mo. Motee nsɛm no, nanso moanhunu no. Ɛnne kɛkɛ na ɛbaeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13"/>Ɔdaa nʼapam a ɔkyerɛɛ mo sɛ monni so no adi; mmaransɛm edu a ɔtwerɛɛ guu aboɔ ɛpono mmienu so no. <verse eid="DEU 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Awurade hyɛɛ me sɛ memfa mmara a ɛsɛ sɛ modi so wɔ asase a morebɛhyɛne so akɔtena so no mma mo.<verse eid="DEU 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahonisom Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15"/>Monhwɛ yie! Ɛberɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kasa faa ogya mu kyerɛɛ mo firi bepɔ Horeb so no, moanhunu no. <verse eid="DEU 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16"/>Ɛno enti, Monnnaadaa mo ho nyɛ mfoni hunu bi wɔ mo tirim sɛ ɔyɛ ɔbaa anaa ɔbarima, <verse eid="DEU 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17"/>aboa anaa anomaa, <verse eid="DEU 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18"/>aboa a ɔwea fam anaa nsuomnam. <verse eid="DEU 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19"/>Na sɛ mohwɛ ewiem na mohunu owia, ɔsrane ne nsoromma a, mma wɔnntwetwe mo nkɔsom wɔn. <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, yɛɛ saa ewiem abɔdeɛ yi maa nnipa a wɔwɔ asase so nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20"/>Na mo deɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii mo firii dadeɛ fononoo mu wɔ Misraim sɛ mommɛyɛ nʼadedifoɔ sɛdeɛ mote ɛnnɛ yi.<verse eid="DEU 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21"/>Mo enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu me yie. Ɔkaa ntam sɛ, merentwa Asubɔnten Yordan nkɔ asase pa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ mo agyapadeɛ sononko no so da. <verse eid="DEU 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22"/>Ɛwom sɛ mobɛtwa Yordan akɔtena hɔ asase no so, na me deɛ, mɛwu wɔ asuo no fa ha. <verse eid="DEU 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23"/>Enti, monhwɛ yie na moammu apam a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ne mo ayɛ no so. Sɛ moyɛ abosom sɛso biara a mo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn abra mo no a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ, moabu apam no so. <verse eid="DEU 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, yɛ Onyame ninkunfoɔ ne ogya a ɔhye adeɛ Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="DEU 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25"/>Moawowo mma ne mmanana akyi, na moatena asase no so akyɛre no, sɛ bɔne fa mo na moyɛ ohoni bi nam so yɛ bɔne wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ani so nam so hyɛ no Abufuo a, <verse eid="DEU 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26"/>mefrɛ ɔsoro ne fam sɛ mʼadansefoɔ de tia mo saa ɛda yi sɛ, ntɛm so, mobɛhye afiri asase a moretwam wɔ so akɔ Yordan akɔfa no so. Morentena hɔ nkyɛ na wɔasɛe mo pasapasa. <verse eid="DEU 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ mo apansam aman mu a mo mu kakra bi na wɔbɛtena ase. <verse eid="DEU 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28"/>Ɛhɔ a ɛyɛ ahɔhosase no so na mobɛsom ahoni a wɔde nnua ne aboɔ na ayɛ, anyame a wɔnhunu adeɛ na wɔnte asɛm na wɔnnidi nte hwa no. <verse eid="DEU 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29"/>Ɛhɔ na mobɛpere bio ahwehwɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn. Na sɛ mode mo akoma ne mo kra nyinaa hwehwɛ no a, mobɛhunu no. <verse eid="DEU 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30"/>Sɛ ɔhaw bi to mo na yeinom nyinaa ba mo so a, akyire no, mobɛsane akɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn nkyɛn na moayɛ ɔsetie ama no. <verse eid="DEU 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, mo Awurade mo Onyankopɔn no yɛ mmɔborɔhunu Onyankopɔn. Ɔrennya mo na ɔrensɛe mo anaa ne werɛ remfiri apam a ɔne mo agyanom pameeɛ a ɔkaa ntam sii so no.<verse eid="DEU 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Yɛ Baako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32"/>Hwehwɛ abakɔsɛm mu firi ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn bɔɔ nnipa wɔ asase so bɛsi ɛnnɛ yi. Afei, hwehwɛ firi ɔsoro ano kɔsi ɔsoro ano. Hwɛ sɛ biribi kɛseɛ a ɛte sɛ yei asi pɛn anaasɛ woate biribi saa pɛn? <verse eid="DEU 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33"/>Ɔman bi ate Onyankopɔn nne sɛ ɔrekasa afiri ogya mu sɛdeɛ moteeɛ na wɔda so te ase yi anaa? <verse eid="DEU 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34"/>Onyame foforɔ bi nam ɔgye a ɔnam amanehunu, nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛyɛ nwanwa, ɔko, tumidie ne ahodwiredeɛ so agye ɔman bi afiri ɔman foforɔ bi nsam afa sɛ ne dea anaa? Nanso, saa na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, yɛ maa mo wɔ Misraim a mo ani hunuiɛ.<verse eid="DEU 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35"/>Ɔdaa yeinom nyinaa adi kyerɛɛ mo sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mobɛhunu sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ Onyankopɔn a nʼakyi obi nni hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36"/>Ɔmaa motee ne nne firi soro nam so tenetenee mo so. Ɔmaa mohunuu ne ogya fadum wɔ asase so, ɛnna motee ne nne firii ogya no mfimfini. <verse eid="DEU 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37"/>Esiane sɛ na ɔpɛ mo agyanom asɛm, na ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔhyira wɔn asefoɔ enti na ɔno ara nam ne tumi kɛseɛ so yii mo firii Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38"/>Ɔpamoo saa aman yi a na wɔn ho yɛ den sene mo wɔ mo anim sɛdeɛ mobɛba wɔn asase so abɛdi so sɛdeɛ ɛte ɛnnɛ yi.<verse eid="DEU 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39"/>Enti, monkae na momma no ntim mo akoma mu: <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ Onyankopɔn wɔ ɔsoro ne asase so, na onyame bi nka ne ho bio! <verse eid="DEU 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40"/>Sɛ moyɛ ɔsetie ma mmara no ne ahyɛdeɛ no a mede bɛma mo ɛnnɛ no a, ɛbɛsi mo ne mo mma yie. Mobɛnyini akyɛre wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de rema mo afebɔɔ no so.<verse eid="DEU 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apueeɛ Fam Dwanekɔbea Nkuropɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41"/>Afei, Mose yii nkuropɔn mmiɛnsa bi wɔ Yordan apueeɛ fam <verse eid="DEU 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42"/>a, sɛ ɛba sɛ obi akum obi a wanhyɛ da na ɔnni onipa ko no ho menasepɔ bi a, ɔtumi dwane kɔ hɔ kɔbɔ ne ho adwaa. <verse eid="DEU 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43"/>Ɔyii Beser a ɛda ɛserɛ ne asase tata so no maa Rubenfoɔ. Ɔde Ramot a ɛwɔ Gilead no maa Gadfoɔ ɛnna ɔde Golan a ɛwɔ Basan no nso maa Manase abusuakuo.<verse eid="DEU 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔda Mmara No Adi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44"/>Yeinom ne mmara a Mose de maa Israelfoɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45"/>Israelfoɔ no firii Misraim no, yeinom ne akwankyerɛ, mmara ne ahyɛdeɛ a Mose de maa wɔn <verse eid="DEU 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46"/>ɛberɛ a wɔduruu bɔnhwa a ɛbɛn Bet-Peor a ɛda Asubɔnten Yordan apueeɛ fam. Kane no, na Amorifoɔ na wɔte asase yi so ɛberɛ a wɔn ɔhene Sihon a ɔfiri Hesbon di adeɛ. Mose ne Israelfoɔ firi Misraim ɛreba no, wɔsɛe ɔhene yi ne nkurɔfoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47"/>Wɔfaa nʼasase no sane faa Basanhene Og asase nso kaa ho. Saa ahemfo baanu yi na wɔyɛ Amorifoɔ ahemfo a wɔte Yordan apueeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48"/>Saa asase yi na ɛfiri Aroer a ɛda Arnon subɔnhwa ano kɔsi Sion bepɔ, a wɔfrɛ no Hermon no ho. <verse eid="DEU 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49"/>Israelfoɔ no sane faa nsaase a ɛfiri Araba ɛpo no ano kɔsi bepɔ Pisga ase.<verse eid="DEU 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmaransɛm Edu No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1"/>Mose frɛɛ Israelfoɔ nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:1">Montie mmara ne ahyɛdeɛ a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ no yie. Monsua na monni so. <verse eid="DEU 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2"/>Ɛberɛ a yɛwɔ Horeb no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn ne yɛn yɛɛ apam bi. <verse eid="DEU 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3"/>Ɛnyɛ yɛn agyanom na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne wɔn yɛɛ apam tete no, na mmom, ɔne yɛn a yɛte ase ɛnnɛ yi na ɛyɛeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo kasaa animuanimu firi ogyaframa no mu. <verse eid="DEU 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5"/>Megyinaa mo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ntam, ɛfiri sɛ, na mosuro ogya no enti, moamforo bepɔ no. Ɔkasa kyerɛɛ me na me nso mekaa nsɛm a ɔkaeɛ no kyerɛɛ mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:5">Nsɛm a ɔkaeɛ no nie:<verse eid="DEU 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6"/>“Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn a meyii mo firii nkoasom wɔ Misraim no.<verse eid="DEU 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7"/>“Monnsom onyame foforɔ biara nka me ho.<verse eid="DEU 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8"/>Monnyɛ ohoni anaa biribiara a ɛsɛ adeɛ a ɛwɔ ewiem, anaa deɛ ɛwɔ asase so, anaa deɛ ɛwɔ nsuo mu, anaa deɛ ɛwɔ asase ase. <verse eid="DEU 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9"/>Monnkoto ohoni biara nsom no ɛkwan biara so, na me, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn, meyɛ ninkunfoɔ. Na me ne onyame foforɔ bi nkyɛ mo dɔ a modɔ me no. Na sɛ nnipa bi bɔne a wayɛ enti metwe wɔn aso a, metwe wɔn aso kɔsi wɔn awontoatoasoɔ a wɔtan me no nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10"/>Na medɔ awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ mpem a wɔdɔ me na wɔdi mʼahyɛdeɛ so.<verse eid="DEU 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11"/>Mommmɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn din basabasa. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, ɔbɛbu mo fɔ.<verse eid="DEU 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12"/>Monkae homeda na monni no sɛ ɛda kronkron, sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13"/>Nnansia na momfa nyɛ mo nnwuma nyinaa, <verse eid="DEU 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14"/>na ɛda a ɛtɔ so nson no yɛ homeda ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn. Saa ɛda no, ɛnsɛ sɛ moyɛ adwuma biara; ɛnsɛ sɛ mo mmammarima, mo mmabaa anaa mo asomfoɔ anaa mo anantwie ne mo afunumu anaa mo ahɔhoɔ yɛ adwuma biara. <verse eid="DEU 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15"/>Monkae sɛ berɛ bi a atwam no na moyɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, nam anwanwa tumi ne tumi nnwuma so na ɔyii mo firii hɔ. Ɛno enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn hyɛ mo sɛ monni homeda no.<verse eid="DEU 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16"/>Di wʼagya ne wo maame ni sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, hyɛ mo no. Na ɛbɛma wo nkwa nna aware wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Onyankopɔn de bɛma wo no so.<verse eid="DEU 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17"/>Nni awu.<verse eid="DEU 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18"/>Nsɛe awadeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19"/>Mmɔ korɔno<verse eid="DEU 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20"/>Nni wo yɔnko ho adansekurumu<verse eid="DEU 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21"/>Mma wʼani mmere wo yɔnko yere. Mma wʼani mmere wo yɔnko fie anaa nʼasase anaa nʼakoa anaa nʼafenawa, ne nʼanantwie, nʼafunumu anaa biribiara a ɛyɛ wo yɔnko dea.”<verse eid="DEU 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de nne kɛseɛ a ɛfiri ogyaframa no mu ka kyerɛɛ mo firii omununkum a esum kabii atwa ho ahyia mu. Nsɛm a ɔkaeɛ ara ni na ɔtwerɛɛ ne nsɛm no guu aboɔ ɛpono mmienu so na ɔde maa me.<verse eid="DEU 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23"/>Motee nne no firii esum mu ɛberɛ a bepɔ no ogya redɛre framfram no, mmusuakuo mu ntuanofoɔ no nyinaa baa me nkyɛn. <verse eid="DEU 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24"/>Wɔkaa sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn, akyerɛ yɛn nʼanimuonyam ne ne tumi na yɛate ne nne afiri ogya mu. Ɛnnɛ, yɛahunu sɛ, sɛ Onyankopɔn ne onipa kasa koraa a, onipa tumi tena ase. <verse eid="DEU 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25"/>Na afei, adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ yɛwuwu? Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn, kasa kyerɛ yɛn bio a, akyinnyeɛ biara nni ho sɛ yɛbɛwuwu na ogya no ahye yɛn pasaa. <verse eid="DEU 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26"/>Enti, ɔkra teasefoɔ bɛtumi ate Onyankopɔn teasefoɔ no nne afiri ogyaframa no mu na watena ase anaa? <verse eid="DEU 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27"/>Wo, kɔ na kɔtie deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn no ka. Na afei, bra na bɛka biribiara a ɔka kyerɛɛ wo no kyerɛ yɛn, na yɛbɛtie na yɛadi so.”<verse eid="DEU 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tee mo nne ɛberɛ a mokasa kyerɛɛ me no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Mate nsɛm a nnipa ka kyerɛɛ wo no. Nsɛm a wɔkaaeɛ no nyinaa yɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29"/>Ao, sɛ daa wɔbɛnya akoma sɛdeɛ ɛbɛma wɔasuro me na wɔadi mʼahyɛdeɛ nyinaa so a, anka ɛbɛyɛ ama wɔn ne wɔn asefoɔ nyinaa afebɔɔ.<verse eid="DEU 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30"/>“Kɔ na kɔka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, wɔnsane mmra wɔn ntomadan mu. <verse eid="DEU 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31"/>Nanso, wo deɛ, wo ne me ntena ha sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mɛtumi de me nhyɛ ne me mmara ama wo. Wobɛkyerɛkyerɛ nnipa no sɛdeɛ wɔbɛtie wɔ asase a mede rema wɔn no so sɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32"/>Enti, Mose ka kyerɛɛ nnipa no sɛ, “Monyɛ ɔsetie mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ahyɛdeɛ nyinaa, na monni ne nkyerɛkyerɛ so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33"/>Akwan a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ahyɛ mo sɛ monnante so no so, monnante so. Na moatena ase nna tenten na asi mo yie wɔ asase a morebɛkɔ akɔtena so no so.”<verse eid="DEU 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Dɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Wo Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1"/>Yeinom ne ahyɛdeɛ, mmara ne nhyehyɛeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ menkyerɛ mo na monni so wɔ asase a moretwa Yordan akɔtena so no, <verse eid="DEU 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2"/>sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mo, mo mma ne wɔn mma bɛsuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn mmerɛ dodoɔ a mote ase. Sɛ modi ne mmara ne nʼahyɛdeɛ nyinaa so a, mo nkwa nna bɛware. <verse eid="DEU 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3"/>Montie, Ao Israel, na monhwɛ yie nni so sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɛbɛsi mo yie na mo ase atrɛ yie wɔ asase a nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ resene wɔ so sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo agyanom Onyankopɔn, hyɛɛ mo ho bɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4"/>Tie, Ao Israel, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn yɛ Awurade koro. <verse eid="DEU 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5"/>Dɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Onyankopɔn firi wʼakoma mu nyinaa ne wo kra nyinaa mu ne wʼahoɔden nyinaa mu. <verse eid="DEU 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6"/>Momma saa mmaransɛm a mede rema wo ɛnnɛ yi ntena mo akoma mu. <verse eid="DEU 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7"/>Momfa nhyɛ mo mma mu. Sɛ mowɔ fie anaa monam ɛkwan so, sɛ moda hɔ anaa mosɔre anɔpa a, monkyerɛkyerɛ wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8"/>Monkyekyere no sɛ agyinahyɛdeɛ mmɔ mo nsa na momfa bi mmɔ abotire. <verse eid="DEU 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9"/>Montwerɛ ngu mo fie aponnwa ne mo aboboanopono ho.<verse eid="DEU 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10"/>Ɛrenkyɛre biara, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de mo bɛba asase a ɔkaa ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma mo agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob no. Ɛyɛ asase a animuonyam nkuropɔn a ɛnyɛ mo na mokyekyereeɛ ahyɛ so ma. <verse eid="DEU 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11"/>Wɔde nneɛma pa a ɛnyɛ mo na moyɛeɛ bɛhyɛ no ma. Mobɛto nsuo afiri abura a ɛnyɛ mo na motuiɛ mu, na mobɛdidi afiri turo a ɛnyɛ mo na moyɛeɛ mu ne ngo nnua a ɛnyɛ mo na moduaeɛ. Sɛ modidi mee wɔ saa asase yi so wie a, <verse eid="DEU 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12"/>monhwɛ yie na mo werɛ amfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔgyee mo firii nkoasom mu Misraim asase so no.<verse eid="DEU 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mosuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na mosom ɔno nko ara. Ne din nko ara na momfa nka ntam. <verse eid="DEU 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14"/>Monnni anyame foforɔ akyi—anyame a wɔyɛ nnipa a wɔatwa mo ho ahyia no dea; <verse eid="DEU 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15"/>na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn a ɔwɔ mo ntam no yɛ Onyankopɔn ninkunfoɔ a nʼabufuhyeɛ no bɛhye mo na ɔbɛsɛe mo afiri asase so. <verse eid="DEU 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16"/>Monnsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, nhwɛ sɛdeɛ moyɛeɛ ɛberɛ a na mowɔ Masa no. <verse eid="DEU 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ modi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ahyɛdeɛ so pɛpɛɛpɛ—monni mmara no mu nsɛm nyinaa so sɛdeɛ ɔde ama mo no. <verse eid="DEU 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18"/>Monyɛ deɛ ɛtene na ɛyɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so na biribiara awie mo yie. Na moakɔ akɔtena asase pa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ ho bɔ kyerɛɛ mo agyanom no. <verse eid="DEU 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19"/>Mobɛpam atamfoɔ a wɔte mo asase no so nyinaa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ ɔbɛyɛ no.<verse eid="DEU 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20"/>Daakye bi, mo mma bɛbisa mo sɛ, “Saa mmara ne nʼahyɛdeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn de ama yɛn yi aseɛ ne sɛn?” <verse eid="DEU 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21"/>Monka nkyerɛ wɔn sɛ “Na yɛyɛ Farao nkoa wɔ Misraim, nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam anwanwatumi so yii yɛn firii Misraim. <verse eid="DEU 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22"/>Yɛhunuu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ nnwuma a ɔyɛ tiaa Misraim, Farao ne ne nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23"/>Ɔyii yɛn firii Misraim sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔbɛtumi de asase a wahyɛ yɛn agyanom ho bɔ no ama yɛn. <verse eid="DEU 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn hyɛɛ yɛn sɛ yɛnni mmara no nyinaa so na yɛmfa obuo ne anidie mma no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛma daakye asi yɛn yie sɛdeɛ ɛte ɛnnɛ yi. <verse eid="DEU 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, sɛ yɛdi mmara no nyinaa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn, de ama yɛn no so a, ɛbɛma yɛayɛ ateneneefoɔ.”<verse eid="DEU 6:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔpam Amanaman No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de mo ba asase a morebɛkɔ akɔtena so no so a, ɔbɛpam amanaman pii a wɔwɔ mo anim no a wɔyɛ Hetifoɔ, Girgasifoɔ, Amorifoɔ, Kanaanfoɔ, Perisifoɔ, Hewifoɔ ne Yebusifoɔ. Yeinom yɛ aman nson a wɔsoso na wɔyɛ den sen mo. <verse eid="DEU 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de saa aman yi hyɛ mo nsa na modi wɔn so a, monsɛe wɔn pasapasa. Mo ne wɔn nnhyehyɛ apam biara na monnhunu wɔn mmɔbɔ. <verse eid="DEU 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3"/>Mo ne wɔn nni awadeɛ na mommma mo mmammaa ne mo mmammarima nnware wɔn mmammarima ne wɔn mmammaa. <verse eid="DEU 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔakɔsom wɔn anyame foforɔ. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo bɛhuru atia mo na wasɛe mo. <verse eid="DEU 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5"/>Deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ wɔn ne sɛ, mommubu wɔn afɔrebukyia na monnwiri wɔn abosom adum no ngu. Montwitwa wɔn abosompɔ ngu na monhye wɔn ahoni. <verse eid="DEU 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6"/>Na moyɛ nnipa kronkron a moyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn dea. Nnipa a wɔwɔ asase so nyinaa, mo na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ayi mo sɛ nʼagyapadeɛ sononko.<verse eid="DEU 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7"/>Ɛnyɛ sɛ modɔɔso sene nnipa a aka no enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anya mo ho dɔ no, na mo na mosua koraa wɔ nnipa no nyinaa mu. <verse eid="DEU 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8"/>Na mmom, ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dɔ a ɔdɔ mo, ne ne ntam a ɔdii so no: ntam a ɔka kyerɛɛ mo agyanom sɛ ɔde ne nsa a tumi wɔ mu no bɛyi mo afiri nkoasom asase so ne Misraimhene Farao tumi ase no. <verse eid="DEU 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9"/>Monhunu sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn yɛ Onyankopɔn; ɔyɛ nokorɛ Onyankopɔn a ɔdi ne dɔ apam so kɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ apem a wɔdɔ no na wɔdi nʼahyɛdeɛ so. <verse eid="DEU 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10"/>Nanso, ɔntwentwɛn na ɔsɛe. Ɔtwe wɔn a wɔmpɛ nʼasɛm aso, sɛe wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11"/>Ɛno enti, monni ahyɛdeɛ ne mmara a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi nyinaa so.<verse eid="DEU 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12"/>Sɛ motie mmara yi na modi ne nyinaa so nokorɛm a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, nso bɛdi nʼapam a ɔfiri ne nokorɛ dɔ mu ne mo agyanom pameeɛ no so. <verse eid="DEU 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13"/>Ɔbɛdɔ mo na wahyira mo na wayɛ mo ɔman kɛseɛ. Ɔbɛma mo awo mma bebree na wama mo asase adɔre na mo nyɛmmoa ase ayɛ bebree. Sɛ moduru asase a ɔhyɛɛ ho bɔ sɛ ɔde bɛma mo agyanom no so a, mobɛnya aburoo, nsã, ngo, anantwie, nnwan ne mpɔnkye bebree. <verse eid="DEU 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14"/>Wɔbɛhyira mo aboro aman a wɔwɔ asase so nyinaa so. Mo mmarima renyɛ saadwe, na mo mmaa nso renyɛ abonini, na mo nyɛmmoa nso bɛwowo. <verse eid="DEU 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ mo ho ban afiri yadeɛ nyinaa ho. Ɔremma owuyadeɛ a ebi bɔɔ mo wɔ Misraim no bi mmɔ mo, na ɔde saa yadeɛ no nyinaa bɛma mo atamfoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16"/>Monsɛe aman a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de bɛhyɛ mo nsa no nyinaa. Monnhunu wɔn mmɔbɔ na monnsom wɔn anyame. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, ɛbɛsum mo afidie.<verse eid="DEU 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17"/>Mobɛbisa mo ho sɛ, “Na sɛ saa aman yi yɛ den kyɛn yɛn a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na yɛatumi apamo wɔn?” <verse eid="DEU 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18"/>Nanso, monnsuro wɔn. Monkae adeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de yɛɛ Farao ne ne manfoɔ nyinaa wɔ Misraim. <verse eid="DEU 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19"/>Mode mo ankasa mo ani hunuu amanehunu, nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛyɛ hu ne anwanwasɛm a ɛbaa wɔn so. Mohunuu tumi nsa ne abasa a wɔatrɛ mu a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, nam so yii mo firii hɔ no. Nnipa a mosuro wɔn seesei no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn de wɔn bɛfa saa ɛkwan korɔ no ara so. <verse eid="DEU 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20"/>Ɛno akyi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛma mmɔborɔ abɛpam kakra a aka no afiri wɔn atɛeɛ mu kɔsi sɛ wɔn ase bɛhye. <verse eid="DEU 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21"/>Monnsuro saa aman no, ɛfiri sɛ, Awurade, mo Onyankopɔn, a ɔso na ne ho yɛ nwanwa no wɔ mo afa. <verse eid="DEU 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22"/>Nkakrankakra, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛpamo saa aman no adi mo anim ɛkan. Ɔrenyi wɔn nyinaa mfiri hɔ prɛko pɛ; anyɛ saa a, nkekaboa no ase bɛdɔre ntɛm na wɔaba mo so. <verse eid="DEU 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23"/>Nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn de wɔn bɛhyɛ mo nsa, na ɔbɛma wɔn adwene ayɛ basabasa kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛsɛe wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24"/>Ɔde wɔn ahemfo bɛhyɛ mo nsa na mobɛpepa wɔn din afiri ɔsoro ase. Obiara rentumi nsɔre ntia mo; mobɛsɛe wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25"/>Wɔn anyame ahoni no, momfa ogya nhye wɔn. Mommma mo ani mmere ɛso dwetɛ anaa sikakɔkɔɔ no, na mommfa nto mo ho na anyɛ afidie anyi mo, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, akyiwadeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26"/>Mommfa akyiwadeɛ biara mma mo fie, na moankɔyɛ nnome sɛ saa nneɛma no, na amma wɔansɛe mo. Ɛsɛ sɛ mokyi saa nneɛma no korakora, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ abusudeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 7:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Mma Wo Werɛ Mfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1"/>Monhwɛ yie na monni mmara a merehyɛ ama mo ɛnnɛ yi so, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mobɛtena ase na moadɔɔso na moakɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa ntam de hyɛɛ mo agyanom bɔ no na moatena so. <verse eid="DEU 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2"/>Monkae sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn dii mo anim faa ɛserɛ so mfeɛ aduanan, nam so brɛɛ mo ase de sɔɔ mo suban hwɛeɛ sɛ mobɛdi ne mmara so anaasɛ morenni so no. <verse eid="DEU 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3"/>Nokorɛm, ɔmaa ɛkɔm dee mo nam so brɛɛ mo ase, ɛnna ɔmaa mo mana, aduane a na anka mo ne mo agyanom nnii bi da. Ɔyɛɛ saa de kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, ɛnyɛ aduane nko ara na ɛho hia onipa wɔ nʼasetena mu, na mmom, deɛ ɛhia titire ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm. <verse eid="DEU 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4"/>Mfeɛ aduanan yi nyinaa mu, mo ntadeɛ antete, na mo nan ammɔ mpumpunnya na anhonhono nso. <verse eid="DEU 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5"/>Enti, deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ mohunu ne sɛ, sɛdeɛ ɔbaatan tea ne ba no, saa ara nso na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn tea mo de boa mo.<verse eid="DEU 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6"/>Monni <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ahyɛdeɛ so na monnante nʼakwan so na momfa anidie mma no. <verse eid="DEU 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, mo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de mo rekɔ asase pa so—asase a asutene, mmura ne nsutire resene wɔ bɔnhwa ne mmepɔ mu; <verse eid="DEU 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8"/>asase a atokoɔ, ayuo, bobe, borɔdɔma, ateaa, ngo dua ne ɛwoɔ wɔ so. <verse eid="DEU 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9"/>Ɛyɛ asase a aduane abu wɔ so a biribiara wɔ so; ɛyɛ asase a fagudeɛ dadeɛ abu so te sɛ aboɔ, na sumpii nso nyɛ na wɔ ne mmepɔ mu.<verse eid="DEU 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10"/>Sɛ modidi mee a, monhyira <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn wɔ asase pa a ɔde ama mo no enti. <verse eid="DEU 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11"/>Nanso, monhwɛ yie na mo werɛ amfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn a morenni ne mmara ne nʼahyɛdeɛ a merehyɛ mo ɛnnɛ yi so. <verse eid="DEU 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12"/>Anyɛ saa a, sɛ modidi na momee na mosisi mo afie fɛfɛ, na mokɔtena mu <verse eid="DEU 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13"/>na mo anantwie ne nnwan ase dɔre, na monya dwetɛ ne sika pii, na mo agyapadeɛ nyinaa dɔɔso <verse eid="DEU 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14"/>a, saa ɛberɛ no na ɛsɛ sɛ mohwɛ yie. Monnyɛ ahomasoɔ na mommma mo werɛ mfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn a ɔyii mo firii Misraim nkoasom asase so no. <verse eid="DEU 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15"/>Mommma mo werɛ mfiri sɛ ɔno na ɔdii mo anim yii mo firii ɛserɛ a na ɛso yɛ hu so. Ɔno na ɔyii mo firii asase a ɛso yɛ hye, a awɔ ne anyanyankyerɛ a wɔn ano wɔ borɔ wɔ so no so. Ɔmaa mo nsuo firi ɔbotan mu. <verse eid="DEU 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16"/>Ɔmaa mo mana aduane a mo agyanom nnim diiɛ wɔ ɛserɛ so. Ɔyɛɛ yei de brɛɛ mo ase, de sɔɔ mo hwɛeɛ wɔ mo ankasa yiedie mu. <verse eid="DEU 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17"/>Ɔyɛɛ saa de kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ modwene sɛ mo ahonya no firi mo ankasa mo ahoɔden mu. <verse eid="DEU 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18"/>Daa monkae sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn a ɔma mo tumi ma moyɛ adefoɔ no, ɔyɛ saa de dii apam a ɔne mo agyanom hyɛeɛ no so.<verse eid="DEU 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19"/>Na mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, sɛ mo werɛ firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na mokɔdi anyame foforɔ akyi, som wɔn, koto wɔn a, sɛeɛ na wɔbɛsɛe mo. <verse eid="DEU 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20"/>Sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛe amanaman a na wɔwɔ mo anim no, mo nso sɛ moantie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn a, saa ara na wɔbɛsɛe mo.<verse eid="DEU 8:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Israel Nkonimdie Firi Onyankopɔn Adom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1"/>Ao Israel, montie! Morekɔtwa Yordan na moawura mu akɔgye aman a ɛsoso na wɔwɔ ahoɔden kyɛn mo na wɔwɔ nkuropɔn akɛseɛ na wɔn afasuo kɔka sorosoro no agyapadeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2"/>Nnipa no wɔ ahoɔden na wɔwoware—Anakfoɔ. Moate wɔn nka na moate sɛ wɔka sɛ, “Hwan na ɔbɛtumi ne Anakfoɔ agyina?” <verse eid="DEU 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3"/>Nanso, merehyɛ mo ase ɛnnɛ sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn na ɔredi mo anim te sɛ ogya dɛreɛ a ɛresɛe adeɛ. Ɔbɛsɛe wɔn. Ɔbɛbrɛ wɔn ase wɔ mo anim. Na moapam wɔn na moatɔre wɔn ase ntɛm pa ara sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ mo bɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4"/>Sɛ Awurade, mo Onyankopɔn, tu wɔn gu a, monnka no wɔ mo akoma mu sɛ, “Esiane yɛn tenenee enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de saa asase yi ama yɛn.” Dabi. Esiane sɛ aman no yɛ amumuyɛfoɔ no enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> reyɛ saa. <verse eid="DEU 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5"/>Ɛnyɛ sɛ moyɛ ateneneefoɔ ne nokwafoɔ no enti na morekɔfa wɔn asase no. Esiane wɔn amumuyɛ enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛpamo saa aman yi adi mo anim de akyerɛ sɛ, wadi ntam a ɔka kyerɛɛ mo agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob no so. <verse eid="DEU 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6"/>Meka bio sɛ, ɛnyɛ sɛ moyɛ teneneefoɔ enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de saa asase pa yi rema mo. Ɛnte saa. Moyɛ ɔman a asoɔden ahyɛ mo ma.<verse eid="DEU 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sikakɔkɔɔ Nantwie Ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7"/>Monkae yei na mommma mo werɛ mfiri sɛdeɛ mohyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn Abufuo wɔ ɛserɛ so hɔ no. Ɛfiri ɛberɛ a motu firii Misraim bɛsi sɛ moduruu ha yi, moate <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim atua. <verse eid="DEU 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8"/>Mohyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo wɔ Horeb a anka ɔpɛ sɛ ɔsɛe mo. <verse eid="DEU 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9"/>Mekɔɔ bepɔ no so sɛ merekɔgye aboɔ twerɛpono a na wɔatwerɛ apam a na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo apam no agu so no, metenaa hɔ nnafua aduanan. Mannidi na mannom. <verse eid="DEU 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de apam a ɛwɔ aboɔ twerɛpono so a Onyankopɔn ankasa atwerɛ so nsɛm maa me. Ɔfiri ogya a ɛwɔ bepɔ no so no mu na ɔde maa me.<verse eid="DEU 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11"/>Na adaduanan awia ne anadwo no baa awieeɛ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de aboɔ ɛpono mmienu a wɔatwerɛ apam no wɔ so no maa me. <verse eid="DEU 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Siane firi ha ntɛm kɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa a wodii wɔn anim firi Misraim no adane abɔnefoɔ. Wɔamane afiri ɛkwan a mehyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔntena ase no so dada, na wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ ayɛ ohoni afa.”<verse eid="DEU 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Mahwɛ saa nnipa yi ara ahunu sɛ, wɔn aso yɛ den pa ara. <verse eid="DEU 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14"/>Ma me ɛkwan na mensɛe na mempepa wɔn din mfiri ɔsoro ase. Na menam so mayɛ wʼasefoɔ ɔman kɛseɛ; ɔman a ɛso na ɛwɔ ahoɔden sene sɛdeɛ ɛte ɛnnɛ yi.”<verse eid="DEU 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15"/>Enti, mesiane firii ogya bepɔ no so a aboɔ apono mmienu a apam no wɔ so no kura me. <verse eid="DEU 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16"/>Mʼase hɔ no, mehunuu sikakɔkɔɔ nantwie ba a mofiri mo bɔne kɛseɛ mu ayɛ atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. Ankyɛre koraa na modane firii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɛkwan a ɔkyerɛɛ mo sɛ momfa so no so. <verse eid="DEU 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17"/>Enti, mepagyaa boɔ apono no kɔɔ soro ɛnna meto hwee fam. Mebubuu no wɔ mo anim.<verse eid="DEU 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18"/>Afei, medaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim awia ne anadwo adaduanan a manni burodo. Mannom nsuo. Meyɛɛ yei, ɛfiri sɛ moyɛɛ adeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyi, na ɛnam so maa ne bo fuu yie. <verse eid="DEU 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19"/>Mesuro maa mo, ɛfiri sɛ, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔbɛsɛe mo. Nanso, ɔtiee me bio. <verse eid="DEU 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuu Aaron ara kɔsii sɛ anka ɔpɛ sɛ ɔsɛe no. Nanso, mebɔɔ mpaeɛ maa Aaron nso. <verse eid="DEU 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21"/>Mefaa mo bɔne no, nantwie ba a moayɛ no, na menanee no wɔ ogya mu yamoo no muhumuhu. Metoo ne mfuturo no guu asuwa a ɛtene firi bepɔ no so no mu.<verse eid="DEU 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22"/>Mohyɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo wɔ Tabera, Masa ne Kibrot-Hataawa nso.<verse eid="DEU 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23"/>Kades-Barnea nso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa mo wɔ saa ɔhyɛ yi so sɛ, “Monkɔ soro hɔ nkɔfa asase a mede ama mo no”. Nanso, motiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ahyɛdeɛ no na moamfa mo ho anto no so antie nʼasɛm. <verse eid="DEU 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24"/>Aane, ɛfiri sɛ mehunuu mo no, daa mosɔre tia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="DEU 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25"/>Ɛno enti na ɛberɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sii nʼadwene pi sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔsɛe mo no, mekɔdaa nʼanim awia ne anadwo nnafua aduanan no. <verse eid="DEU 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26"/>Mebɔɔ mpaeɛ kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ, “Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, nsɛe wo ɔman ne wʼagyapadeɛ a wode wo kɛseyɛ agye asi hɔ na wode wo nsa a ɛyɛ den ayi wɔn afiri Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27"/>Yi wʼani firi saa nnipa asoɔdenfoɔ yi so na kae wʼasomfoɔ Abraham, Isak ne Yakob. <verse eid="DEU 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28"/>Sɛ wosɛe saa nnipa yi a, Misraimfoɔ bɛka sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wantumi amfa wɔn ankɔ asase a ɔkaa ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma wɔn no so. Anaasɛ nso, wɔbɛka sɛ, ɔsɛee wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔtan wɔn; ɔde wɔn baa ɛserɛ so sɛ ɔrekɔkunkum wɔn.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29"/>Nanso, wɔyɛ wo nkurɔfoɔ ne wʼagyapadeɛ a wonam tumi a ɛso ne wʼabasa a wama soɔ so yii wɔn.”<verse eid="DEU 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Aboɔ Ɛpono Foforɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Twa aboɔ ɛpono no mmienu te sɛ kane deɛ no na foro bra me nkyɛn wɔ bepɔ no so. Afei, yɛ dua adaka a wobɛkora wɔ mu. <verse eid="DEU 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2"/>Mɛtwerɛ nsɛm a metwerɛ guu aboɔ ɛpono mmienu a ɛdi ɛkan a wobubuu mu no bi pɛpɛɛpɛ agu so. Na wode ahyɛ adaka no mu.”<verse eid="DEU 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3"/>Na mede dua okuo yɛɛ adaka, senee aboɔ ɛpono mmienu sɛ kane deɛ no, na meforoo bepɔ no a apono mmienu no kura me nsam. <verse eid="DEU 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> twerɛɛ Mmaransɛm Edu no a ɔdii ɛkan twerɛ firii ogya mu wɔ bepɔ no so wɔ mo nhyiamu ase no guu apono no so. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de maa me. <verse eid="DEU 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5"/>Na mesiane firii bepɔ no so na mede aboɔ apono no bɛhyɛɛ adaka a meyɛeɛ no mu sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ me sɛ menyɛ no, na ɛwɔ hɔ bɛsi ɛnnɛ.<verse eid="DEU 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6"/>Na Israelfoɔ tu firii Beerot-Bene-Yaakan kɔɔ Mosera. Ɛhɔ na Aaron wuiɛ na wɔsiee no. Aaron babarima Eleasa sii nʼanan mu, dii ɔsɔfoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7"/>Wɔfiri hɔ no, wɔtu kɔɔ Gudgod. Wɔfiri Gudgod hɔ no, wɔkɔɔ Yotbata, asase a nsuo abu so wɔ so. <verse eid="DEU 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8"/>Ɛhɔ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii Lewifoɔ abusuakuo sɛ wɔnsoa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apam adaka no na wɔnnyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim nsom no na wɔmfa ne din so nhyira. Yeinom da so yɛ wɔn nnwuma de bɛsi ɛnnɛ. <verse eid="DEU 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9"/>Ne saa enti na Lewifoɔ no nni agyapadeɛ a wɔnya mu mfasodeɛ wɔ Israelfoɔ mmusuakuo mu no. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no ankasa ne wɔn agyapadeɛ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no.<verse eid="DEU 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10"/>Sɛdeɛ maka dada no, metenaa bepɔ no so <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim adaduanan awia ne anadwo ne mprenu so. Na bio, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tiee me sufrɛ enti, wansɛe mo. <verse eid="DEU 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Sɔre na di ɔmanfoɔ no anim fa wɔn kɔ asase a mekaa ntam sɛ mede bɛma wɔn agyanom no so na wɔmfa no sɛ agyapadeɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Monsuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12"/>Enti Israel, ɛdeɛn na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, hwehwɛ afiri mo nkyɛn? Ɔhwehwɛ sɛ mosuro no na moyɛ nʼapɛdeɛ, na mode mo akoma ne mo kra nyinaa dɔ no na mosom no, <verse eid="DEU 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13"/>na modi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛdeɛ ne ne mmara a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi so, na asi mo yie.<verse eid="DEU 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14"/>Ɔsorosoro mu soro ne asase ne deɛ ɛwɔ mu nyinaa yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn, dea. <verse eid="DEU 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15"/>Nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii mo agyanom sɛ ne dɔ nhwɛsodeɛ. Na ɔyii mo a moyɛ wɔn asefoɔ gyaa ɔman biara sɛdeɛ ɛte ɛnnɛ yi. <verse eid="DEU 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16"/>Ɛno enti, momma wɔnte mo akoma mu na monnyae asoɔden no. <verse eid="DEU 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn yɛ ahene mu hene ne anyame mu nyame. Ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn kokuroko, otumfoɔ ne ɔnwanwani a ɔnkyea nʼaso na ɔnnye adanmudeɛ nso. <verse eid="DEU 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18"/>Ɔbu nwisiaa ne akunafoɔ atɛntenenee. Ɔda ne dɔ adi kyerɛ ahɔhoɔ a wɔte mo mu. Ɔma wɔn aduane ne ntoma. <verse eid="DEU 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19"/>Mo nso, ɛsɛ sɛ modɔ ahɔhoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, mo nso ɛberɛ bi na moyɛ ahɔhoɔ wɔ Misraim asase so. <verse eid="DEU 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ modi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ni na mosom no, na moka mo ho bata ne ho. Monka ntam wɔ ne din nko ara mu. <verse eid="DEU 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21"/>Ɔyɛ mo Onyankopɔn a ɛsɛ sɛ mokamfo no. Ɔno na wayɛ anwanwadeɛ akɛseɛ a mo nyinaa ahunu bi. <verse eid="DEU 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22"/>Ɛberɛ a mo agyanom siane kɔɔ Misraim no, na wɔn dodoɔ yɛ aduɔson. Nanso afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn ama moadɔre te sɛ ɔsoro nsoromma.<verse eid="DEU 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Dɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Na Tie No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1"/>Dɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Onyankopɔn na di nʼapɛdeɛ, ne mmara ne nʼahyɛdeɛ so berɛ nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2"/>Montie ɛnnɛ sɛ, ɛnyɛ mo mma na wɔnyaa osuahunu hunuu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ntenesoɔ, ne tumi, ne basa kɛseɛ, ne nsa a watene mu, <verse eid="DEU 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3"/>nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɔyɛeɛ ne nneɛma a wɔyɛɛ wɔ Misraim pɛɛ maa ebi kaa Misraimhene Farao ne ɔman mu no nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4"/>Wɔanhunu dwuma a mo Onyankopɔn dii Misraim asraafoɔ, wɔn apɔnkɔ ne wɔn nteaseɛnam, anaa sɛdeɛ ɔmaa Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ yiri faa wɔn ɛberɛ a wɔtaa mo no ne sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee wɔn ɛberɛ a wɔtaa mo no ne sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee wɔn de bɛsi ɛnnɛ yi. <verse eid="DEU 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5"/>Wɔanhunu sɛdeɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hwɛ mo so yie wɔ ɛserɛ so hɔ kɔsii sɛ mobɛduruu ha. <verse eid="DEU 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6"/>Na wɔnni hɔ enti, wɔanhunu deɛ wɔde yɛɛ Eliab a ɔyɛ Ruben aseni mma Datan ne Abiram ɛberɛ a wɔyɛɛ bɔne na asase mu bue menee wɔn ne wɔn afie ne wɔn ntomadan ne biribiara a na nkwa wɔ mu a ɛyɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7"/>Na mode mo ani ahunu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tumi nnwuma a ɔyɛeɛ nyinaa.<verse eid="DEU 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8"/>Monni mmara a merehyɛ ama mo ɛnnɛ yi so sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mobɛnya ahoɔden akɔfa asase a morebɛtwa Yordan akɔ so akɔfa yi, <verse eid="DEU 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9"/>na mo nna aware asase a nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ resene wɔ so a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa ntam kyerɛɛ mo agyanom sɛ ɔde bɛma wɔn ne wɔn asefoɔ no so. <verse eid="DEU 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10"/>Asase a morebɛkɔ so no nte sɛ Misraim asase a mofiri so baeɛ no a na modua mfudeɛ a mode mo nan twa nsuka te sɛ deɛ moredua nhahannuane no. <verse eid="DEU 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11"/>Na asase a moretwa Yordan akɔfa no yɛ mmepɔ mmepɔ ne bɔnhwa a osuo tɔ wɔ hɔ yie <verse eid="DEU 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12"/>a ɛyɛ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, hwɛ so yie. Na daa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ani wɔ so firi afe no ahyɛaseɛ kɔsi nʼawieeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13"/>Sɛ moto mo bo ase tie me mmara a merehyɛ ama mo ɛnnɛ yi na mode mo akoma ne mo kra nyinaa dɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na mosom no a, <verse eid="DEU 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14"/>ɛnneɛ, ɔbɛtɔ osuo ne berɛ mu ama mo na moatumi atwa nnɔbaeɛ de bi ayɛ nsã ne ngo. <verse eid="DEU 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15"/>Ɔbɛma mo ɛserɛ pii na mo anantwie awe na mo nso mobɛdidi amee.<verse eid="DEU 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16"/>Monnnane mo akoma mfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> so nkɔsom anyame foforɔ. <verse eid="DEU 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17"/>Sɛ moyɛ saa a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Abufuo no bɛhuru atia mo. Ɔbɛto ɔsoro mu, agyina osutɔ, na mo nnɔbaetwa ayɛ basaa. Na ntɛm so, mobɛwuwu wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de rema mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18"/>Enti, momma me nsɛm yi ntena mo akoma mu. Momfa nkyekyere mo nsa sɛ nkaedeɛ na momfa mmɔ abotire. <verse eid="DEU 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19"/>Monkyerɛkyerɛ mo mma. Sɛ mowɔ fie anaa monam ɛkwan so, sɛ moda hɔ anaa mosɔre anɔpa a, monkyerɛkyerɛ wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20"/>Montwerɛ ngu mo afie aponnwa ne mo abɔntenpono ho, <verse eid="DEU 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21"/>sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔsoro da so kata asase ani yi, mo ne mo mma ase bɛdɔre wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma mo agyanom no so.<verse eid="DEU 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22"/>Monhwɛ yie na monni mmara a merehyɛ ama mo yi so; monnante <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, akwan so na momfa mo ho mmata ne ho mfa nkyerɛ ɔdɔ a modɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23"/>Ɛwom sɛ aman a wɔwɔ mo asase so yɛ den sen mo deɛ, nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛpamo wɔn nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24"/>Baabiara a mode mo nan bɛtia no, asase no bɛyɛ mo dea. Mo ahyeɛ bɛyɛ ɛfiri ɛserɛ so anafoɔ kɔsi Lebanon wɔ atifi fam de firi Asubɔnten Eufrate wɔ apueeɛ fam kɔsi Ntam Po no fam. <verse eid="DEU 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25"/>Obiara rentumi nsɔre ntia mo, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛto mo ho hu ne mo ho suro adi mo anim sɛdeɛ ɔhyɛɛ mo bɔ no wɔ baabiara a mobɛkɔ wɔ asase no so.<verse eid="DEU 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26"/>Hwɛ, ɛnnɛ mede nhyira ne nnome resi mo anim, <verse eid="DEU 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27"/>Sɛ modi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, mmara a merehyɛ ama mo ɛnnɛ yi so a, ɛbɛyɛ nhyira. <verse eid="DEU 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28"/>Na sɛ mopo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn mmara dane firi nʼakwan a merehyɛ mo ɛnnɛ yi so, kɔsom anyame foforɔ a, ɛbɛyɛ nnome. <verse eid="DEU 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29"/>Na sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de mo duru asase a morekɔ so akɔfa no a, monka nhyira nsɛm mfiri Gerisim Bepɔ no so na monka nnome nsɛm nso mfiri Ebal Bepɔ so. <verse eid="DEU 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30"/>Saa mmepɔ mmienu yi wɔ Asubɔnten Yordan atɔeɛ fam, asase a na Kanaanfoɔ a na wɔte Yordan subɔnhwa a ɛbɛn kuro Gilgal no te hɔ. Na wɔwɔ atɔeɛ fam a ɛbɛn More kwaeɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31"/>Moreyɛ atwa Yordan akɔtena asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo no so. Sɛ mokɔfa saa asase no kɔtena so a, <verse eid="DEU 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32"/>monhwɛ yie na monni mmara ne ahyɛdeɛ a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi so.<verse eid="DEU 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Beaeɛ A <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Ayi Ama Ɔsom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1"/>Yeinom ne mmara ne ahyɛdeɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ modi so, ɛberɛ a mote asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo agyanom Onyankopɔn, de ama mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2"/>Sɛ motu amanaman a wɔtete hɔ no firi hɔ a, ɛsɛ sɛ mosɛe mmeammea a wɔsom wɔn anyame no nyinaa—mmepɔ no atifi, nkokoɔ no atifi ne nnua a ɛyi nhahammono no ase nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3"/>Mommubu wɔn afɔrebukyia nyinaa na monyam wɔn ɔsom adum no. Momfa ogya nhye wɔn abosompɔ na mommobɔ wɔn ahoni a wɔayeyɛ no. Mompepa wɔn ahoni no din mfiri mmeammea hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4"/>Mommfa wɔn akwan no so nsom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="DEU 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5"/>Na mmom, monhwehwɛ baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛyi afiri mo mmusuakuo mu ama mo no na montim ne din hɔ sɛ nʼatenaeɛ. Beaeɛ hɔ na ɛsɛ sɛ mokɔ. <verse eid="DEU 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6"/>Ɛhɔ na momfa mo hyeɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ mmra mmɛbɔ a mo ntotosoɔ dudu, akyɛdeɛ sononko, adeɛ a moaka ho ntam sɛ mode bɛba ne afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛfiri akoma pa mu, mo anantwie ne mo nnwan mu mmakan nso ka ho. <verse eid="DEU 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7"/>Ɛhɔ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn anim, mo ne mo abusuafoɔ bɛdidi na mo ani agye wɔ biribiara a mo nsa aka wɔ hɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ahyira mo.<verse eid="DEU 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8"/>Ɛnnɛ yi, deɛ mopɛ biara na moyɛ, nanso, ɛnyɛ ne kwan ne no, <verse eid="DEU 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9"/>ɛfiri sɛ, monnuruu ahomegyebea a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de rebɛma mo no hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10"/>Ɛrenkyɛre biara, mobɛtwa Asubɔnten Yordan akɔtena asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ agyapadeɛ sononko no so. Sɛ ɔma mo ahomegyeɛ ne banbɔ wɔ mo atamfoɔ ho a, <verse eid="DEU 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11"/>momfa biribiara a mɛhyɛ mo sɛ momfa mmra a ɛyɛ mo ɔhyeɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ, ntotosoɔ dudu, akyɛdeɛ sononko ne mo ɔma ahodoɔ ne mo bɔhyɛ afɔdeɛ. Momfa nkɔ beaeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn bɛyi ama mo a mobɛkamfo ne din wɔ hɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12"/>Mo ne mo mmammarima, mo mmammaa ne mo nkoa nyinaa nnye mo ani wɔ hɔ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim. Na monkae Lewifoɔ a wɔtete mo nkuro so no sɛ, wɔnni asase a ɛyɛ wɔn dea. <verse eid="DEU 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13"/>Monhwɛ yie na moammɔ mo hyeɛ afɔdeɛ wɔ baabiara kwa. <verse eid="DEU 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14"/>Motumi yɛ saa wɔ baabi pɔtee a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi afiri mo mmusua asase bi mu ama mo. Ɛhɔ na motumi bɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ na moyɛ biribiara a mɛhyɛ mo sɛ monyɛ no.<verse eid="DEU 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15"/>Nanso, kuro biara a mopɛ so no, motumi kum mmoa we sɛdeɛ mokum atwe ne adabɔ no. Motumi we ɛnam dodoɔ biara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de bɛma mo. Mo nyinaa, sɛ mo ho te anaa mo ho nte no, motumi we bi. <verse eid="DEU 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16"/>Mmara a ɛbata ho ara ne sɛ, monnni mogya no. Montwa ngu fam te sɛ nsuo. <verse eid="DEU 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ modi mo afɔdeɛ, ntotosoɔ dudu a ɛfiri mo aburoo mu, mo nsã foforɔ ne ngo anaa mo anantwie ne mo nnwan abakan wɔ mo kuro mu. Biribiara a moaka ho ntam sɛ mode bɛma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anaa deɛ mofiri akoma pa mu ahyɛ ho bɔ anaa akyɛdeɛ sononko biara, ɛnsɛ sɛ modi. <verse eid="DEU 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18"/>Mmom, ɛsɛ sɛ modi no wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim wɔ baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛkyerɛ mo no a mo, mo mmammarima ne mo mmammaa mo nkoa ne mo mfenaa ne Lewifoɔ a wɔfiri mo nkuro mu ka mo ho. Monnye mo ani wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn anim wɔ biribiara a mobɛyɛ no ho. <verse eid="DEU 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19"/>Monhwɛ yie na moantwa Lewifoɔ no annya wɔ mmerɛ dodoɔ a mote mo asase so yi.<verse eid="DEU 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, trɛ mo asase mu sɛdeɛ wahyɛ mo ho bɔ no a, ɛnneɛ, mobɛtumi awe ɛnam mmerɛ biara a mopɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21"/>Ɛtumi ba sɛ baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ayi ama mo sɛ monkamfo ne din hɔ no ne mo fie kwan ware. Sɛ ɛba saa a, motumi kum mo anantwie anaa nnwan a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ama mo no bi we ɛnam no wɔ mo fie sɛdeɛ mahyɛ mo no. <verse eid="DEU 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22"/>Obi a ne ho te anaa ne ho nte tumi we ɛnam no bi sɛdeɛ mowe ɔtwe ne ɔdabɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23"/>Mmara a ɛwɔ ho ara ne sɛ, monnni mogya no, ɛfiri sɛ, mogya no yɛ nkwa enti ɛnsɛ sɛ modi nkwa no fra ɛnam no. <verse eid="DEU 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24"/>Mmom, monhwie mogya no ngu fam sɛ nsuo. <verse eid="DEU 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25"/>Monnni mogya no, na asi mo ne mo mma yie, ɛfiri sɛ, moayɛ deɛ ɛsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani.<verse eid="DEU 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26"/>Momfa mo akyɛdeɛ kronkron ne mo bɔhyɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ nkɔ beaeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyerɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mode ɛnam ne mogya a mode bɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ no gu Awurade mo Onyankopɔn no afɔrebukyia so. Mogya a ɛka mo afɔdeɛ foforɔ bi a mobɔ ho no, monhwie ngu <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, afɔrebukyia no nkyɛn nanso motumi we ɛnam no. <verse eid="DEU 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28"/>Monhwɛ yie na monni me mmara so na biribiara bɛkɔ yie ama mo ne mo mma, ɛfiri sɛ, mobɛyɛ deɛ ɛsɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ani.<verse eid="DEU 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, sɛe aman no na mopam wɔn kɔtena wɔn asase no so a, <verse eid="DEU 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30"/>mommma ɛkwan a wɔfa so som wɔn anyame no nyɛ afidie mma mo. Mommmisa sɛ “Ɛkwan bɛn so na saa aman yi fa som wɔn anyame? Yɛpɛ sɛ yɛdi wɔn akyi.” <verse eid="DEU 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31"/>Mommfa saa ɛkwan yi so nsom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn anyame no som mu no, wɔyɛɛ akyiwadeɛ bebree a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mpɛ. Mpo, wɔhyee wɔn mmammarima ne wɔn mmammaa wɔ ogya a wɔde rebɔ afɔdeɛ ama wɔn anyame no mu.<verse eid="DEU 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32"/>Monhwɛ sɛ, deɛ mahyɛ mo no nyinaa mobɛdi so; mommfa bi nka ho na monnyi bi nso mfiri mu.<verse eid="DEU 12:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Ahonisom Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1"/>Sɛ odiyifoɔ anaa obi a ɔnam daeɛso so ka ahintasɛm sɔre wɔ mo mu na ɔka nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛyɛ hu ne anwanwasɛm kyerɛ mo, <verse eid="DEU 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2"/>na sɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ anaa anwanwasɛm no ba mu na ɔka sɛ, “Momma yɛnni anyame foforɔ akyi (anyame a monnim wɔn) na yɛnsom wɔn” a, <verse eid="DEU 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3"/>monntie saa odiyifoɔ anaa ɔdaeɛsofoɔ no nsɛm. <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, resɔ mo ahwɛ sɛ modɔ no firi mo akoma ne mo kra mu nyinaa anaa. <verse eid="DEU 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na ɛsɛ sɛ modi nʼakyi na ɔno na ɛsɛ sɛ mode obuo ne anidie ma no. Monni ne mmara so na monyɛ ɔsetie mma no; monsom no na momfam ne ho den. <verse eid="DEU 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum saa odiyifoɔ anaa ɔdaeɛsofoɔ no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔkasa tia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, a ɔyii mo firii Misraim nkoasom asase no so no; wayere ne ho sɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔtwe mo firi ɛkwan a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ahyɛ sɛ momfa so no so. Ɛsɛ sɛ motutu abɔnefoɔ nyinaa firi mo mu.<verse eid="DEU 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6"/>Sɛ wo nuabarima, wo babarima, wo babaa, wo yere a wodɔ no anaa wʼadamfo pa bi fa sum ase ba wo nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛ wo sɛ, “Momma yɛnkɔsom anyame foforɔ, anyame a wo anaa wʼagyanom nhunuu bi da,” <verse eid="DEU 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7"/>anyame a ɛyɛ nnipa a atwa wo ho ahyia dea, sɛ wɔbɛn anaa wɔwɔ akyiri firi asase ano kɔsi ano no a, <verse eid="DEU 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8"/>mfa wo ho mma no, anaasɛ ntie no. Nhunu no mmɔbɔ. Mfa ne ho nkyɛ no na mmɔ ne ho ban nso. <verse eid="DEU 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9"/>Kum na ɛsɛ sɛ wokum no. Fa wo nsa di ɛkan kum no ansa na nnipa nyinaa de wɔn nsa abɛka ho. <verse eid="DEU 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10"/>Monsi no aboɔ nku no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔtwe wo firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, a ɔyii mo firii Misraim nkoasom asase so no ho. <verse eid="DEU 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11"/>Afei, Israel nyinaa bɛte na wɔasuro na obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛfiri mo mu a, ɔbɛyɛ saa adeɛ no bio.<verse eid="DEU 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12"/>Sɛ ɛba sɛ mote wɔ nkuro a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo no baako so sɛ <verse eid="DEU 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13"/>nnipa bɔnefoɔ bi asɔre wɔ wɔn mu adi nnipa a wɔwɔ kuro no mu anim de wɔn akɔsi bɔne mu aka sɛ, “Momma yɛnkɔsom anyame foforɔ,” anyame a monhunuu bi da a, <verse eid="DEU 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14"/>ɛsɛ sɛ mobisa mu, hwehwɛ mu yie. Na sɛ ɛyɛ nokorɛ na sɛ nhwehwɛmu ada no adi sɛ nnebɔneyɛ bi akɔ so wɔ mo mu a, <verse eid="DEU 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15"/>ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde akofena kunkum wɔn a wɔwɔ kuro no mu nyinaa. Monsɛe kuro no pasapasa, emu nnipa ne afieboa. <verse eid="DEU 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16"/>Afei, mommoaboa asadeɛ no nyinaa ano wɔ kuro no adwabɔeɛ na monhye no. Monhye kuro mu no ne emu nneɛma nyinaa mma ɛnyɛ sɛ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. Saa kuro no nyɛ amamfo daa; ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔsane kyekyere bio. <verse eid="DEU 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17"/>Asadeɛ a wɔde agu nkyɛn sɛ wɔbɛsɛe no no, mommfa bi. Sɛ moyɛ saa a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛdane afiri nʼabufuhyeɛ no ho na wahunu mo mmɔbɔ. Ne yam bɛhyehye no ama mo na wama mo adɔre sɛdeɛ ɔkaa ntam hyɛɛ mo agyanom bɔ no, <verse eid="DEU 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18"/>ɛfiri sɛ, moyɛ ɔsetie ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn, na modi ne mmara a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi so, na moyɛ deɛ ɛsɔ nʼani.<verse eid="DEU 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnuane A Ɛho Teɛ Ne Nea Ɛho Nteɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1"/>Moyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn mma. Ɛno enti mommotabota mo ho anaa monnnyi mo moma so mma awufoɔ, <verse eid="DEU 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2"/>ɛfiri sɛ, moyɛ nnipa kronkron ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. Nnipa a wɔwɔ asase so nyinaa, mo na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi mo sɛ nʼagyapadeɛ a ɛsom bo.<verse eid="DEU 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3"/>Monnni akyiwadeɛ biara. <verse eid="DEU 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4"/>Yeinom ne mmoa a ɛsɛ sɛ mowe: nantwie, odwan, abirekyie <verse eid="DEU 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5"/>ɔforoteɛ, adowa, ɔwansane, eyuo, ɔtwe, ɛkoɔ ne abereɛ. <verse eid="DEU 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6"/>Na monni atɔteboa biara a ne tɔte mu apae mmienu na ɔpu wesa. <verse eid="DEU 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7"/>Nanso, ntɔteboa a wɔpu wesa anaa wɔn tɔte mu apae mmienu koraa mu no, monnwe yoma, adanko ne atwaboa, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔpu wesa deɛ, nanso wɔn tɔte mu mpaeɛ; wɔn ho nte mma mo. <verse eid="DEU 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8"/>Ɔprako nso ho nte. Ɛwom sɛ ne tɔte mu apae deɛ, nanso ɔmpu nwesa. Ɛnsɛ sɛ mowe ne nam anaa mode mo nsa sɔ ne funu mu koraa.<verse eid="DEU 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9"/>Nsuomnam a wɔwɔ tɛtɛ ne abon nyinaa motumi we. <verse eid="DEU 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10"/>Nanso, nsuomnam a wɔnni tɛtɛ ne abon deɛ, monnwe. Wɔn ho nte mma mo.<verse eid="DEU 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11"/>Anomaa biara a ne ho te no, monwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12"/>Nnomaa a ɛnsɛ sɛ mowe nie: ɔkɔdeɛ, opete, asuo so ɔkɔdeɛ, <verse eid="DEU 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13"/>ɔkompete, nkorɔma ahodoɔ nyinaa <verse eid="DEU 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14"/>kwaakwaadabi ahodoɔ nyinaa, <verse eid="DEU 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15"/>sohori, anadwo akorɔma, ɛpo so asomfena ne akorɔma ahodoɔ nyinaa, <verse eid="DEU 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16"/>ɔpatuo, ɔpatukɛseɛ, bakanoma <verse eid="DEU 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17"/>nantwinoma, opete ne ɛpo so anene, <verse eid="DEU 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18"/>ne asukɔnkɔn ahodoɔ nyinaa, asɔkwaa ne apan.<verse eid="DEU 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19"/>Ntuboa a wɔnante nyinaa ho nnte mma mo; monnwe. <verse eid="DEU 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20"/>Nanso ntuboa a wɔn ho te nyinaa deɛ, monwe.<verse eid="DEU 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21"/>Monnwe aboa bi a ɔno ankasa awuo. Momfa ma ɔhɔhoɔ a ɔne mo te, anaasɛ montɔn ma ɔnanani. Na mo ankasa deɛ, monnwe, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔayi mo asi nkyɛn sɛ ɔman kronkron ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Monnoa abirekyie ba wɔ ne maame nufosuo mu.<verse eid="DEU 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntotosoɔ Dudu Ho Mmara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22"/>Mo mfuo mu nnɔbaeɛ no, monyi mu ntotosoɔ dudu a ɛyɛ nkyɛmu edu mu baako wɔ mo nnɔbaeɛ mu afe biara otwaberɛ mu. <verse eid="DEU 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23"/>Momfa saa ntotosoɔ dudu yi mmra baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛkyerɛ mo na momfa nkamfo ne din na monni wɔ nʼanim. Mo aburoo, mo nsa, mo ngo ne mo anantwie ne mo nnwan abakan mmarima nso, monyɛ wɔn saa ara. Ntotosoɔ dudu no botaeɛ ne sɛ, ɛkyerɛ mo sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ daa mosuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="DEU 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24"/>Sɛ beaeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛkyerɛ mo sɛ monkamfo ne din no kwan ware firi mo fie a, <verse eid="DEU 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25"/>motumi tɔn mo afudeɛ ne mo nyɛmmoa ntotosoɔ dudu no kyɛfa gye sika de kɔ faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, akyerɛ mo hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26"/>Sɛ moduru hɔ a, momfa sika no ntɔ biribiara a mo kɔn dɔ, sɛ ebia, nantwie, odwan, bobesa, anaa nsã biara a ɛyɛ den ne adeɛ biara a mo kra pɛ na monni wɔ hɔ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn anim, na mo ne mo fiefoɔ ani nnye. <verse eid="DEU 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27"/>Lewifoɔ a wɔfra mo mu no, mommma mo werɛ mfiri wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnni kyɛfa biara a wɔdi so sɛdeɛ mowɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28"/>Mfeɛ mmiɛnsa biara awieeɛ no, momfa mo mfudeɛ ntotosoɔ dudu no mmra mmɛkora no wɔ kuro a ɛbɛn mu. <verse eid="DEU 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29"/>Momfa mma Lewifoɔ a wɔnni kyɛfa wɔ mo mu no ne ananafoɔ a wɔwɔ mo nkuro so no, nwisiaa ne akunafoɔ a wɔwɔ mo nkuro so sɛdeɛ wɔbɛtumi adidi amee. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛhyira mo nnwuma nyinaa so.<verse eid="DEU 14:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Aka Mu Twa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1"/>Mfirinhyia nson biara awieeɛ, montwa mo aka mu. <verse eid="DEU 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2"/>Ɛkwan a ɛsɛ sɛ mofa so nie: Ɛsɛ sɛ boseabɔni biara a wabɔ ne yɔnko Israelni bosea no, ɔde kyɛ no. Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔdan wɔn yɔnko anaa wɔn busuani ka, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɛberɛ a wɔde bosea kyɛ no aduru. <verse eid="DEU 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3"/>Saa bosea a wɔtwa mu yi ka mo yɔnkonom Israelfoɔ nko ara. Ahɔhoɔ a wɔte mo mu no nka ho. <verse eid="DEU 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ ahiafoɔ ba mo mu ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn bɛhyira mo wɔ asase a ɔde rema mo sɛ mo agyapadeɛ sononko no so. <verse eid="DEU 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5"/>Sɛ moto mo bo ase di <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn mmara a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi so a, mobɛnya saa nhyira yi. <verse eid="DEU 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn bɛhyira mo sɛdeɛ wahyɛ mo bɔ no. Mobɛbɔ aman bebree bosea nanso mo deɛ, morenkɔ aboseabɔ da. Mobɛdi aman bebree so nanso wɔrenni mo so.<verse eid="DEU 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7"/>Sɛ moduru nkuro a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo no so na sɛ ahiafoɔ wɔ hɔ a, mommpirim mo akoma anaa mommma mo nsam nyɛ den wɔ wɔn so. <verse eid="DEU 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8"/>Mmom, mongo mo nsam na momfɛm wɔn deɛ ɛhia wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9"/>Monhwɛ na moannya saa adwemmɔne yi wɔ mo tirim sɛ ɛka mu twa berɛ no reyɛ aduru so enti, obi bɛbisa mo bosea a moremma no. Sɛ moammɔ ahiafoɔ no bosea na sɛ wɔsu frɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a, wɔbɛbu mo fɔ sɛ moayɛ bɔne. <verse eid="DEU 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10"/>Momma no akoma pa mu na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛhyira mo ne biribiara a mobɛyɛ so. <verse eid="DEU 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11"/>Ɛberɛ biara, mobɛhunu ahiafoɔ wɔ mo mu. Ɛno enti na merehyɛ mo sɛ, biribiara a mowɔ no, mo ne ahiafoɔ ne mo nuanom Israelfoɔ nkyɛ.<verse eid="DEU 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asomfoɔ Ahofadie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12"/>Sɛ wo nua Hebrini barima anaa ɔbaa tɔn ne ho ma wo na ɔsom wo mfirinhyia nsia a, afe a ɛtɔ so nson no, gya no ɛkwan. <verse eid="DEU 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13"/>Na sɛ woregya no ɛkwan a, mma no nkɔ nsapan. <verse eid="DEU 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14"/>Fa nsa a emu go gya no ɛkwan na ma no wo nnwan no, wʼayuporebea mu adeɛ ne wo nsakyimena mu adeɛ bi. Wo ne no nkyɛ wʼadonneɛ bi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Onyankopɔn, de ahyira wo no bi. <verse eid="DEU 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15"/>Monkae sɛ na moyɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn yii mo firii hɔ. Ɛno enti na mede saa mmara yi rema mo ɛnnɛ yi.<verse eid="DEU 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16"/>Na sɛ ɛba sɛ wʼakoa ka kyerɛ wo sɛ, “Merennya wo hɔ nkɔ”, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔpɛ wo ne wʼabusuafoɔ asɛm na ne ho tɔ no wɔ wo nkyɛn a, <verse eid="DEU 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17"/>ɛnneɛ, fa fitiiɛ bɔne nʼaso mu na ɔnyɛ wʼakoa daa. Wo mfenaa nso, yɛ wɔn saa ara.<verse eid="DEU 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18"/>Mma no nyɛ wo ya sɛ woregyaa wʼasomfoɔ no ama wɔafa wɔn ho akɔdie. Monkae sɛ, mfeɛ nsia ni no, wɔasom wo a sɛ wokɔfaa apaafoɔ sɛ wɔnsom wo a, anka wobɛtua apaafoɔ no sika mmɔho mmienu, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn bɛhyira mo wɔ biribiara a moyɛ ho.<verse eid="DEU 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmoa Mmakan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19"/>Mo anantwie ne mo nnwan mmakan anini no, monyi nsi hɔ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. Mo anantwie mmakan no, mommfa wɔn nkɔ mo mfuo mu nkɔyɛ nnwuma na monntwitwa mo nnwan mmakan ho nwi nso. <verse eid="DEU 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20"/>Mmom, mo ne mo abusuafoɔ, afe biara, monnwe saa mmoa yi wɔ baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn bɛyi ama mo no wɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="DEU 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21"/>Na sɛ ɛba sɛ abakan no bi adi dɛm, sɛ ebia, ɔtɔ apakye anaa nʼani afira anaa wadi ɛdɛm foforɔ bi a, mommfa no mmɔ afɔdeɛ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="DEU 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22"/>Mmom, momfa no nyɛ aduane mma abusuafoɔ wɔ fie. Sɛ obi ho te o, sɛ ne ho nte o, ɔtumi di bi sɛdeɛ obiara tumi we ɔtwe anaa ɔdabɔ nam no. <verse eid="DEU 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23"/>Nanso, monnni mogya no. Monhwie ngu fam te sɛ nsuo.<verse eid="DEU 15:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Twam Afahyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1"/>Daa monni Twam Afahyɛ no wɔ ɔbosome Abib<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrifoɔ bosome Abib no taa si Ɔbɛnem ne Oforisuo ntam.</char></note> no mu mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔbosome Abib mu ɛda bi anadwo na Onyankopɔn yii mo firii Misraim. <verse eid="DEU 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2"/>Monkum anantwie anaa nnwan sɛ Twam Afahyɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, wɔ baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyi sɛ atenaeɛ wɔ ne din mu. <verse eid="DEU 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3"/>Monnni burodo a mmɔreka wɔ mu; monni burodo a mmɔreka nni mu nnanson, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔherɛ so na mofirii Misraim sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mo nkwa nna nyinaa mobɛkae ɛberɛ a motu firii Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4"/>Mommma wɔnhunu mmɔreka wɔ mo nkyɛn wɔ mo nsase nyinaa so nnanson. Mommma ɛnam a mode bɔɔ afɔdeɛ ɛda a ɛdi ɛkan no anwummerɛ no nnka ogya so nkɔsi anɔpa.<verse eid="DEU 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5"/>Monnni Twam Afahyɛ no wɔ nkuro a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6"/>Baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn bɛyi sɛ wɔnkamfo ne din wɔ hɔ no na monni Twam Afahyɛ no. Sɛ owia rekɔtɔ a na monni mfa nkae mo Misraim firi berɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7"/>Montoto na monwe no wɔ faako a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛyi ama mo no. Na adeɛ kye a, monkɔ mo ntomadan mu. <verse eid="DEU 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8"/>Nnansia na momfa nni burodo a wɔmfaa mmɔreka mfraeɛ. Na ne nnanson so, nnipa no nyinaa nhyia wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim. Na saa ɛda no, obiara nnyɛ adwuma.<verse eid="DEU 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔtwa Berɛ Afahyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔrebɛfiri aseɛ atwa aburoo no na monkan nnanson no. <verse eid="DEU 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10"/>Monni Nnapɛn Dapɔnna ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na mommɔ ayamyɛ afɔdeɛ sɛdeɛ nhyira a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ahyira mo no sɛso so. <verse eid="DEU 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11"/>Na monnye mo ani wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim wɔ baabi a ɔbɛyi sɛ atenaeɛ a wɔbɛkamfo ne din no—mone no mo mmammarima ne mo mmammaa, mo nkoa ne mo mfenaa, Lewifoɔ a wɔwɔ mo nkuro mu ne ahɔhoɔ, nwisiaa ne akunafoɔ a wɔne mo teɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12"/>Monkae sɛ, na moyɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim enti monhwɛ yie na monni saa mmara yi nyinaa so.<verse eid="DEU 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asese Afahyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13"/>Sɛ moboaboa mo ayuporobea ne mo nsakyimena mu adeɛ ano wie a, momfa nnanson nni Asese Afahyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14"/>Saa afahyɛ yi bɛyɛ ahotɔ ne ahosɛpɛ berɛ ama mo ne mo abusuafoɔ, mo asomfoɔ ne Lewifoɔ, ahɔhoɔ, nwisiaa ne akunafoɔ a wɔfiri mo nkuro mu. <verse eid="DEU 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15"/>Nnanson na momfa nni saa afahyɛ yi mfa nhyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, animuonyam wɔ baabi a ɔbɛyi, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn na ɔma mo mfudeɛ bɔ pii na ɔhyira mo nnwuma nyinaa so. Saa afahyɛ yi yɛ ahosɛpɛ ma obiara.<verse eid="DEU 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16"/>Afe biara mu, ɛsɛ sɛ mo mmarima hyia wɔ mo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn anim baabi a ɔbɛyi no mprɛnsa de ma Apiti Afahyɛ, Otwa berɛ Afahyɛ ne Asese Afahyɛ no. Ɛnsɛ sɛ obiara ba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim nsapan. <verse eid="DEU 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17"/>Obiara mma deɛ ne nsa bɛso so wɔ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ahyira no.<verse eid="DEU 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atemmufoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18"/>Monsisi atemmufoɔ ne mpanimfoɔ mfiri mo mmusuakuo biara mu wɔ nkuro a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn de rema mo no mu. Wɔbɛbu atɛntenenee wɔ nsase no nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19"/>Mommmu ntɛnkyea da biara da. Monnnye adanmudeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, adanmudeɛ fira anyansafoɔ ani ma wɔsi gyinaeɛ de tia onyamesuroni asɛm. <verse eid="DEU 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20"/>Momma asɛntenenee nna adi sɛdeɛ ɛbɛma moatumi atena asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de rema mo no so.<verse eid="DEU 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahonisom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21"/>Monnsisi nnua biara sɛ abosompɔ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn afɔrebukyia a morebɛsi ama no no ho. <verse eid="DEU 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22"/>Saa ara nso na monnsi aboɔ adum nsom wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn akyiwadeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1"/>Mommfa anantwie anaa nnwan a wɔadi dɛm mmɔ afɔdeɛ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ nʼakyiwadeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2"/>Sɛ ɛba sɛ ɔbarima anaa ɔbaa a ɔka mo ho wɔ kuro baako bi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo no mu ayɛ bɔne wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim, atia apam no <verse eid="DEU 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3"/>sɛ ɔresom anyame foforɔ anaa ɔresom owia, ɔsrane anaa ɔsoro atumfoɔ bi a mabra no, na <verse eid="DEU 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4"/>sɛ mote saa asɛm no a, monhwehwɛ mu yie. Sɛ ɛyɛ nokorɛ na wɔkɔ mu hunu sɛ ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ na wayɛ wɔ Israel a, <verse eid="DEU 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5"/>momfa saa ɔbarima anaa ɔbaa no a wayɛ saa bɔne no mmra mo kuropɔn ɛpono ano na monsi no aboɔ nkum no. <verse eid="DEU 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6"/>Adansefoɔ baanu anaa baasa ano asɛm so na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔgyina kum saa ɔbarima no. Nanso, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔgyina ɔdanseni baako ano asɛm so kum obi. <verse eid="DEU 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7"/>Adansefoɔ no to ɔboɔ a ɛdi ɛkan a, nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa nso bɛto wɔn deɛ de akum onipa no. Saa ɛkwan yi so na mobɛfa atu onipa bɔnefoɔ ase afiri mo mu.<verse eid="DEU 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛnniiɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8"/>Sɛ wɔde nsɛm bi ba mo asɛnniiɛ a ne die yɛ mo den sɛ mobɛbu ho atɛn, sɛ ɛyɛ awudie, asɛnnie, anaasɛ ntɔkwa a, momfa wɔn nkɔ baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛkyerɛ mo no. <verse eid="DEU 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9"/>Monkɔ asɔfoɔ a wɔyɛ Lewifoɔ ne ɔtemmufoɔ a ɔte adwa mu saa ɛberɛ no nkyɛn. Mommisa wɔn na wɔnkyerɛ mo atɛn a mommuo. <verse eid="DEU 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10"/>Monni gyinaeɛ a wɔbɛsi no so pɛpɛɛpɛ wɔ beaeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛyi ama mo no hɔ. Monhwɛ yie na monni biribiara a wɔbɛkyerɛ mo sɛ monyɛ no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11"/>Monni mmara a wɔkyerɛ mo ne gyinaeɛ a wɔbɛsi ama mo no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Monnnane deɛ wɔka kyerɛ mo no ani. Monnkɔ nifa anaa benkum. <verse eid="DEU 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12"/>Ɔbarima a ɔbɛbu ɔtemmufoɔ anaa ɔsɔfoɔ a ɔgyina hɔ resom <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn animtia no, wɔnkum no. Ɛsɛ sɛ motɔre amumuyɛsɛm ase wɔ Israel. <verse eid="DEU 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13"/>Nnipa nyinaa bɛte na wɔasuro na wɔremmu animtia bio.<verse eid="DEU 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔhene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14"/>Sɛ moduru asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de rema mo no so na mofa tena so na moka sɛ. “Momma yɛnsi yɛn so ɔhene te sɛ aman a atwa yɛn ho ahyia no nyinaa a,” <verse eid="DEU 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15"/>monhwɛ sɛ mobɛpa obi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn bɛyi no asi mo so ɔhene. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ mo nuanom no mu bi. Mommfa ɔhɔhoɔ a ɔnyɛ mo nua Israelni nsi mo so ɔhene. <verse eid="DEU 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ saa ɔhene no pɛ apɔnkɔ dodoɔ sɛ nʼagyapadeɛ anaasɛ ɔma nnipa sane kɔ Misraim kɔtɔ apɔnkɔ dodoɔ wɔ hɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ mo sɛ. “Ɛnsɛ sɛ mosane kɔ mo akyi bio.” <verse eid="DEU 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔware yerenom bebree anyɛ saa a, nʼakoma bɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> so. Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔboaboa dwetɛ ne sika pii ano.<verse eid="DEU 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18"/>Sɛ ɔtena ahennwa no so sɛ ɔhene a, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔtwerɛ mmara nwoma no wɔ mmobɔeɛ so wɔ Lewifoɔ asɔfoɔ anim na ɔfa. <verse eid="DEU 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19"/>Mmerɛ dodoɔ a ɔte ase no, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔkora mmara a ɛwɔ ne nkyɛn no na ɔkenkan no daa sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔbɛdi mmara no so na wasuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="DEU 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20"/>Kenkan a ɔkenkan no daa no remma ɔnyɛ ahantan, nhoran ne ho nkyerɛ sɛ ɔsene ne manfoɔ no. Ɛbɛsi no kwan sɛ ɔbɛtwe ne ho kakra mpo afiri saa mmara yi ho. Yei bɛsi no gyinaeɛ sɛ ɔne nʼasefoɔ bɛdi adeɛ awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ bebree so wɔ Israel.<verse eid="DEU 17:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɔfoɔ Ne Lewifoɔ Akyɛdeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1"/>Asɔfoɔ a wɔyɛ Lewifoɔ, nokorɛm Lewi abusuakuo nyinaa nni kyɛfa ne agyapadeɛ biara wɔ Israel ɔman mu te sɛ mmusuakuo a aka no. Mmom, asɔfoɔ no ne Lewifoɔ no bɛdi ogya afɔdeɛ a wɔbɔ ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no bi sɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2"/>Israelfoɔ mu deɛ, wɔrennya agyapadeɛ biara sɛ wɔn ankasa kyɛfa. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ankasa bɛyɛ wɔn kyɛfa sɛdeɛ ɔhyɛɛ wɔn bɔ no ara.<verse eid="DEU 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3"/>Yei ne kyɛfa a asɔfoɔ no bɛnya afiri anantwie ne odwan a nnipa no de bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ no mu: nʼabati, nʼapantan ne nʼayamdeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4"/>Afei, momma wɔn mo aburookan mu adeɛ, nsã foforɔ ne ngo ne nwi a ɛdi ɛkan a wɔtwitwa firi odwan ho. <verse eid="DEU 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ayi Lewifoɔ afiri mo mmusuakuo nyinaa mu sɛ wɔnnyina, nsom daa wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu.<verse eid="DEU 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6"/>Sɛ Lewini bi pɛ na ɔfiri mo nkuro no mu biara a ɔte so mu wɔ Israel kɔ baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi a, <verse eid="DEU 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7"/>ɔtumi som wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ne Onyankopɔn, din mu te sɛ deɛ ne nkurɔfoɔ Lewifoɔ a wɔsom wɔ hɔ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim no yɛ no ara. <verse eid="DEU 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8"/>Sɛ mpo wanya sika bi afiri abusua agyapadeɛ bi tɔn mu a, wɔde ne kyɛfa a ɛwɔ afɔrebɔdeɛ no mu sɛ Lewini no bɛma no sɛ asɛdeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nneyɛɛ A Ɛyɛ Akyiwadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9"/>Sɛ monya duru asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo no so a, monhwɛ yie na moansua amanaman a ɛwɔ hɔ no amanneɛ a ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10"/>Mommma wɔnnhunu sɛ mo mu bi de ne babarima anaa ne babaa abɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ. Na mommma mo nnipa no nnyɛ akɔmfoɔ a wɔhyɛ abosom nkɔm, abayifoɔ ne abisakorɔfoɔ, ne ntafowayifoɔ <verse eid="DEU 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11"/>ne nkaberɛkyerefoɔ ne asamanfrɛfoɔ, adutofoɔ a ɔbisa afunu. <verse eid="DEU 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12"/>Obiara a ɔyɛ saa adeɛ yi bi no yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyiwadeɛ na saa akyiwadeɛ yi enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛpamo saa aman no afiri mo anim. <verse eid="DEU 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13"/>Na wɔmmfa so bi nto mo so wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim.<verse eid="DEU 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Odiyifoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14"/>Aman a morekɔtu wɔn yi tie wɔn a wɔpɛ abayisɛm ne nkɔmhyɛsɛm. Nanso mo deɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, mma mo kwan sɛ monyɛ saa. <verse eid="DEU 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛyi odiyifoɔ a ɔte sɛ me afiri mo Israelfoɔ yi ara mu. Ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ ɔsetie ma no. <verse eid="DEU 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16"/>Saa na mo ankasa mobisaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ɛberɛ a mohyiaa wɔ Horeb no. Mosrɛɛ sɛ mompɛ sɛ mote <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, nne anaa mohunu egyadɛreɛ bio, ɛfiri sɛ, mosuro sɛ anhwɛ a, mobɛwuwu.<verse eid="DEU 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> buaa sɛ, “Mɛyɛ wɔn abisadeɛ ama wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18"/>Mɛda odiyifoɔ te sɛ wo adi afiri wɔn nkurɔfoɔ Israelfoɔ mu. Mɛkyerɛ saa odiyifoɔ no asɛm a mɛhyɛ no sɛ ɔnka nkyerɛ nnipa no, na ɔbɛka akyerɛ wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19"/>Obiara a wantie asɛm a odiyifoɔ no bɛka wɔ me din mu no, mʼankasa me ne ɔsoɔdenfoɔ no bɛdi. <verse eid="DEU 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20"/>Na odiyifoɔ biara a ɔnam onyame foforɔ bi so ka asɛm anaa ɔdi atorɔ wɔ me din mu no bɛwu.”<verse eid="DEU 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21"/>Mobɛbisa mo ho sɛ, “Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na yɛahunu sɛ adiyisɛm no firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anaasɛ ɛmfiri no?” <verse eid="DEU 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22"/>Sɛ odiyifoɔ no hyɛ nkɔm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu na amma mu a, na ɛnyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔde asɛm no maeɛ. Na ɛkyerɛ sɛ, saa odiyifoɔ no ara kaa ɔno ankasa nʼasɛm bi kwa enti ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔsuro no.<verse eid="DEU 18:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Dwanekɔbea Nkuropɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn sɛe aman a ɔde wɔn nsase rema mo na sɛ mopam wɔn na motena wɔn nkuro no mu ne wɔn afie mu a, <verse eid="DEU 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2"/>monyi nkuropɔn mmiɛnsa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yei yɛ nkuropɔn mmiɛnsa a ɛbɛkaa baako a na ɛwɔ hɔ dada a na ɛwɔ Yordan apueeɛ fam sɛ dwanekɔbea no. Na yeinom wɔ Yordan atɔeɛ fam.</char></note> a ɛwɔ asase no mfimfini a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo afa no. <verse eid="DEU 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3"/>Monyiyi akwan nkɔ hɔ na monkyɛ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ agyapadeɛ no mu mmiɛnsa sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, sɛ obi kum obi a, ɔbɛdwane akɔ hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4"/>Sɛ obi anhyɛ da na ɔkum obi a ɔnni ne ho menasepɔ anaa ɔntan no dada a, onipakumfoɔ no tumi dwane kɔ saa nkuropɔn yi biara so de gye ne ho nkwa. <verse eid="DEU 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5"/>Sɛ ebia, obi ne ne yɔnko bi kɔ wiram rekɔbu nnua na sɛ ɛba sɛ ɔbaako de abonnua rebu dua bi na sɛ abonnua no hɔn firi ne dua mu kumm ne yɔnko no a, saa asɛm yi mu no, onipakumfoɔ no tumi dwane kɔ nkuropɔn no baako so de gye ne ho nkwa. <verse eid="DEU 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6"/>Sɛ dwanekɔbea biara mmɛn hɔ a, ɔtaafoɔ bi bɛtumi ataa onipakumfoɔ no akum no. Sɛ ɛba saa a, ɛkyerɛ sɛ, wɔakum onipakumfoɔ no wɔ ɛberɛ a wanhyɛ da akum obi. Wankum onipa, na mmom deɛ ɔyɛeɛ yɛ asiane. <verse eid="DEU 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7"/>Ne saa enti na merehyɛ mo sɛ monyi nkuropɔn mmiɛnsa nsi nkyɛn no.<verse eid="DEU 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn trɛ mo ɔman mu sɛdeɛ ɔkaa ho ntam kyerɛɛ mo agyanom na ɔde asase no nyinaa ma mo sɛdeɛ ɔhyɛɛ wɔn ho bɔ no a, <verse eid="DEU 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9"/>ɛsɛ sɛ moyi nkuropɔn mmiɛnsa si nkyɛn. Sɛ moto mo bo ase di mmara a mehyɛɛ mo no so ɛnnɛ yi sɛ monnɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn na monnante nʼakwan so a, ɛnneɛ, ɔde asase no bɛma mo. <verse eid="DEU 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10"/>Monyɛ yei, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔnhwie mogya a ɛnni fɔ no ngu wɔ mo asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ mo agyapadeɛ no so, na moanni mogyahwieguo no ho fɔ.<verse eid="DEU 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11"/>Sɛ obi tan obi enti ɔhyɛ da kɔtɛ no kumm no na ɔdwane kɔ nkuropɔn no bi so kɔtɛ a, <verse eid="DEU 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12"/>ɛsɛ sɛ mpanimfoɔ a wɔwɔ ne kuro no mu hɔ no soma ma wɔkɔpɛ no ma wɔsane de no ba kuropɔn no mu ma owufoɔ no nkurɔfoɔ nso kum no bi. <verse eid="DEU 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13"/>Mommma onipakumfoɔ no asɛm nha mo. Monyi wɔn a wɔdi awudie ho fɔ wɔ Israel nyinaa mmra, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, biribiara bɛkɔ yie ama mo.<verse eid="DEU 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14"/>Sɛ moduru asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ agyapadeɛ sononko no so a, monntutu ɛhyeɛ a mo agyanom atoto ngu mmfa so nwia obi asase.<verse eid="DEU 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adansefoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15"/>Mommmu obi a ɔdanseni baako abɛdi atia no no fɔ. Soboɔ bɛdi mu ɛberɛ a nnipa baanu anaa baasa abɛdi adanseɛ.<verse eid="DEU 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16"/>Sɛ atorɔ danseni bi ba bɛbɔ obi amumuyɛ bi ho kwaadu a, <verse eid="DEU 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17"/>ɛnneɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ kwaadubɔni no ne onipa a wabɔ no kwaadu no nyinaa ba asɔfoɔ ne atemmufoɔ a wɔreyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adwuma no anim. <verse eid="DEU 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔto wɔn bo bisa nnipa no nsɛm mu yie. Na sɛ wɔhunu sɛ kwaadubɔni no retwa atorɔ a, <verse eid="DEU 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19"/>wɔde asotwe a anka ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde ma onipa a wɔabɔ no kwaadu no bɛma no. Sɛ mofa saa ɛkwan yi so a, mobɛtu amumuyɛsɛm nyinaa afiri mo mu. <verse eid="DEU 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20"/>Wɔn a wɔbɛte no bɛsuro sɛ wɔbɛyɛ saa bɔne no bi. <verse eid="DEU 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21"/>Monnhunu obiara mmɔbɔ! Mo mmara a ɛsɛ sɛ modi so no yɛ nkwa nsi nkwa ananmu, ani nsi ani ananmu, ɛse nsi ɛse ananmu, nsa nsi nsa ananmu, ɛnan nsi ɛnan ananmu.<verse eid="DEU 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Akodie Ho Nkyerɛkyerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1"/>Sɛ mokɔ ɔko de tia mo atamfoɔ na mohunu apɔnkɔ ne nteaseɛnam ne akodɔm a wɔdɔɔso sen mo a, monnsuro wɔn. <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, a ɔyii mo firii Misraim no bɛka mo ho. <verse eid="DEU 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2"/>Sɛ morebɛkɔ ɔko a, ɔsɔfoɔ no bɛba abɛkasa akyerɛ akodɔm no. <verse eid="DEU 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3"/>Ɔbɛka sɛ, “Montie me, mo Israel mmarima! Ɛnnɛ, morekɔ ɔsa yi, mommma mo akoma ntu! Mommma mo abasa mu mmu, na momma mo ho mpopo. <verse eid="DEU 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na ɔne mo rekɔ. Ɔbɛko atia mo atamfoɔ no ama mo, na moadi nkonim.”<verse eid="DEU 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5"/>Akodɔm mpanimfoɔ no bɛbisa akodɔm no sɛ, “Mo mu bi asi ɛdan foforɔ a ɔntenaa mu da? Sɛ obi wɔ ha saa a, ɔnsane nkɔ! Ebia na wɔakum no wɔ ɔko no mu na ama obi akɔtena mu! <verse eid="DEU 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6"/>Obi wɔ ha a wadɔ bobefuo na ɔnnii mu aba da? Sɛ obi wɔ ha saa a, ɔnsane nkɔ! Ebia na wɔakum no wɔ ɔko no mu, na ama obi akɔdi mu aba. <verse eid="DEU 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7"/>Obi wɔ ha a wagye ɔbaa bi awadeɛ? Sɛ obi wɔ ha saa a, ɔnsane nkɔ! Ebia na wɔakum no wɔ ɔko no mu, na ama obi akɔware ne siyere no.” <verse eid="DEU 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8"/>Afei, mpanimfoɔ bɛkɔ so abisa sɛ, “Mo mu bi suro anaa nʼakoma atu? Ɛnneɛ, ɔnkɔ fie sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ne nuammarima nso akoma ntu.” <verse eid="DEU 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9"/>Sɛ mpanimfoɔ no wie akodɔm no kasakyerɛ a, afei wɔbɛpa asahene asisi wɔn ano.<verse eid="DEU 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10"/>Sɛ mobɛn kuro biara a morekɔto ahyɛ wɔn so no ano a, deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, monkyerɛ nnipa no asomdwoeɛ nhyehyɛeɛ a mowɔ ma wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11"/>Sɛ wɔpene mo nhyehyɛeɛ no so na wɔbue wɔn apono ma mo a, nnipa a wɔwɔ mu no nyinaa, mobɛhyɛ wɔn ama wɔasom mo. <verse eid="DEU 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12"/>Na sɛ wɔampene asomdwoeɛ nhyehyɛeɛ no so na sɛ wɔse wɔne mo bɛko a, ɛnneɛ, monto nhyɛ kuro no so. <verse eid="DEU 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, dane kuro no hyɛ mo nsa a, monkum kuro no mu mmarima nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14"/>Nanso, ɛyɛ a momfa kuro no mu mmaa, mmɔfra, nyɛmmoa ne asadeɛ a aka nyinaa sɛ agyapadeɛ. Momfa asadeɛ no nyinaa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ama mo no. <verse eid="DEU 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15"/>Saa nhyɛ yi fa nkuro a ɛwɔ akyiri nko ara ho, na ɛnyɛ nkuro a ɛwɔ bɔhyɛ asase no so.<verse eid="DEU 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16"/>Na amanaman nkuro a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ agyapadeɛ sononko no deɛ, monsɛe biribiara a nkwa wɔ mu wɔ hɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17"/>Monsɛe Hetifoɔ, Amorifoɔ, Kanaanfoɔ, Perisifoɔ, Hewifoɔ ne Yebusifoɔ pasaa sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, hyɛɛ mo no. <verse eid="DEU 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18"/>Sɛ ɛba saa a, ɛremma nnipa a wɔte asase no so no nkyerɛ mo akyiwadeɛ ho amanneɛ a wɔnam so somm wɔn anyame a anka ɛbɛma mo ayɛ bɔne a emu yɛ duru atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, no.<verse eid="DEU 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19"/>Sɛ moretua kuropɔn bi na ɔko no rekɔ so a, monnsɛe nnua. Monni nnuaba no na monntwitwa nnua no ngu. Nnua no nyɛ atamfoɔ a ɛsɛ sɛ moto hyɛ so! <verse eid="DEU 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20"/>Nanso, motumi twa nnua a monim sɛ ɛnyɛ aduane. Momfa nyɛ deɛ ɛho hia mo mfa ntua kuro no kɔsi sɛ ɛbɛdi nkoguo.<verse eid="DEU 20:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Awudie A Wɔnnim Owudifoɔ No Ho Mpata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1"/>Sɛ wɔhunu sɛ wɔakum obi da afuom wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo no so, na sɛ monnim owudifoɔ no a, <verse eid="DEU 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2"/>mo ntuanofoɔ ne atemmufoɔ bɛkɔ akɔsusu ɛkwan a ɛda deɛ owufoɔ no da hɔ ne kuro a ɛbɛn no ntam. <verse eid="DEU 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3"/>Afei, mpanimfoɔ a wɔwɔ kuro a ɛbɛn owufoɔ no pɛɛ no mfa nantwie ba a ɔnyɛɛ adwuma da na ɔntwee funtumfidie da, <verse eid="DEU 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4"/>na wɔnni nʼanim mfa no nkɔ subɔnhwa a wɔmfuntum anaa wɔnnuaa hwee wɔ hɔ da na nsuo resene wɔ mu mu. Subɔnhwa no mu na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbu nantwie ba no kɔn mu. <verse eid="DEU 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5"/>Lewifoɔ asɔfoɔ bɛba hɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ayi wɔn sɛ wɔnka asɛm na wɔnhyira wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu. Na wɔn na wɔsi asɛnnie ne asotwe so dua. <verse eid="DEU 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6"/>Kuro a ɛbɛn efunu no mu mpanimfoɔ no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔhohoro wɔn nsa gu nantwie ba a wɔbuu ne kɔn mu no so. <verse eid="DEU 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7"/>Na afei wɔbɛka sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ yɛn nsa na yɛhwiee mogya yi guiɛ na yɛanhunu nso. <verse eid="DEU 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8"/>Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, fa kyɛ wo ɔman Israel a wogyee wɔn no. Mfa mogya a ɛdi bem yi ho so nto wo nnipa Israel so.” Wɔwie yei a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ, wɔayi ɛso a ɛda wɔn so no afiri wɔn so. <verse eid="DEU 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9"/>Sɛ wɔdi saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi so na wɔyɛ deɛ ɛtene wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so a, na moayi awudie no ho afɔbuo afiri mo atenaeɛ hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmaa Nnommumfoɔ Awadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10"/>Sɛ mokɔ ɔko tia mo atamfoɔ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn dane wɔn hyɛ mo nsa na mofa wɔn nnomum, <verse eid="DEU 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11"/>na sɛ wɔn mu no, mohunu ɔbaa ɔhoɔfɛfoɔ bi a mopɛ sɛ mofa no sɛ ɔyere a, motumi ware no. <verse eid="DEU 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12"/>Momfa no mmra mo fie na monyi ne ti, ntwitwa ne mmɔwerɛ, <verse eid="DEU 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13"/>na monyi ntadeɛ a na ɛhyɛ no wɔ ɛberɛ a mokyeree no no ngu hɔ. Na watena mo fie asu nʼagya ne ne maame bosome akyi no, motumi kɔ ne ho ma ɔyɛ ɔyere. <verse eid="DEU 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14"/>Sɛ mo ani nnye ne ho a, momma no nkɔ baabiara a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔkɔ. Monntɔn no na monnyɛ no sɛ afenaa, ɛfiri sɛ, moagu nʼanim ase.<verse eid="DEU 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakan Ho Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15"/>Sɛ ɔbarima wɔ yerenom baanu na ɔdɔ ɔbaako kyɛn deɛ ɔka ho no, na wɔn baanu no nyinaa, wɔn mu biara ne no wɔ ɔbabarima nanso nʼabakan no yɛ ɔyere a ɔmpɛ nʼasɛm no babarima, <verse eid="DEU 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16"/>na sɛ ɔhyɛ nsamanseɛ de ma ne mmammarima a, ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔde kyɛfa kɛseɛ no ma ɔbabarima kumaa a ɔyɛ ne yere a ɔdɔ no no babarima. <verse eid="DEU 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17"/>Ɔbɛfa ne babarima a ɔyɛ ɔyere a ɔmpɛ nʼasɛm no sɛ nʼabakan no, na wanam so ama no nʼagyapadeɛ no mmɔho mmienu. Saa ɔbabarima no yɛ nʼagya no ahoɔden nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛdi ɛkan. Ɛno enti, abakan kyɛfa yɛ ne dea.<verse eid="DEU 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbabarima A Ɔte Atua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18"/>Sɛ ɔbarima bi wɔ ɔbabarima a ɔyɛ asoɔden ne otuatefoɔ a ɔntie nʼagya ne ne maame asɛm a nso wɔtene ne so a, <verse eid="DEU 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19"/>deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ ɛba ara ne sɛ, agya no ne maame no de wɔn babarima no bɛkɔ mpanimfoɔ a wɔhwɛ kuro no so no anim. <verse eid="DEU 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔpae mu ka sɛ, “Yɛn babarima yi yɛ asoɔden ne otuatefoɔ a ɔntie yɛn asɛm. Ɔyɛ onipa teta kɔwensani.” <verse eid="DEU 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21"/>Ɛba saa a, ɛsɛ sɛ mmarima a wɔwɔ kuro no mu nyinaa si no aboɔ kum no. Ne saa no, monam so bɛpamo saa bɔne a aba mo mu no, na Israel nyinaa bɛte, na abɔ wɔn hu.<verse eid="DEU 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Ahodoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22"/>Sɛ obi yɛ amumuyɛsɛm bi a ɛfata owuo na enti wɔkum no na wɔde no sɛn dua so a, <verse eid="DEU 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23"/>ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔsɛne dua no so ma adeɛ kye so. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɛda no ara, wɔsie amu no, ɛfiri sɛ, obiara a wɔsɛn no dua so saa no yɛ Onyankopɔn nnome. Monngu asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ agyapadeɛ sononko no ho fi.<verse eid="DEU 21:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1"/>Sɛ wohunu sɛ obi nantwie anaa sɛ ne dwan nam basabasa a, ɛnyɛ sɛdeɛ wonhunuu no. Kyere no kɔma ne wura. <verse eid="DEU 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2"/>Sɛ ne wura nte mmɛn wo, anaasɛ wonnim no a, fa no kɔ wo fie kɔsi sɛ ne wura no bɛba abɛhwehwɛ no na fa nʼaboa ma no. <verse eid="DEU 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3"/>Sɛ wohunu wo nua bi afunumu anaa ne ntoma anaa ne biribi a ayera wɔ ɛkwan no so a, yɛ no saa ara. Mmu wʼani ngu so.<verse eid="DEU 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4"/>Sɛ wohunu sɛ wo nua bi afunumu anaa ne nantwie da ɛkwan mu a, nhwɛ nkyɛn. Kɔboa wo yɔnko no na ɔmma aboa no nsɔre.<verse eid="DEU 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔbaa hyɛ mmarima atadeɛ, saa ara nso na ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔbarima hyɛ mmaa atadeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn a wɔyɛ yei yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, akyiwadeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6"/>Sɛ wokɔto sɛ anomaa pirebuo da ɛkwankyɛn, sɛ ɛhyɛ dua mu anaa ɛda fam na sɛ anomaa no maame te ne ba no ho anaa ɔbutu nkosua so a, mfa anomaa no maame ne ne ba no nkɔ. <verse eid="DEU 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7"/>Wotumi fa ne ba no, nanso hwɛ no yie sɛ wobɛma ne maame no akɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛsi wo yie, na wo nkwa nna aware.<verse eid="DEU 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8"/>Sɛ wosi ɛdan foforɔ a, si ban fa wo ɛdan no atifi ho nyinaa, na obi amfiri hɔ ante anhwe na woamfa mogyahwie ho asodie anto wo ne wo ɛdan no so.<verse eid="DEU 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9"/>Wo bobefuo no, nnua nnɔbaeɛ foforɔ biara wɔ bobe no ntam. Sɛ woyɛ saa a, wonni ho kwan sɛ wote bobe aba wɔ bobefuo no mu anaasɛ nnɔbaeɛ foforɔ no so aba biara.<verse eid="DEU 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10"/>Mfa nantwie ne afunumu mmɔ mu mfuntum afuo.<verse eid="DEU 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11"/>Mfira ntoma a wɔde kuntu ne serekye afra anwono.<verse eid="DEU 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12"/>Sɛ wopam atadeɛ a, yɛ mpɛsɛe wɔ nʼahinanan ɛnan no biara ano.<verse eid="DEU 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nneyɛɛ A Ɛmfata Wɔ Awadeɛ Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13"/>Sɛ ɔbarima ware ɔbaa na ɔne no da na akyire no, ɔmpɛ no bio, <verse eid="DEU 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14"/>na enti ɔka ne ho asɛmmɔne, bɔ no edin bɔne sɛ, “Mewaree no no, manhunu sɛ ɔyɛ ɔbaabunu,” <verse eid="DEU 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15"/>a, ɔbaa no agya ne ne maame wɔ ho ɛkwan sɛ wɔde adansedie a ɛkyerɛ sɛ wɔn babaa no yɛ ɔbaabunu bɛkyerɛ kuro no mpanimfoɔ wɔ kuro no ɛpono ano. <verse eid="DEU 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbaa no agya ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mede me babaa maa ɔbarima yi awadeɛ nanso ɔse ɔmpɛ no bio. <verse eid="DEU 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17"/>Wabɔ no kwaadu agu nʼanim ase aka sɛ, ɔwaree no no wahunu sɛ ɔnyɛ ɔbaabunu. Nanso adansedeɛ a ɛkyerɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔbaabunu no nie.” Afei, wɔbɛtrɛ ntoma no mu wɔ atemmufoɔ no anim. <verse eid="DEU 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18"/>Atemmufoɔ no bɛtwe ɔbarima no aso. <verse eid="DEU 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19"/>Wɔbɛbɔ no ka dwetɛ kilogram baako sɛ wahyɛ da agu Israel ɔbaabunu no anim ase sɛ ɔnyɛ ɔbaabunu. Wɔbɛtua sika no ama ɔbaa no agya. Afei, ɔbabaa no bɛyɛ ɔbarima no yere a ɔrennyaa no bio.<verse eid="DEU 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20"/>Sɛ ɛkɔba sɛ kwaadu a wɔde bɔɔ no no yɛ, na wɔannya adansedeɛ a ɛfa ne baabunuyɛ no ho ankyerɛ a, <verse eid="DEU 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21"/>wɔde ɔbaa no bɛba nʼagya fie abɔntenpono ano na kurom hɔ mmarima asi no aboɔ wɔ hɔ akum no. Ɔnam adwamammɔ so ayɛ animguaseɛ bɔne wɔ Israel ɛberɛ a ɔne nʼawofoɔ te. Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔpepa saa bɔne no firi mo mu.<verse eid="DEU 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22"/>Sɛ wɔhunu sɛ ɔbarima bi ne ɔbarima foforɔ bi yere da a, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum ɔbarima a ɔne ɔbaa no daeɛ no ne ɔbaa no nyinaa. Ɛsɛ sɛ motu saa bɔne no ase wɔ Israel.<verse eid="DEU 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23"/>Sɛ ɔbarima bi hyia ababaawa a ɔyɛ ɔbaabunu a ɔne obi ahyehyɛ awadeɛ na ɔbarima no ne ababaawa no da, na sɛ saa asɛm no sii kuro no mu a, <verse eid="DEU 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24"/>ɛsɛ sɛ mode wɔn baanu no kɔ kuro no apono ano kɔsi wɔn aboɔ kum wɔn. Ababaawa no di fɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔanteateam ampɛ mmoa. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbarima no nso wu, ɛfiri sɛ, wafa obi yere. Saa ɛkwan yi so na monam bɛtu bɔne afiri asase no so.<verse eid="DEU 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25"/>Sɛ ɔbarima bi hyia ɔbaa a obi ahyehyɛ no awadeɛ wɔ baabi a ɛnyɛ wɔn ɔman mu, na ɔbarima no hyɛ no ne no da a, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum saa ɔbarima no. <verse eid="DEU 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26"/>Monnyɛ ababaawa no biribiara, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔnyɛɛ akunneɛ biara. Saa asɛm yi te sɛ obi a wato ahyɛ ne yɔnko so akum no. <verse eid="DEU 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27"/>Esiane sɛ ɔbarima no hyɛɛ no ne no daeɛ wɔ wiram enti, wɔfa no sɛ, ɔteateaam nanso wannya ɔgyefoɔ biara annye no.<verse eid="DEU 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28"/>Sɛ wɔkyere ɔbarima bi a ɔne ababaawa bi a obi ne no nhyehyɛeɛ awadeɛ ada a, <verse eid="DEU 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29"/>ɛsɛ sɛ ɔtua dwetɛ kilogram mmienu ne fa ma ababaawa no agya. Na ɛno akyi, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbarima no ware ababaawa no, ɛfiri sɛ, wagu nʼanim ase na ɔrentumi nnyae no awadeɛ da.<verse eid="DEU 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30"/>Ɔbarima biara nni ho ɔkwan sɛ ɔne nʼagya yere da, ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔgu nʼagya mpa ho fi.<verse eid="DEU 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Nnipa A Wɔmfata Awurade Badwa Asekɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1"/>Ɔbarima a wɔasa no anaa wɔatwa ne barima atwene no mmma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> badwa ase.<verse eid="DEU 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2"/>Wɔn a wɔyɛ mpena mma ne wɔn asefoɔ kɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ a ɛtɔ so edu no mmma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> badwa ase.<verse eid="DEU 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3"/>Amonfoɔ anaa Moabfoɔ anaa sɛ wɔn asefoɔ kɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ edu no mu biara mmma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> badwa ase. <verse eid="DEU 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4"/>Saa aman yi annye mo, amma mo aduane anaa sɛ nsuo ɛberɛ a mofiri Misraim reba no. Mmom, wɔkɔbɔɔ Beor babarima Balaam a ɔfiri Petor a ɛwɔ Mesopotamia paa sɛ ɔmmɛdome mo. <verse eid="DEU 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, antie Balaam. Ɔdanee nnome no ma ɛyɛɛ nhyira maa mo, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn dɔ mo. <verse eid="DEU 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6"/>Na sɛ mote ase yi, mommmoa Amonfoɔ ne Moabfoɔ ɛkwan biara so da biara da.<verse eid="DEU 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7"/>Monnkyiri Edomfoɔ anaa Misraimfoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, Edomfoɔ yɛ mo nuanom na motenaa Misraimfoɔ nso mu sɛ ahɔhoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8"/>Misraimfoɔ awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ mmiɛnsa a wɔne mo firii Misraim no bɛkɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> badwa ase.<verse eid="DEU 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atenaeɛ Hɔ Afideɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9"/>Sɛ mokɔ ɔko de tia mo atamfoɔ a, montwe mo ho mfiri deɛ ɛho nte biara ho. <verse eid="DEU 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10"/>Sɛ ɔbarima bi ho gu fi ɛsiane anadwo mu ahobaa a, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔfiri atenaeɛ hɔ kɔtena baabi ɛda mu no nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11"/>Ɛduru anwummerɛ a, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔdware na owia kɔtɔ a, ɔnsane mmra atenaeɛ hɔ.<verse eid="DEU 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12"/>Montwa baabi a mobɛgya mo anan wɔ asraafoɔ atenaeɛ hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13"/>Mo mu biara mfa sofi nka ne nneɛma ho. Ɛberɛ biara a mobɛgya mo anan no, momfa sofi no ntu amena na monkata agyanan no so. <verse eid="DEU 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ asraafoɔ atenaeɛ hɔ yɛ kronkron, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, nam mo atenaeɛ no so bɔ mo ho ban, na moadi mo atamfoɔ so nkonim. Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔhunu animguasedeɛ biara wɔ mo mu; sɛ ɛba saa a, ɔbɛdane nʼakyi akyerɛ mo.<verse eid="DEU 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asetena Pa Ho Mmara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15"/>Sɛ ɛba sɛ nkoa dwane firi wɔn wuranom nkyɛn na wɔba mo nkyɛn bɛgye wɔn ho dwanekɔbea a, mommpam wɔn mma wɔnnsane wɔn akyi. <verse eid="DEU 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16"/>Momma wɔntena mo mu wɔ kuro biara a wɔpɛ so a monnnyɛ wɔn aniɛyaadeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ Israelni barima anaa ɔbaa yɛ no ho hyiadan mu odwamanfoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18"/>Mommfa afɔrebɔdeɛ anaa adenya bi a ɛfiri odwamanfoɔ nkyɛn, sɛ ɔyɛ ɔbarima anaa ɔbaa, mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn fie, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn akyiwadeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19"/>Bosea a mobɔ mo yɔnko Israelni no, sɛ ɛyɛ sika, aduane anaa biribi foforɔ no, monnnye ho mfɛntom. <verse eid="DEU 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20"/>Motumi gye bosea ho mfɛntom firi ahɔhoɔ nkyɛn, na ɛnyɛ Israelfoɔ nkyɛn, sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛhyira mo wɔ biribiara a moyɛ mu wɔ asase a morekɔ so akɔfa no.<verse eid="DEU 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21"/>Sɛ mohyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn bɔ a, biribiara a mohyɛɛ no ho bɔ no, monyɛ no ntɛm so. Ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn hwehwɛ sɛ, ɛbɔ a moahyɛ no no, mobɛdi so ntɛm so. Sɛ moanyɛ a, mobɛdi ho fɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22"/>Nanso, sɛ moanhyɛ biribiara ho bɔ a, monyɛɛ bɔne biara. <verse eid="DEU 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23"/>Na sɛ wo ara wofiri wo pɛ mu hyɛ bɔ a, hwɛ yie na di asɛm a woaka no so, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn na woahyɛ no bɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24"/>Wotumi di bobe aba dodoɔ biara wɔ wo yɔnko bobe turom nanso, mfa bi ngu kɛntɛn mu nkɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25"/>Saa ara na mobɛtumi de mo nsa apempan aburoo mmɛtem kakra wɔ mo yɔnko afuom, nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ mode sekan twa.<verse eid="DEU 23:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1"/>Sɛ ɔbarima ware yere na sɛ nʼani nnye ne ho bio, ɛfiri sɛ wahunu ade bɔne bi wɔ ne ho, na sɛ ɔtwerɛ awaregyaeɛ krataa de ma no, na ɔpamoo no firi ne fie, <verse eid="DEU 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2"/>na ɔfiri fie hɔ na ɔbarima foforɔ kɔware no, <verse eid="DEU 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3"/>na ne kunu a ɔtɔ so mmienu no gyaa no anaa sɛ ɔwu a, <verse eid="DEU 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4"/>ne kunu a ɔdi ɛkan a ɔgyaa no no nni ho ɛkwan sɛ ɔware no bio, ɛfiri sɛ, wagu ne ho fi. Ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so. Mommfa afɔbuo mma asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo sɛ agyapadeɛ no so.<verse eid="DEU 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5"/>Sɛ ɔbarima aware foforɔ a, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔde no kɔ ɔko anaasɛ nso wɔde dwuma bi die to no so. Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔtena fie afe a ɔnyɛ adwuma biara sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔbɛma ne yere foforɔ a waware no no anya ahotɔ.<verse eid="DEU 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6"/>Obi nnye adeyam boba kɛseɛ no ne ne ketewa no anaa adeyam boba ketewa no nko ara awowa, ɛfiri sɛ, deɛ ɛyɛ ne dea no, ɛno ho na ɔdidi.<verse eid="DEU 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7"/>Sɛ obi kyere ne yɔnko Israelni na ɔdi no nya sɛ ɔdɔnkɔ anaa ɔtɔn no a, ɛsɛ sɛ onyadifoɔ no wuo. Ɛsɛ sɛ motu bɔne ase firi mo mu.<verse eid="DEU 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8"/>Monhwɛ honam ani nsaneyadeɛ nyinaa yie na monni ɛho mmara a Lewifoɔ asɔfoɔ bɛkyerɛ mo no so; monni mmara a mahyɛ ama mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9"/>Monkae deɛ ɛberɛ a mofiri Misraim reba no <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, yɛɛ Miriam.<verse eid="DEU 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10"/>Sɛ wode biribi fɛm wo yɔnko a, nkɔ wo yɔnko fie nkɔgye awowasideɛ. <verse eid="DEU 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11"/>Gyina afikyire na ɔyɔnko a ɔfɛm wʼadeɛ no de awowasideɛ no bɛbrɛ wo. <verse eid="DEU 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12"/>Sɛ ɔyɔnko no yɛ ohiani na ɔwɔ ntoma baako a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔde si wo awowa a, nkora ntoma no nkɔsi adekyeeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13"/>Fa ntoma no kɔma wo yɔnko no owiatɔberɛ sɛdeɛ ɔde bɛda na wahyira wo. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Onyankopɔn, bɛka sɛ woayɛ wo nyamedwuma na wahyira wo.<verse eid="DEU 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14"/>Nhyɛ ɔpaani mmɔborɔni a ɔyɛ wo nua Israelni anaa ɔhɔhoɔ a ɔte mo nkuro baako mu no so. <verse eid="DEU 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15"/>Tua nʼapaadeɛ ma no ɛda biara ansa na owia akɔtɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔyɛ ohiani na nʼani da saa akatua no so. Anyɛ saa a, ɔbɛsu afrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atia wo, na wobɛdi bɔne ho fɔ.<verse eid="DEU 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ mma bɔne bi a wɔayɛ enti wɔkum wɔn awofoɔ de si anan. Saa ara nso na ɛnsɛ sɛ awofoɔ bɔne bi a wɔayɛ enti wɔkum wɔn mma de si anan. Wɔn a owuo sɛ wɔn no, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum wɔn wɔ wɔn ankasa bɔne ano.<verse eid="DEU 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbu ahɔhoɔ a wɔte mo mu no ne nwisiaa atɛntenenee, na ɛnsɛ sɛ mogye okunafoɔ ɔbaa ntoma de si ɛka a ɔde ho awowa. <verse eid="DEU 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18"/>Daa monkae sɛ, na mo nso moyɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na ɔgyee mo. Ɛno enti na mede saa mmara yi ama mo no.<verse eid="DEU 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19"/>Sɛ woretwa wʼafuo mu nnɔbaeɛ, na wo werɛ firi afi bi wɔ afuom hɔ a, nsane nkɔfa. Gya wɔ hɔ ma ahɔhoɔ, awisiaa anaa akunafoɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛhyira mo nsa ano nnwuma nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20"/>Sɛ wote wo ngo nnua so aba a, nkɔ so mprenu. Gya aba no a aka so no ma ahɔhoɔ, nwisiaa ne akunafoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21"/>Saa nso na wote wo bobe nturo so aba a, nkɔ so mprenu. Gya aba a aka wɔ so no ma ahɔhoɔ, nwisiaa ne akunafoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22"/>Monkae sɛ, moyɛɛ nkoa wɔ Misraim. Ɛno enti na mehyɛ mo sɛ monyɛ yei no.<verse eid="DEU 24:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1"/>Sɛ akasakasa si mmarima baanu ntam a, wɔmfa asɛm no nkɔ asɛnniiɛ na ɔtemmufoɔ no nni asɛm no. Ɔbɛgyaa deɛ ɔdi bem no na wɔatwe deɛ ɔdi fɔ no aso. <verse eid="DEU 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2"/>Sɛ ɔbarima a ɔdi fɔ no fata sɛ wɔtwa no mmaa a, ɔtemmufoɔ no bɛma no ada hɔ na watwa no mmaa dodoɔ a ɛfata ne bɔne no wɔ nʼanim. <verse eid="DEU 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3"/>Nanso, ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔtwa no mmaa boro aduanan. Sɛ wɔtwa no boro saa a, na wɔagu wo nua anim ase wɔ wʼanim.<verse eid="DEU 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4"/>Nkyekyere nantwie a ɔreporo atokoɔ ano.<verse eid="DEU 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5"/>Sɛ nuammarima baanu te fie na wɔn mu baako wu a wanwo ɔba a, ɛnsɛ sɛ okunafoɔ no kɔware ɔhɔhoɔ. Mmom, ne kunu a wawuo no nuabarima na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔware okunafoɔ no, na wayɛ okunu nua asɛdeɛ ama okunafoɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6"/>Abakan a wɔbɛwo no no, wɔde no bɛto nʼagya a wawuo no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, owufoɔ no din rempepa mfiri Israel.<verse eid="DEU 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7"/>Na sɛ ɛba sɛ owufoɔ no nuabarima mpɛ sɛ ɔware ne nua no yere no a, ɔbaa no bɛkɔ kuro no mpanimfoɔ nkyɛn wɔ kuro no ɛpono ano akɔka akyerɛ wɔn sɛ, “Me kunu nua no mpɛ sɛ ne nua no din bɛka Israel. Ɔrentumi nyɛ okunu nua asɛdeɛ mma me.” <verse eid="DEU 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8"/>Afei, ɔbarima no kurom mpanimfoɔ bɛfrɛ no akasa akyerɛ no. Sɛ ɔse pene ara na ɔrempene no so a, ɔbɛka sɛ, “Mempɛ sɛ meware no” a, <verse eid="DEU 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9"/>okunafoɔ no bɛkɔ ɔbarima no anim a mpanimfoɔ no nso wɔ hɔ bi. Ɔbɛworɔ ɔbarima no mpaboa baako, ate ntasuo agu nʼanim na waka sɛ, “Sei na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ ɔbarima a ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔtoa ne nua abusua so.” <verse eid="DEU 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10"/>Wɔbɛfrɛ saa onipa no asefoɔ wɔ Israel sɛ abusua a wɔaworɔ wɔn mpaboa.<verse eid="DEU 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11"/>Sɛ Israelfoɔ mmarima baanu reko na wɔn mu baako yere pɛ sɛ ɔboa ne kunu enti, ɔsɔ ɔbarima baako no barima mu a, <verse eid="DEU 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12"/>ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtwa ɔbaa no nsa no a ahummɔborɔ biara nni mu.<verse eid="DEU 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13"/>Momfa nsania papa nkari adwadeɛ <verse eid="DEU 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14"/>na monsusu adwadeɛ no pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15"/>Aane, momfa nsania pa na monsusu adwadeɛ nso pɛpɛɛpɛ na moanya nkwa nna tenten wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rema mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16"/>Wɔn a wɔfa nsania bɔne ne nkontompo so kari adwadeɛ no yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, akyiwadeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17"/>Mommma mo werɛ mfiri deɛ Amalekfoɔ yɛɛ mo ɛberɛ a mofiri Misraim reba no ɛda biara da. <verse eid="DEU 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18"/>Wɔto hyɛɛ mo so ɛberɛ a moabrɛbrɛ na moatotɔ baha no, na wɔn a wɔaka akyi no nso, wɔbobɔɔ wɔn hwehwee fam. Na wɔnsuro Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="DEU 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19"/>Ɛno enti, sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ma mo ahomegyeɛ firi mo atamfoɔ nyinaa nsam wɔ asase a ɔde rema mo sɛ agyapadeɛ sononko no so a, ɛsɛ sɛ mosɛe Amalekfoɔ, na yɛankae wɔn bio wɔ asase yi so. Mommma mo werɛ mfiri yei da!<verse eid="DEU 25:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Otwa Afɔrebɔdeɛ Ne Ntotosoɔ Du Du</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1"/>Sɛ moduru asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de rebɛma mo sɛ mo agyapadeɛ sononko no so, na moko gye tena so a, <verse eid="DEU 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2"/>momfa otwakane wɔ otwa berɛ biara mu no ngu kɛntɛn mu na momfa mmra baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛyi sɛ wɔnkamfo ne din wɔ hɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3"/>Monkɔ ɔsɔfoɔ a ɔwɔ hɔ saa ɛberɛ no nkyɛn na monka nkyerɛ no sɛ, “Menam saa akyɛdeɛ yi so reda no adi sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn, de me aba asase a ɔhyɛɛ mʼagyanom bɔ no so.” <verse eid="DEU 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4"/>Afei, ɔsɔfoɔ no bɛgye kɛntɛn no afiri wo nsam de asi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn afɔrebukyia no anim. <verse eid="DEU 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5"/>Na wobɛka saa nsɛm yi wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim sɛ, “Na me tete agya Yakob yɛ otutenani Aramni a ɔkɔtenaa Misraim. Nʼabusua no yɛ ketewaa bi, nanso Misraim hɔ no, wɔdɔɔso bebree bɛyɛɛ ɔman kɛseɛ. <verse eid="DEU 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6"/>Ɛberɛ a Misraimfoɔ dii yɛn nya nam so ma yɛyɛɛ wɔn nkoa no, <verse eid="DEU 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7"/>yɛsu frɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn agyanom Onyankopɔn. Ɔtee yɛn sufrɛ na ɔhunuu yɛn amanehunu, ɔbrɛ ne ɔhyɛ a yɛwɔ mu. <verse eid="DEU 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8"/>Enti, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam tumi a ɛyɛ nwanwa, ehubɔ a emu yɛ den, nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛpusu nnipa ne anwanwasɛm so gyee yɛn firii Misraim. <verse eid="DEU 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9"/>Ɔde yɛn baa ha na ɔde asase yi a nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ resene so yi maa yɛn. <verse eid="DEU 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10"/>Afei, Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mede akyɛdeɛ a ɛyɛ mʼaduanekan a wode firi asase mu maa me no rebrɛ wo.” Afei, fa aduane no si <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim na sɔre no. <verse eid="DEU 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11"/>Afei, kɔ na kɔgye wʼani wɔ nneɛma pa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de ama wo ne wo fiefoɔ no ho. Wʼanigyeɛ no mu, kae Lewifoɔ ne ahɔhoɔ a wɔte mo mu no nso.<verse eid="DEU 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12"/>Mfeɛ mmiɛnsa biara, ɛsɛ sɛ moma mo mfudeɛ ho ntotosoɔ dudu sononko. Ɛsɛ sɛ mode saa ntotosoɔ dudu sononko no ma Lewifoɔ, ahɔhoɔ, nwisiaa ne akunafoɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔbɛnya bi adi amee wɔ mo nkuro so. <verse eid="DEU 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13"/>Afei, mompae mu nka wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim sɛ, “Mede akyɛdeɛ kronkron a ɛfiri me fie ama Lewifoɔ, ahɔhoɔ, nwisiaa ne akunafoɔ sɛdeɛ wohyɛɛ me no. Memmuu wo mmara no bi so anaa me werɛ mfirii wo mmara no bi. <verse eid="DEU 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14"/>Manni bi ɛberɛ a meretwa adwo anaasɛ ɛberɛ a na me ho nte no. Afei nso, mamfa me nsa anka bi, na mamfa mu bi nso amma awufoɔ. Matie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, me Onyankopɔn, na mayɛ biribiara a wohyɛɛ me sɛ menyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15"/>Firi wo soro tenabea kronkron hɔ hwɛ fam na hyira wo nkurɔfoɔ Israel ne asase a wode ama yɛn no—asase a nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ retene wɔ so sɛdeɛ wohyɛɛ yɛn agyanom bɔ no.”<verse eid="DEU 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Mmara So Die Ho Nkaeɛbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, hyɛ mo ɛnnɛ sɛ, monni saa mmara yi nyinaa so; momfa mo akoma ne mo kra nyinaa nni so. <verse eid="DEU 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17"/>Moapae mu aka no ɛnnɛ sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ, mo Onyankopɔn, na mobɛnante nʼakwan so na mobɛdi ne mmara so ayɛ ɔsetie ama no. <verse eid="DEU 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka no ɛnnɛ sɛ, moyɛ ne nkurɔfoɔ, nʼagyapadeɛ a nʼakoma da ho sɛdeɛ ɔhyɛɛ bɔ no; ɛno enti, ɛsɛ sɛ modi ne mmara nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19"/>Na sɛ moyɛ saa a, ɔbɛyɛ mo kɛseɛ asene ɔman biara. Afei, mobɛnya nkamfoɔ, animuonyam, na mo din bɛhyeta. Mobɛyɛ ɔman a ɛyɛ kronkron ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn sɛdeɛ ɔhyɛɛ bɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 26:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Bepɔ Ebal Afɔrebukyia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1"/>Mose ne Israel mpanimfoɔ hyɛɛ ɔmanfoɔ no sɛ, “Monni mmara a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi nyinaa so. <verse eid="DEU 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2"/>Sɛ motwa Yordan kɔduru asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn de rema mo no so a, monhyehyɛ aboɔ akɛseɛ na momfa akaadoo nsra ho. <verse eid="DEU 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3"/>Sɛ motwa Yordan kɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn de rema mo no so, asase a ɛwoɔ ne nufosuo resene so no so a, montwerɛ mmara no nyinaa ngu so sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo agyanom Onyankopɔn, hyɛɛ mo bɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4"/>Na sɛ motwa Yordan a, monhyehyɛ aboɔ no wɔ Ebal bepɔ so sɛdeɛ merehyɛ mo ɛnnɛ yi na momfa akaadoo no mfa ho. <verse eid="DEU 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5"/>Monsi afɔrebukyia, aboɔ afɔrebukyia wɔ hɔ mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. Mommfa dadeɛ biribiara nka. <verse eid="DEU 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6"/>Momfa aboɔ nkunkuma nsi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn afɔrebukyia no na mommɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ wɔ so mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="DEU 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7"/>Mommɔ asomdwoeɛ afɔdeɛ nso wɔ so na momfa anigyeɛ nnidi wɔ hɔ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim. <verse eid="DEU 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8"/>Montwerɛ mmara no mu nhyehyɛeɛ nyinaa pɛpɛɛpɛ ngu aboɔ a wɔde akaadoo aka so no so.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnome A Ɛfiri Bepɔ Ebal So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9"/>Afei, Mose ne Lewifoɔ asɔfoɔ kasa kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ no sɛ, “Ao Israel, monyɛ komm na montie! Ɛnnɛ, moabɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn manfoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10"/>Monyɛ ɔsetie mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na monni ne mmara ne nʼahyɛdeɛ a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi so.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11"/>Saa ɛda no ara, Mose hyɛɛ ɔmanfoɔ no sɛ,<verse eid="DEU 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12"/>Sɛ motwa Asubɔnten Yordan a, Simeon, Lewi, Yuda, Isakar, Yosef ne Benyamin mmusuakuo na wɔnnyina Gerisim bepɔ so nhyira ɔman no. <verse eid="DEU 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13"/>Ruben, Gad, Aser, Sebulon, Dan ne Naftali mmusuakuo nso nnyina Ebal bepɔ so nnome.<verse eid="DEU 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14"/>Na afei, Lewifoɔ nteam ngu nnipa a wɔwɔ Israel nyinaa so sɛ:<verse eid="DEU 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15"/>“Nnome nka onipa a ɔbɛyɛ ohoni a wɔasene anaa deɛ wɔagu de ahyɛ kɔkoam. Saa ahoni adwumfoɔ nsaano nnwuma yi yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyiwadeɛ.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:15">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔbɛbu nʼagya anaa ne maame animtia.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:16">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔsesa hyeɛ nam so bɔ ne yɔnko korɔno.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:17">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔma onifirani fom ɛkwan.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:18">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔsisi ahɔhoɔ, nwisiaa ne akunafoɔ.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:19">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔne nʼagya yere bɛda, ɛfiri sɛ, wagu nʼagya mpa ho fi.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:20">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔne aboa bɛda.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:21">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔne ne nuabaa bɛda, sɛ ɔyɛ nʼagya babaa anaa ne maame babaa.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:22">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔne nʼase baa bɛda.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:23">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔbɛkum ɔfoforɔ wɔ kɔkoam.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:24">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25"/>“Nnome nka obiara a ɔgye apaabɔdeɛ na ɔkum onipa a ɔnyɛɛ bɔne biara.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:25">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26"/>“Nnome nka obiara a wanni mmaransɛm yi so na wannye anto mu.”</para>
  <para style="pr" vid="DEU 27:26">Na ɔman no nyinaa bɛgye so sɛ, “Amen!”<verse eid="DEU 27:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsetie Mu Nhyira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1"/>Na sɛ motie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na modi mmara a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi so a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛpagya mo asene aman a wɔwɔ ewiase nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2"/>Sɛ motie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn a, mobɛnya saa nhyira yi nyinaa:<verse eid="DEU 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3"/>Wɔbɛhyira mo wɔ mo nkuro ne mo ɔman mu.<verse eid="DEU 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4"/>Wɔde mma bebree ne nsase bereɛ bɛhyira mo. Wɔde anantwie ne nnwan a wɔn ase dɔre bɛhyira mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5"/>Wɔde nnuaba nkɛntɛn ma ma, ne mmɔre kodoɔ a burodo ahyɛ so ma bɛhyira mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6"/>Wɔbɛhyira mo wɔ baabiara a mobɛkɔ, mo fieba mu ne mo adifire mu.<verse eid="DEU 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7"/>Sɛ atamfoɔ to hyɛ mo so a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛdi wɔn so. Wɔbɛfiri baabi ato ahyɛ mo so na wɔafa akwan nson so ahwete afiri mo anim.<verse eid="DEU 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8"/>Biribiara a mobɛyɛ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛhyira so na ɔde aburoo ahyɛ mo apata ma ma. <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛhyira mo wɔ asase a ɔde rema mo no so.<verse eid="DEU 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9"/>Sɛ modi <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, mmara no so na monante nʼakwan so a, Awurade bɛgyina mo sɛ ne nnipa kronkron sɛdeɛ ɔhyɛɛ mo bɔ sɛ ɔbɛyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10"/>Afei, ewiase aman nyinaa bɛhunu sɛ, moyɛ nnipa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> afa mo, na wɔbɛsuro mo. <verse eid="DEU 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mo nneɛma pa ma aboro so ma—nyɛmmoa ne afudeɛ pii wɔ asase a ɔhyɛɛ mo agyanom bɔ sɛ ɔde bɛma wɔn no so.<verse eid="DEU 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> firi nʼahonya dodoɔ a ɛwɔ soro no mu bɛma osuo atotɔ wɔ ne berɛ mu, nam so ahyira mo nnwuma a moyɛ so. Mobɛfɛm aman pii nanso, mo deɛ, moremfɛm hwee mfiri wɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="DEU 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13"/>Sɛ motie saa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, mmara yi na modi so a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyɛ mo ti na ɛnyɛ nan, na moakorɔn. <verse eid="DEU 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ motwe mo ho firi mmara a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ yi biara ho sɛ morekɔdi anyame foforɔ akyi asom wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asoɔden Mu Nnome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15"/>Na sɛ moantie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anni ne mmara nyinaa a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ no so a, saa nnome yi nyinaa bɛba abɛbunkam afa mo so.<verse eid="DEU 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16"/>Nnome bɛka mo wɔ mo nkuro ne mo ɔman mu.<verse eid="DEU 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17"/>Wɔde nkɛntɛn a aduaba biara nni mu ne mmɔre kodoɔ a burodo nni mu bɛdome mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18"/>Wɔde mma kakra bi ne nsase bonini bɛdome mo. Wɔde anantwie ne nnwan abonini bɛdome mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19"/>Baabiara a mobɛkorɔ, mo fieba ne mo adifire mu, wɔbɛdome mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma nnome, basabasayɛ ne hwammɔdie aba adeɛ biara a moyɛ mu, kɔsi sɛ awieeɛ no wɔbɛsɛe mo koraa sɛ moayɛ bɔne na moagya me enti. <verse eid="DEU 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de nyarewa bɛba mo so akɔsi sɛ ɔbɛsɛe mo nyinaa wɔ asase a morebɛkɔ akɔfa no so. <verse eid="DEU 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de yadeɛ a ɛbɛma mo afonfɔn bɛka mo. Ɔbɛma huraeɛ ne ahonhono abɔ mo na wama ɔhyeɛ a ano yɛ den, mfudeɛ nyarewa ne kakawirewire aba mo so na aha mo ara kɔsi sɛ mo ase bɛhye. <verse eid="DEU 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23"/>Ɔsoro a ɛkata mo tiri so no bɛdane sumpii na ɛfam adane dadeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛdane osutɔ a ɛwɔ mo ɔman mu no mfuturo; ɛbɛpore afiri soro agu mo so kɔsi sɛ mobɛsɛe.<verse eid="DEU 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mo atamfoɔ adi mo so nkonim. Mobɛfa baabi akɔto ahyɛ mo atamfoɔ so, nanso, mobɛfa akwan nson so adwane afiri wɔn anim. Mobɛyɛ ahodwiredeɛ wɔ ahennie a ɛwɔ asase yi so nyinaa ani so. <verse eid="DEU 28:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26"/>Mo afunu bɛyɛ nnomaa ne wiram mmoa aduane, na obiara nso nni hɔ saa ɛberɛ no a ɔbɛpam wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mpɔmpɔ a ɛsisii mo wɔ Misraim no bi asisi mo. Na ɔde nsisiiwa, ntutuiɛ ne ntwom a wɔrentumi nsa bɛbobɔ mo. <verse eid="DEU 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de adammɔ, anifiraeɛ ne ayamhyehyeɛ bɛto mo so. <verse eid="DEU 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29"/>Mode mo nsa bɛhwehwɛ ɛkwan awia ketee te sɛ deɛ onifirani de ne nsa keka anadwo. Biribiara a moyɛ no, morenni mu nkonim. Wɔbɛhyɛ mo so, abɔ mo korɔno daa na obiara mmɛgye mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30"/>Mobɛgye ɔbaa aware nso obi ne no bɛda. Mobɛsi dan nso obi hunu na ɔbɛtena mu. Mobɛdɔ bobefuo nanso monnni mu aba. <verse eid="DEU 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31"/>Wɔbɛkum mo nantwie wɔ mo anim nanso morennya ne nam bi nwe. Wɔbɛgye mo afunumu afiri mo nsam a, ɔrensane mma bio. Wɔde mo dwan bɛma mo atamfoɔ na morennya ɔboafoɔ a ɔbɛgye no ama mo. <verse eid="DEU 28:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32"/>Wɔde mo mmammarima ne mo mmammaa bɛma ɔman foforɔ na daa mobɛhwɛ wɔn ara ama mo ani atɔre sia, nanso morentumi nyɛ ho hwee. <verse eid="DEU 28:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33"/>Nnipa a monnim wɔn na wɔbɛfo mo mfuo mu nnɔbaeɛ adi, na daa wɔasane ahyɛ mo so. <verse eid="DEU 28:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34"/>Na mo ani so adeɛ a mobɛhunu no bɛbɔ mo dam. <verse eid="DEU 28:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mpɔmpɔ a ɛyɛ ya a wɔko a ɛnko abobɔ mo kotodwe ne mo nan ho na atrɛ afiri mo nan aseɛ akɔsi mo tiri so.<verse eid="DEU 28:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛpamo mo ne mo ɔhene a ɔdi mo so no akɔ ɔman bi a mo ne mo agyanom nnim so so. Ɛhɔ na mobɛsom anyame foforɔ, anyame a wɔde nnua ne aboɔ ayɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37"/>Aman a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de mobɛkɔ so no nyinaa so, mobɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ ne aseredeɛ ama wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 28:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38"/>Mobɛdua bebree nanso mobɛtwa kakraa bi, ɛfiri sɛ, ntutummɛ bɛwe mo mfudeɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39"/>Mobɛyɛ bobe nturo ahwɛ so yie nanso monnnom anaa monnni so aba, ɛfiri sɛ, asonson bɛsɛe bobe no. <verse eid="DEU 28:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40"/>Mobɛdua ngo nnua afa mo nsase so nyinaa nanso monnnya mu ngo biara, ɛfiri sɛ, aba no bɛte agu fam ɛberɛ a ɛmmereɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41"/>Mobɛwo mmammarima ne mmammaa nanso ɛnyɛ mo na mobɛtete wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔbɛkyere wɔn de wɔn akɔ nkoasom mu. <verse eid="DEU 28:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42"/>Mo mfuo nyinaa, mmoawa bɛsɛe no.<verse eid="DEU 28:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43"/>Ahɔhoɔ a wɔte mo mu no bɛnya ahoɔden anya no mmorosoɔ, na mo deɛ, mobɛyɛ mmerɛ ayɛ mmerɛ mmorosoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44"/>Wɔbɛbɔ mo bosea a moremmɔ wɔn bi. Wɔbɛyɛ tiri na moayɛ nan.<verse eid="DEU 28:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45"/>Sɛ moanyɛ ɔsetie amma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anni mmara a ɔde ama mo no so a, saa nnome yi nyinaa bɛdi mo akyi na abunkam afa mo so kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛsɛe mo. <verse eid="DEU 28:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46"/>Saa nsɛm a ɛyɛ hu yi bɛba sɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ne kɔkɔbɔ ama mo ne mo asefoɔ daa nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 28:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47"/>Esiane sɛ moamfa anigyeɛ ne ahosɛpɛ ansom <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn wɔ mfasoɔ dodoɔ a moanya no ho enti, <verse eid="DEU 28:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48"/>mobɛsom mo atamfoɔ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛsoma wɔn abɛtia mo no. Ɛkɔm bɛde mo; sukɔm bɛde mo; mobɛda adagya na biribiara ho ahia mo. Wɔbɛhyɛ mo kɔnnua kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛsɛe mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ɔman bi a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri baabi wɔ asase ano bɛba abɛtia mo na wɔato ahyɛ mo so te sɛ ɔkɔdeɛ. Ɛyɛ ɔman a monte wɔn kasa; <verse eid="DEU 28:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50"/>ɔman a wɔn ho yɛ hu na wɔn akoma apirim na wɔmmu ɔpanin, nni ahummɔborɔ ma abɔfra. <verse eid="DEU 28:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51"/>Nʼasraadɔm bɛto ahyɛ mo nyɛmmoa ne mo nnɔbaeɛ so na ɛkɔm ade mo yie ama moawuwu. Wɔrennya aburoo, nsã, ngo, nantwie mma anaa nnwan mma mma mo, na ɛnam so ama mo asɛe. <verse eid="DEU 28:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52"/>Wɔbɛtua mo nkuropɔn nyinaa. Afasuo denden a mode mo ho too so sɛ ɛbɛbɔ mo ho ban wɔ mo asase no so no nyinaa, wɔbɛka agu fam. Wɔbɛto ahyɛ nkuro a ɛwɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn de ama mo no so.<verse eid="DEU 28:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53"/>Esiane ɔhaw ne abɛbrɛsɛ a ɔtamfoɔ de bɛba mo so wɔ otua no mu no enti, mobɛwe mo mmammarima ne mmammaa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ama mo no ɛnam mono. <verse eid="DEU 28:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54"/>Mpo, mo mu ɔhobrɛaseni ne mmɔborɔni a ɔwɔ mo mu no renhunu ɔno ara ne nuabarima anaa ne yere a ɔdɔ no no ne ne mma a wɔte ase no so mmɔbɔ, <verse eid="DEU 28:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55"/>na ɔremma wɔn mu biara ɛnam no bi nwe. Esiane sɛ, ɔnni biribi a aka a ɔbɛwe wɔ otua no a mo atamfoɔ no bɛtua mo nkuropɔn no nyinaa enti. <verse eid="DEU 28:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56"/>Mo mu ɔbaa a ɔbrɛ ne ho ase na ɔwɔ nkatedeɛ wɔ ne mu, a mpo ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔde ne nan bɛsi fam no, ɔbɛnya ne kunu a ɔdɔ no ne ɔno ara ne mmammarima anaa ne mmammaa ho menasepɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57"/>Ɔbaa no de awodeɛ ne abɔfra a wawo no foforɔ no bɛsie wɔn sɛdeɛ ɔbɛtumi awe ne nyinaa kɔkoam. Esiane ɔhaw ne abɛbrɛsɛ a mo atamfoɔ de bɛba mo nkuro nyinaa so no enti, biribiara renka a wɔbɛwe wɔ otua no mu.<verse eid="DEU 28:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58"/>Sɛ moanni mmara no nyinaa a wɔatwerɛ wɔ saa nwoma yi mu no so na moansuro onimuonyamfoɔ ne ɔnwanwani <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn no din a, <verse eid="DEU 28:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ɔyaredɔm a ɛyɛ hu bɛbrɛ mo ne mo asefoɔ. Saa yaredɔm yi ano bɛyɛ den na ɛrennyae. Mobɛka nnompe na moayɛ mmɔbɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60"/>Ɔde yadeɛ a ɛbaa mo so wɔ Misraim a ɛbɔɔ mo hu no bɛbrɛ mo a ɛremfiri mo so da. <verse eid="DEU 28:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛsane de nyarewa ahodoɔ bebree ne amanehunu a wɔntwerɛɛ no mmara nwoma no mu bɛbrɛ mo kɔsi sɛ mobɛsɛe. <verse eid="DEU 28:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62"/>Mo a na modɔɔso te sɛ ɔsoro nsoromma no, mo so bɛte koraa, ɛfiri sɛ, moantie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="DEU 28:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63"/>Sɛdeɛ na ɛyɛ Awurade anisɔ sɛ ɔbɛma mo akɔ so no, saa ara nso na ɛbɛyɛ no anisɔ sɛ ɔbɛdwerɛ mo na wasɛe mo. Ɔbɛtutu mo ase afiri asase a morekɔ so akɔfa no so.<verse eid="DEU 28:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ mo apansam afra aman nyinaa firi asase ano kɔsi asase ano. Ɛhɔ na mobɛsom ahɔhoɔ anyame a mo anaa mo agyanom nhunuu bi da; anyame a wɔde nnua ne aboɔ ayɛ! <verse eid="DEU 28:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65"/>Saa aman no so morennya dwanekɔbea anaa ahomegyeɛ. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mo akoma atutu na mo ani ayɛ siamoo na mo kra akusa. <verse eid="DEU 28:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66"/>Mo asetena bɛdi nsensɛnmu. Anadwo ne awia nyinaa mobɛbɔ ehu a morennya gyidie biara sɛ mobɛhunu anɔpa hann. <verse eid="DEU 28:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67"/>Anɔpa mobɛka sɛ, “Sɛ ɛyɛɛ anadwo a!” Na anwummerɛ nso mobɛka sɛ, “Sɛ ɛyɛɛ anɔpa a!” Mobɛka saa, ɛfiri sɛ, mohunu sɛ ehu atwa mo ho ahyia. <verse eid="DEU 28:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma mo asane akɔ Misraim wɔ ahyɛn mu, akwantuo a mehyɛɛ mo bɔ sɛ morentu bio no. Ɛhɔ na mode mo ho bɛma mo atamfoɔ sɛ wɔntɔ mo sɛ nkoa, nanso obiara rempɛ sɛ ɔbɛtɔ mo.<verse eid="DEU 28:68"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Apam No Ntimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1"/>Yei ne nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛwɔ apam a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose sɛ ɔne Israelfoɔ no nyɛ wɔ Moab nka apam a ɔne wɔn yɛɛ no wɔ Horeb no.<verse eid="DEU 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2"/>Mose frɛɛ Israelfoɔ no nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 29:2"/>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 29:2">Mo ahunu deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛɛ Farao ne ne mpanimfoɔ ne ne ɔman nyinaa wɔ Misraim no. <verse eid="DEU 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3"/>Mo ankasa mohunuu sɔhwɛ akɛseɛ, nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛyɛ hu ne anwanwadeɛ akɛseɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4"/>Nanso, ɛbɛsi ɛnnɛ yi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmaa mo adwene a ɛte asɛm ase anaa ani a ɛhunu adeɛ anaa aso a ɛte asɛm. <verse eid="DEU 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5"/>Mfeɛ aduanan mu a medii mo anim faa ɛserɛ so no, mo ntoma antete; saa ara na mo mpaboa a ɛhyɛ mo nan nso anhi. <verse eid="DEU 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6"/>Moanni aduane, annom nsã anaa nsã a ano yɛ den. Meyɛɛ saa sɛdeɛ mobɛhunu sɛ mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, no.<verse eid="DEU 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7"/>Yɛduruu ha no, Hesbonhene Sihon ne Basanhene Og ba bɛko tiaa yɛn, nanso, yɛdii wɔn so. <verse eid="DEU 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8"/>Yɛfaa wɔn asase de maa Ruben ne Gad mmusuakuo ne Manase abusuakuo fa no sɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9"/>Ɛno enti, monni saa apam yi so sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, biribiara a mobɛyɛ no bɛyɛ yie. <verse eid="DEU 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10"/>Mo nyinaa—mo mmusuakuo mpanimfoɔ, mo atemmufoɔ, mo ahwɛfoɔ ne Israel mmarima nyinaa, ɛnnɛ mogyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, anim, <verse eid="DEU 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11"/>mo ne mo mma ne mo yerenom ne ahɔhoɔ a wɔte mo mu a wɔbu mo nnua, soa mo nsuo. <verse eid="DEU 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12"/>Mogyina ha sɛ mo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, rebɛyɛ apam, apam a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo reyɛ ɛnnɛ. Ɔde ntam bɛsɔ ano, <verse eid="DEU 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13"/>na wasi so gyinaeɛ sɛ ɛnnɛ, moyɛ ne nkurɔfoɔ na ɔno nso bɛyɛ mo Onyankopɔn sɛdeɛ ɔhyɛɛ mo bɔ no na ɔkaa ntam kyerɛɛ mo agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob no. <verse eid="DEU 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14"/>Mereyɛ saa apam yi a ne ntam bata ho. Apam yi, ɛnyɛ mo a <verse eid="DEU 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15"/>mo ne yɛn gyina ha ɛnnɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn anim no nko dea. Na mmom ɛwɔ hɔ ma wɔn a wɔnni ha nso.<verse eid="DEU 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16"/>Mo ankasa monim sɛdeɛ yɛtenaa Misraim ne sɛdeɛ yɛreba ha no yɛfaa aman so bɛsii ha. <verse eid="DEU 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17"/>Mohunuu akyiwadeɛ ahoni a wɔde nnua ne aboɔ ne dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ ayɛ wɔ wɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="DEU 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18"/>Monhwɛ yie sɛ ɔbarima anaa ɔbaa anaa abusua biara a wɔwɔ mo mu ɛnnɛ no mu biara akoma rennane mfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ho nkɔsom saa aman yi anyame; monhunu sɛ, duhini biara nni mo mu a ɛpu bɔnwoma a ɛyɛ nwono saa.<verse eid="DEU 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ obiara a ɔte nnome ho kɔkɔbɔ nsɛm yi susu sɛ ɔno deɛ hwee renka no. Mma no nka wɔ ne tirim sɛ, “Me ho sɔnn, ɛmfa ho sɛ menam asoɔden kwan so.” Yei de ɔsɛeɛ a ɛso bɛba. <verse eid="DEU 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> remfa nkyɛ saa nnipa no. Nʼabufuo ne ne ninkunu bɛhye atia wɔn. Nnome a wɔatwerɛ no saa nwoma yi mu nyinaa bɛba wɔn so na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛpepa wɔn din afiri ɔsoro ase. <verse eid="DEU 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛtwe wɔn afiri Israel mmusuakuo nyinaa mu na wahwie apam no mu nnome nyinaa a wɔatwerɛ wɔ saa mmara nwoma no mu agu wɔn so.<verse eid="DEU 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22"/>Afei, nkyirimma a wɔbɛba, wɔn a wɔfiri mo ase ne wɔn a wɔfiri ahɔhoɔ ase a wɔfiri akyirikyiri asase so bɛhunu asase no sɛeɛ ne nyarewa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de bɛbrɛ asase no. <verse eid="DEU 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23"/>Wɔbɛhunu sɛ, wɔn asase no dɔteɛ adane sɔfe ne nkyene a wɔdua so biribiara a ɛnyɛ yie, na hwee nso nnyini wɔ so—mpo, ɛserɛ ahahan. Ɛbɛyɛ te sɛ Sodom ne Gomora, Adma ne Seboim a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛee no nʼabufuo mu no. <verse eid="DEU 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24"/>Aman a atwa ahyia no bɛbisa sɛ, “Adɛn enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ saa asase yi saa? Adɛn enti na ne bo fu denden saa?”<verse eid="DEU 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25"/>Na wɔbɛka akyerɛ wɔn sɛ, “Saa asɛm yi siiɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa a wɔwɔ asase no so buu apam a wɔne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn agyanom Onyankopɔn yɛeɛ ɛberɛ a ɔyii wɔn firii Misraim asase so. <verse eid="DEU 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26"/>Wɔdane kɔsom anyame foforɔ a wɔyɛ ahɔhoɔ ma wɔn, anyame a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnsom. <verse eid="DEU 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27"/>Ɛno enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo dɛre tiaa saa asase yi, nam so de nnome a wɔatwerɛ wɔ saa nwoma yi mu no baa wɔn so no. <verse eid="DEU 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28"/>Abufuhyeɛ mu, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tutuu ne nkurɔfoɔ ase firii wɔn asase so twaa wɔn asuo de wɔn kɔguu asase foforɔ a wɔte so seesei no.”<verse eid="DEU 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29"/>Ahintasɛm nyinaa firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn hɔ, na nneɛma a wada no adi akyerɛ yɛn ne yɛn asefoɔ no, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛhyɛ no nso, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, yɛbɛdi ne mmaransɛm yi so.<verse eid="DEU 29:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Nkyɛn Ba Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1"/>Sɛ nhyira ne nnome a mede ato mo anim no nyinaa ba mo so wɔ baabiara a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn bɛhwete mo akɔ wɔ aman no mu, <verse eid="DEU 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2"/>na mo ne mo mma sane ba <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, nkyɛn, na mode mo akoma ne mo kra nyinaa yɛ ɔsetie ma no sɛdeɛ merekyerɛ mo ɛnnɛ yi a, <verse eid="DEU 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3"/>ɛnneɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn de mo akradeɛ bɛma mo, na wahunu mo mmɔbɔ, na waboaboa mo ano bio afiri amanaman a ɔbɔɔ mo hwete kɔɔ so no nyinaa, asane de mo aba bio. <verse eid="DEU 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4"/>Sɛ mpo, wɔapam mo kɔ akyirikyiri asase bi a ɛwɔ ɔsoro ase a, ɛfiri hɔ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛboaboa mo ano asane de mo aba bio. <verse eid="DEU 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn de mo bɛba asase a ɛyɛ mo agyanom dea so, na moafa sɛ agyapadeɛ. Ɔbɛma mo adi yie na mo adɔɔso asene mo agyanom. <verse eid="DEU 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛtene mo ne mo asefoɔ akoma so sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mode mo akoma ne mo kra nyinaa bɛdɔ no na moatena. <verse eid="DEU 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, de saa nnome yi nyinaa bɛgu mo atamfoɔ ne wɔn a wɔtaa mo no so. <verse eid="DEU 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8"/>Afei, mobɛsane atie, adi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmara a mede rema mo ɛnnɛ no so. <verse eid="DEU 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛma biribiara a moyɛ no asi mo yie. Ɔbɛma mo mma pii. Mo nyɛmmoa bɛdɔɔso. Na mo mfuo mu nnɔbaeɛ nso bɛbu so, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ani bɛgye sɛ ɔbɛma mo adi yie sɛdeɛ na ɔyɛ mo agyanom no. <verse eid="DEU 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10"/>Sɛ motie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, nne, na modi nʼahyɛdeɛ ne ne mmara a wɔatwerɛ wɔ saa mmara nwoma no mu no so, na mode mo akoma ne mo kra dɔ no a, nʼani bɛgye mo yiedie ho.<verse eid="DEU 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owuo Ne Nkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11"/>Nokorɛm, saa mmara a merehyɛ ama mo ɛnnɛ yi sodie nyɛ den, na ɛnyɛ adeɛ a morentumi nyɛ nso. <verse eid="DEU 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12"/>Ɛnni soro a enti mobɛka sɛ, “Hwan na ɔbɛkɔ soro ama yɛn na wakɔgye abrɛ yɛn, na yɛate adi so?” <verse eid="DEU 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13"/>Saa ara nso na ɛnni ɛpo agya a enti mobɛka sɛ, “Hwan na ɔbɛtwa akɔ ɛpo fa nohoa ama yɛn na wakɔgye abrɛ yɛn, na yɛate adi so?” <verse eid="DEU 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14"/>Dabi, asɛm no abɛn wo. Ɛda wʼano, na ɛwɔ wʼakoma mu. Ɛno enti, monni so.<verse eid="DEU 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15"/>Montie, ɛnnɛ, mede nkwa ne nkɔsoɔ, owuo ne ɔsɛeɛ asi mo anim. <verse eid="DEU 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16"/>Sɛ motie <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, mmara a merehyɛ ama mo ɛnnɛ yi, nam so dɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, nante nʼakwan mu, di ne mmara so a, mobɛnya nkwa na mo ase adɔre, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn bɛhyira mo wɔ asase a morekɔ akɔtena so no so.<verse eid="DEU 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17"/>Nanso sɛ mo akoma dane, sɛ moanyɛ ɔsetie, na sɛ wɔtwe mo kɔkoto anyame foforɔ, na mosom wɔn a, <verse eid="DEU 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18"/>mepae mu ka kyerɛ mo ɛnnɛ sɛ, nokorɛm wɔbɛsɛe mo; morentena asase a moretwa Yordan akɔ so akɔfa sɛ agyapadeɛ no so nkyɛ.<verse eid="DEU 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19"/>Nnɛ mede nkwa ne owuo, nhyira ne nnome, asi mo anim sɛ monyi deɛ mopɛ. Mefrɛ ɔsoro ne asase sɛ adansefoɔ. Momfa nkwa, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mo ne mo asefoɔ bɛnya nkwa! <verse eid="DEU 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20"/>Monnɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. Monyɛ ɔsetie mma no, na momfa mo ho mma no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno ne mo nkwa. Ɛno na mobɛtena ase akyɛre wɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma mo tete agyanom Abraham, Isak ne Yakob no.<verse eid="DEU 30:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Di Mose Adeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Mose kaa saa nsɛm yi kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ wieeɛ no, <verse eid="DEU 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2"/>ɔkaa bio sɛ, “Seesei madi mfeɛ ɔha ne aduonu enti, merentumi nni mo anim bio. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ me sɛ merentwa Asubɔnten Yordan. <verse eid="DEU 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, ankasa bɛdi mo anim atwa. Ɔbɛsɛe aman a wɔte hɔ na mobɛfa wɔn asase no. Yosua ne onipa foforɔ a ɔbɛdi mo anim sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ mo bɔ no. <verse eid="DEU 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛsɛe amanaman a wɔte asase no so no sɛdeɛ ɔsɛee Sihon ne Og a na wɔyɛ Amorifoɔ ahemfo no. <verse eid="DEU 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> de nnipa a wɔte hɔ no bɛhyɛ mo nsa na mo ne wɔn bɛdi no sɛdeɛ mɛhyɛ mo no. <verse eid="DEU 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6"/>Monyɛ den na mo bo nyɛ duru! Monnsuro wɔn! <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, bɛdi mo anim. Ɔrenni mo hwammɔ na ɔrennya mo nso.”<verse eid="DEU 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7"/>Afei, Mose frɛɛ Yosua ka kyerɛɛ no Israelfoɔ no nyinaa anim sɛ, “Yɛ den na yɛ nnam, na wo na wode ɔman yi bɛkɔ asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa wɔn agyanom ntam sɛ ɔde bɛma wɔn no so; na wo na wobɛkyɛ ama wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔredi wʼanim. Ɔbɛka wo ho; ɔrenni wo hwammɔ na ɔrennya wo, enti nsuro na mma wʼakoma ntu!”<verse eid="DEU 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara No Akenkan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9"/>Afei, Mose twerɛɛ mmara yi too hɔ; ɔde maa asɔfoɔ a wɔyɛ Lewi mmammarima a wɔsoaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apam adaka no ne Israel mpanimfoɔ nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10"/>Mose hyɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mfeɛ nson biara awieeɛ, Asese Afahyɛ mu no, wɔmfa obiara ka a ɔde no nkyɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11"/>Israelfoɔ nyinaa nhyia wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn anim wɔ baabi a ɔbɛkyerɛ no, na moakan saa mmara yi wɔ wɔn anim ama wɔate. <verse eid="DEU 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12"/>Frɛ nnipa no nyinaa, mmarima, mmaa, mmɔfra ne ahɔhoɔ a wɔte mo nkuro so nso sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔbɛte na wɔbɛsua sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, na wɔbɛdi mmara no so pɛpɛɛpɛ, <verse eid="DEU 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13"/>na ama wɔn mma a wɔnnim mmara no ate na wɔasua sɛdeɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, mmerɛ dodoɔ a mote asase a moretwam afa Yordan akɔfa sɛ agyapadeɛ so no.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔka Israel Asoɔden Ho Asɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Wo owuo berɛ aso. Frɛ Yosua na fa no kɔ ntomadan no mu na mede nʼadwuma bɛhyɛ ne nsa wɔ hɔ.” Enti Mose ne Yosua kɔdaa wɔn ho adi wɔ ntomadan no mu.<verse eid="DEU 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii ne ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn wɔ fadum omununkum mu wɔ ntomadan kronkron no aboboano. <verse eid="DEU 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose “Ɛrenkyɛre, wobɛwu na woakɔka wʼagyanom ho. Wo wuo akyi no, saa nnipa yi bɛfiti aseɛ asom anyame ahɔhoɔ, anyame a wɔwɔ asase a wɔrekɔ so no. Wɔbɛpa me na wɔabu apam a me ne wɔn hyehyɛeɛ no so. <verse eid="DEU 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17"/>Ɛba saa a, mʼabufuo bɛdɛre atia wɔn. Mɛpa wɔn, na mede mʼanim asie wɔn na wɔbɛsɛe wɔn. Ɔhaw a emu yɛ den bɛba wɔn so ama wɔaka sɛ, ‘Saa ɔhaw yi twa sɛ ɛba, ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn nni yɛn nkyɛn bio.’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18"/>Saa ɛberɛ no mede mʼanim bɛsie wɔn ɛsiane wɔn bɔne ahodoɔ a wɔayɛ afa anyame foforɔ a wɔsom no ho enti.<verse eid="DEU 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19"/>“Afei, montwerɛ saa dwom yi mu nsɛm mfa na monkyerɛ Israelfoɔ no, na wɔnto sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ adansedeɛ ama me, na mede atia wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20"/>Mede wɔn bɛba asase a nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ resene wɔ so sɛdeɛ mekaa ntam hyɛɛ wɔn agyanom bɔ no. Na wɔdidi mee yɛ akɛseɛ a, afei, wɔbɛdane wɔn ani akɔsom anyame afoforɔ apo me, na wɔnam so abu mʼapam no so. <verse eid="DEU 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21"/>Afei, ɔhaw ne akwansideɛ bebree ba wɔn so a, ɛdwom yi bɛtia wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn asefoɔ werɛ remfiri da. Menim deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ ansa koraa na mede wɔn bɛba asase a maka ho ntam ahyɛ bɔ no so.” <verse eid="DEU 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22"/>Enti, Mose twerɛɛ dwom no guu hɔ saa ɛda no, na ɔkyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Nun babarima Yosua sɛ, “Yɛ den na yɛ nnam, ɛfiri sɛ, wo na wode Israelfoɔ bɛba asase a mekaa ntam hyɛɛ ho bɔ no so, na mʼankasa mɛka mo ho.”<verse eid="DEU 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24"/>Ɛberɛ a Mose twerɛɛ mmaransɛm no nyinaa guu nwoma mu wieeɛ no, <verse eid="DEU 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25"/>ɔde saa ɔhyɛ nsɛm yi maa Lewifoɔ a wɔsoaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apam adaka no: <verse eid="DEU 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26"/>“Momfa saa Mmara Nwoma yi nkɔto <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn, apam adaka no nkyɛn. Ɛhɔ na ɛbɛda sɛ adansedeɛ a ɛtia Israelfoɔ. <verse eid="DEU 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, menim sɛdeɛ moyɛ atuatefoɔ ne asoɔden. Mpo, me ne mo da so wɔ hɔ yi, moate <char style="nd">Awurade</char> so atua. Na me wuo akyi no, atua bɛn na morente! <verse eid="DEU 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28"/>Momfrɛ mo mpanimfoɔ nyinaa ne mo mmusuakuo ntuanofoɔ nyinaa sɛdeɛ mɛtumi akasa akyerɛ wɔn na mafrɛ ɔsoro ne asase de adi adanseɛ atia wɔn. <verse eid="DEU 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29"/>Menim sɛ me wuo akyi, mobɛsɛe koraa na moapae afiri ɛkwan a makyerɛ mo sɛ momfa so no so. Mmerɛ a ɛreba no mu, amanehunu bɛba mo so, ɛfiri sɛ, monam bɔne a mobɛyɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim no so bɛhyɛ no abufuhyeɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose Dwom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30"/>Enti, Mose kaa dwom no mu nsɛm nyinaa kyerɛɛ Israelfoɔ a wɔahyia wɔ hɔ no.<verse eid="DEU 31:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1"/>Monyɛ aso, Ao ɔsoro na mɛkasa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">Tie, Ao asase, nsɛm a ɛfiri mʼanom.<verse eid="DEU 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2"/>Me nkyerɛkyerɛ bɛtɔ agu mo so sɛ nsuo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">me kasa bɛgu sɛ obosuo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">Me nsɛm bɛtɔ sɛ osuo a ɛgu ɛserɛ foforɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">te sɛ nsuo a ɛpete afifideɛ foforɔ so.<verse eid="DEU 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3"/>Mɛbɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">Animuonyam wɔ yɛn Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="DEU 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4"/>Ɔyɛ Ɔbotan; nʼadwuma yɛ pɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">Biribiara a ɔyɛ nam ne kwan so, na ɛyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn nokwafoɔ a ɔnyɛ mfomsoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">Ɔteneneeni ne nokwafoɔ ne no.<verse eid="DEU 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5"/>Nanso wɔayɛ amumuyɛsɛm atia no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">sɛ wɔyɛ saa a, na wɔyɛ ne mma anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">Wɔyɛ adaadaafoɔ ne nkyirimma kɔntɔnkye.<verse eid="DEU 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6"/>Saa na ɛsɛ sɛ mo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> di no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Mo nkwaseafoɔ ne adwenemherɛfoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Ɛnyɛ ɔno ne mo Agya, mo yɛfoɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Ɛnyɛ ɔno na ɔbɔɔ mo na ɔmaa mo nnyinasoɔ?<verse eid="DEU 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7"/>Monkae tete nna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">monnwene awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ a atwam ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Mommisa mo agya na ɔbɛkyerɛ mo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">Mommisa mo mpanimfoɔ na wɔbɛka akyerɛ mo.<verse eid="DEU 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8"/>Ɛberɛ a Ɔsorosoroni kyekyɛɛ nsase maa amanaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">na ɔkyekyɛɛ adasamma mu no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:8">ɔtotoo ahyeɛ maa nnipa no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">sɛdeɛ Israelfoɔ no ano sie.<verse eid="DEU 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, Israelfoɔ yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Yakob yɛ nʼagyapadeɛ sononko.<verse eid="DEU 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10"/>Ɔhunuu wɔn wɔ ɛserɛ asase so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">Asase kesee a hwee nni so so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Ɔtwaa wɔn ho hyiaeɛ, hwɛɛ wɔn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">Wɛn wɔn sɛ nʼagyapadeɛ a ɛsom bo.<verse eid="DEU 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11"/>Sɛdeɛ ɔkɔdeɛ hwanyan ne mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">na ɔbɔ mpɛmpɛn fa wɔn ho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">saa ara na ɔtrɛɛ ne ntaban mu bumaa wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">sɔɔ wɔn mu den de wɔn tu kɔɔ soro.<verse eid="DEU 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12"/>Awurade nko na ɔkyerɛ wɔn ɛkwan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">Wɔtenaa ase a wɔnni ananafoɔ anyame biara.<verse eid="DEU 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13"/>Ɔma wɔnante faa nkokoɔ so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">Ɔma wɔdi mfuo so nnɔbaeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">ɔde abotan mu woɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">ne ngo a ɛfiri abohemaa mu siesie wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14"/>Ɔde anantwie nufosuo mu sradeɛ ne nnwan nufosuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">nnwan ne mmirekyie mu sradeɛ ma wɔdiiɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Ɔde Basan nnwennini ne nnwan a wɔadɔre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">ne atokoɔ papa maa wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Monom bobesa papa a ɛfiri bobe mu.<verse eid="DEU 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15"/>Nanso, ankyɛre Yeshurun dɔree sradeɛ yɛɛ ahomasoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">nnipa no mu yɛɛ duru, yɛɛ abrane, yɛɛ pemee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Afei, wɔpaa Onyankopɔn a ɔbɔɔ wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">wɔammu wɔn Botan a ɔyɛ wɔn nkwagyeɛ no.<verse eid="DEU 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16"/>Wɔkanyane ne ninkunutwe, ɛfiri sɛ wɔsomm anyame foforɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">wɔyɛɛ akyiwadeɛ pii de hyɛɛ no abufuo.<verse eid="DEU 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17"/>Wɔbɔɔ afɔdeɛ maa ahonhom fi, anyame huhuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">anyame a na wɔnnim wɔn dada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">anyame a wɔbaa nnansa yi ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">anyame a na wɔn agyanom nsuro wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18"/>Mopaa Ɔbotan a ɔyɛɛ mo agya no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:18">Mo werɛ firii Onyankopɔn a ɔwoo mo no.<verse eid="DEU 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hunuu yei na wɔn ho yɛɛ no nwunu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">Ɔno ankasa mmammarima ne ne mmammaa hyɛɛ no abufuo.<verse eid="DEU 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, “Mɛgya wɔn hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">Mɛma wɔn awieeɛ aba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔyɛ awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ kɔntɔnkye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">mma a wɔnni nokorɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21"/>Wɔde anyame foforɔ som akanyane me ninkuntwe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">wɔde anyame huhuo ahyɛ me abufuo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Afei, mɛhyira aman a wɔnyɛ me ɔman mpo ama wɔn ani abere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">mɛhyira aman amanmufoɔ a wɔnni nteaseɛ ahyɛ wɔn abufuo.<verse eid="DEU 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22"/>Mʼabufuo dɛre sɛ ogya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">na ɛhye kɔsi damena mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Ɛsɛe asase ne so nnɔbaeɛ nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">na ɛpaapae mmepɔ fapem.<verse eid="DEU 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23"/>“Mɛhɔre amanehunu wɔ wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">na mato me bɛmma awowɔ wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24"/>Mede ɛkɔm kɛseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">huraeɛnini ne owuyadeɛ bɛba wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">Wɔde wiram mmoa se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">ne awɔ a wɔn ano wɔ borɔ a wɔwea fam bɛha wɔn.<verse eid="DEU 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25"/>Mmɔntene so no wɔbɛwuwu akofena ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">na afie mu, ehu bɛtɔ wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Mmeranteɛ ne mmabaawa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">mmɔfra ne mpanin nyinaa.<verse eid="DEU 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26"/>Meyɛɛ mʼadwene sɛ mɛbɔ wɔn ahwete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">ama wɔn nkaeɛ ayera.<verse eid="DEU 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27"/>Nanso, mesuroo ɔtamfoɔ fɛdie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">sɛ ebia atiafoɔ rente aseɛ na wɔaka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">‘Yɛn tumi adi nkonim!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">Ɛnyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔyɛeɛ!’ ”<verse eid="DEU 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28"/>Israel yɛ ɔman a wɔnni adwene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">Nnipa no yɛ nkwaseafoɔ, na wɔnni nteaseɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29"/>Ao, sɛ wɔnim nyansa a, anka wɔbɛte yei ase!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">Ao, anka wɔbɛhunu wɔn hyɛberɛ!<verse eid="DEU 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30"/>Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na onipa baako ataa nnipa apem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">na baanu bɛma ɔpedu adwane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">gye sɛ wɔn Botan atɔn wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">Gye sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi wɔn ama.<verse eid="DEU 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31"/>Na wɔn botan nte sɛ yɛn Botan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">sɛdeɛ wɔhunu no.<verse eid="DEU 32:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32"/>Wɔn bobe nyini firi Sodom bobe mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">firi Gomora bobe nturom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Wɔn bobe aba yɛ awuduro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">na wɔn siaka nso yɛ nwono.<verse eid="DEU 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33"/>Wɔn bobesa yɛ awɔ ano borɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">aprammire ano borɔ kɔdiawuo.<verse eid="DEU 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34"/>“Merekora saa nneɛma yi nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">asɔ ano de asie mʼadekoradan mu.<verse eid="DEU 32:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35"/>Mɛtɔ awere; wɔn a ɛfata wɔn no, ɛbɛtua wɔn so ka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">Ɛrenkyɛre wɔn nan bɛwatiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">Wɔn amanehunu da no bɛduru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">na wɔn hyɛberɛ bɛto wɔn.”<verse eid="DEU 32:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbu ne nkurɔfoɔ atɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">na wasesa nʼadwene wɔ ne nkoa ho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">Ɛberɛ a wahunu sɛ wɔn ahoɔden asa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">na ɛnkaa obiara, akoa anaa ɔdehyeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 32:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37"/>Ɔbɛbisa sɛ, “Afei wɔn anyame no wɔ he,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">ɔbotan a wɔde yɛɛ wɔn dwanekɔbea no,<verse eid="DEU 32:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38"/>anyame a wɔdii wɔn afɔrebɔdeɛ mu sradeɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">na wɔnom wɔn afɔrebɔdeɛ mu nsã no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Ma saa anyame no nsɔre mmɛboa mo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">Ma wɔnyɛ mo dwanekɔbea!<verse eid="DEU 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39"/>“Afei, monhunu sɛ, me ara me ne no!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Onyame biara nni hɔ sɛ me!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Me na mekum na mema nkwa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Me na mepira, na mesa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">obi ntumi nnye wo mfiri me nsam.<verse eid="DEU 32:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40"/>Afei, mepagya me nsa kyerɛ soro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">Ka sɛ: Sɛ mete ase yi,<verse eid="DEU 32:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41"/>Sɛ mese mʼakofena a ɛpa yerɛ yerɛ ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">na mefiri atemmuo ase a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">mɛtɔ mʼatamfoɔ so awere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">na matua wɔn a wɔtan me so ka.<verse eid="DEU 32:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42"/>Mɛma me bɛmma anom mogya abo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">na mʼakofena asɛe honam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">atɔfoɔ ne nnommumfoɔ mogya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">ne atamfoɔ ntuanofoɔ tiri.”<verse eid="DEU 32:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43"/>Ao ɔsorosoro, mo ne no nni ahurisie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">ɛfiri sɛ, ɔbɛtɔ nʼasomfoɔ mogya so were.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">Ɔbɛtɔ nʼatamfoɔ so awere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">na wadwira nʼasase ne ne nkurɔfoɔ ho.<verse eid="DEU 32:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44"/>Mose ne Nun babarima Hosea baeɛ bɛkaa dwom yi mu nsɛm nyinaa kyerɛɛ nnipa no. <verse eid="DEU 32:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45"/>Mose wiee saa dwom no mu nsɛm no ka no, <verse eid="DEU 32:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46"/>ɔka kaa ho sɛ, “Momfa nsɛm a maka akyerɛ mo no nyinaa nsie mo akoma mu. Monka nkyerɛ mo mma nso sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛdi emu asɛm biara so sɛ mmara. <verse eid="DEU 32:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47"/>Saa nkyerɛkyerɛ yi nyɛ nsɛm bi kwa, ɛyɛ mo nkwa! Sɛ modi so a, mo nkwa nna bɛware wɔ asase a moretwa Asubɔnten Yordan akɔtena so no so.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose Owuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48"/>Ɛda no ara, Awurade ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, <verse eid="DEU 32:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49"/>“Kɔ Moab, kɔ mmepɔ a ɛwɔ asuo no apueeɛ no so, na foro Nebo bepɔ a ɛne Yeriko di nhwɛanim no. To wʼani hwɛ Kanaan asase no, asase a mede rema Israelfoɔ sɛ wɔn agyapadeɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 32:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50"/>Ɛhɔ na wobɛwu wɔ bepɔ no so, na woakɔka wʼagyanom ho, sɛdeɛ wo nua Aaron wuu wɔ Hor bepɔ so kɔkaa nʼagyanom ho no. <verse eid="DEU 32:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, mo baanu dii me hwammɔ wɔ Israelfoɔ mu wɔ Meriba ne Kades asuo ho wɔ Sin ɛserɛ so. Moanni me kronkronyɛ ho adanseɛ ankyerɛ Israelfoɔ no wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="DEU 32:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52"/>Ɛno enti, mobɛhunu asase no afiri akyiri, nanso mo nan rensi asase a mede rema Israelfoɔ no so.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Mose Hyira Mmusuakuo No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1"/>Yei ne nhyira a Onyankopɔn onipa Mose de hyiraa Israelfoɔ no ansa na ɔrewu: <verse eid="DEU 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2"/>Ɔkaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> firi Sinai ba bɛpuee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">yɛn so firii Seir;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">ɔhran firii Paran bepɔ so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Ɔde akronkronfoɔ pii ba firii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">anafoɔ fam ne mmepɔ nsianeɛ so.<verse eid="DEU 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3"/>Nokorɛ mu, wo wodɔ wo nnipa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">akronkronfoɔ nyinaa wɔ wo nsam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Wɔkoto wo nan ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">na wɔnya nkyerɛkyerɛ firi wo hɔ;<verse eid="DEU 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4"/>mmara a Mose de maa yɛn no:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">Yakob nkurɔfoɔ agyapadeɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛɛ ɔhene wɔ Yeshurun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">ɛberɛ a nnipa no ntuanofoɔ hyiaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">Israel mmusuakuo no.<verse eid="DEU 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6"/>“Ma Ruben nya nkwa. Mma nʼase ntɔre.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">Na ne mmarima nso, mma wɔn so nhwan.”<verse eid="DEU 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Yuda abusuakuo ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">“Tie Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, tie Yuda sufrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">fa no brɛ ne nkurɔfoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Ɔde nʼankasa ahoɔden bɔ ne ho ban.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">Yɛ ne ɔboafoɔ na tia nʼatamfoɔ!”<verse eid="DEU 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Lewi abusuakuo ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">“Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wode ade kronkron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">ama wʼasomfoɔ nokwafoɔ Lewifoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Wosɔɔ wɔn hwɛɛ wɔ Masa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">wone wɔn koeɛ wɔ Meriba asuo ho.<verse eid="DEU 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9"/>Lewifoɔ tiee wʼasɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">bɔɔ wʼapam no ho ban.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Wɔdii wo nokorɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">sene sɛdeɛ wɔdii wɔn awofoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">wɔn abusuafoɔ ne wɔn mma nokorɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10"/>Afei, ma wɔnkyerɛ Yakob wo mmara no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">Ma wɔmfa wo nkyerɛkyerɛ no mma Israelfoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Wɔde aduhwam bɛba wʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">Abɛbɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ wɔ afɔrebukyia so.<verse eid="DEU 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11"/>Hyira Lewifoɔ, Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">na ma wɔn nnwuma nyinaa nsɔ wʼani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Bubu wɔn atamfoɔ nnwonku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">bɔ wɔn atamfoɔ hwe fam a wɔnsɔre bio.”<verse eid="DEU 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Benyamin abusuakuo ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> dɔ Benyamin nkurɔfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">na wɔnya banbɔ wɔ ne mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">Ɔtwa wɔn ho hyia ɛberɛ biara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:12">na ɔbɔ wɔn ho ban firi ɔhaw biara mu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Yosef mmusuakuo ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira wɔn nsase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">ɔmfa ne bosuo pa a ɛfiri sorosoro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:13">ne nsuo a ɛfiri asase ase pɛɛ no,<verse eid="DEU 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14"/>ne nnepa a ɛnyini wɔ owia mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:14">ne adonneɛ a ɛba ɔbosome biara mu;<verse eid="DEU 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15"/>ne nnɔbaeɛ pa a ɛfiri tete mmepɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">ne deɛ abu so wɔ nkokoɔ a ɛtim hɔ daa mu<verse eid="DEU 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16"/>ne akyɛdeɛ amapa dodoɔ a ɛfiri asase mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">ne adom a ɛfiri deɛ ɔpuee wɔ ogya a ɛrederɛ no mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Saa nhyira yi nyinaa mmra Yosef so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">nhyɛ no ahenkyɛ wɔ ne nuanom mu.<verse eid="DEU 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17"/>Yosef wɔ ahoɔden ne tumi sɛ nantwie ba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">Nʼahoɔden te sɛ ɔtrɔm mmɛn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Ɔde bɛwowɔ akyirikyiri aman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">apamo wɔn akɔ asase ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Yei ne me nhyira a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">mede rema Efraim bebrebe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">ne Manase mpempem no.”<verse eid="DEU 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Sebulon ne Isakar mmusuakuo ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">“Sebulon asefoɔ, monnya nkɔsoɔ wɔ mo akwantuo biara mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:18">Isakar asefoɔ, monnya nkɔsoɔ wɔ mo fie ntomadan mu.<verse eid="DEU 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19"/>Wɔfrɛ nnipa no kɔ bepɔ no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">kɔbɔ afɔdeɛ a ɛdi mu wɔ hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">Wɔnya mfasoɔ firi ɛpo mu nnepa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:19">ne ademudeɛ a ahinta wɔ anwea mu.”<verse eid="DEU 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Gad abusuakuo ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">“Nhyira nka obi a ɔtrɛ Gad mantam mu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">Gad ayɛ krado sɛ gyata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:20">a ɔrebɛtu abasa anaa wate etire.<verse eid="DEU 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21"/>Gad nkurɔfoɔ gyee asase pa no maa wɔn ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">ɔkannifoɔ kyɛfa na wɔde maa wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">Ɛberɛ a nkurɔfoɔ no mpanimfoɔ hyiaeɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">wɔde <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atɛntenenee yɛɛ adwuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">na wɔdii mmara a wɔde maa Israelfoɔ no so.”<verse eid="DEU 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Dan abusuakuo ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">“Dan yɛ gyata ba a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">ɔrehurihuri firi Basan.”<verse eid="DEU 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Naftali abusuakuo ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">“Ao Naftali, wowɔ adom bebree</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira ayɛ wo ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">atɔeɛ fam ne anafoɔ fam bɛyɛ wo kyɛfa.”<verse eid="DEU 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24"/>Asɛm a Mose ka faa Aser abusuakuo ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">“Aser nnya animuonyam wɔ ne nuanom anim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">ne nuanom mfa anidie mma no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:24">wɔmfa ngo nsra ne nan ho.<verse eid="DEU 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25"/>Wʼapono ho nkyerewa nyɛ dadeɛ ne kɔbere mfrafraeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">Awurade mmɔ wo ho ban wo nkwa nna nyinaa.<verse eid="DEU 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26"/>“Onyankopɔn biara nni hɔ sɛ Yeshurun Onyankopɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">Ɔnam ɔsorosoro bɛboa wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">ɔde ne tumi nante omununkum mu.<verse eid="DEU 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27"/>Onyankopɔn a ɔwɔ hɔ daa yɛ wo dwanekɔbea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">nʼabasa a ɛwɔ hɔ daa no kura wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Ɔbɛpam wʼatamfoɔ afiri wʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">Ɔno na ɔteaam sɛ, ‘Sɛe wɔn!’<verse eid="DEU 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28"/>Enti, Israel bɛtena ase asomdwoeɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">Yakob a wanya nkɔsoɔ bɛnya banbɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">wɔ asase a aduane ne nsã wɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">na ɔsoro tɔ bosuo gu so.<verse eid="DEU 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29"/>Nhyira nka mo, Ao Israel!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Hwan na ɔte sɛ mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">nnipa a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> agye mo nkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Ɔyɛ mo akokyɛm ne mo ɔboafoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ne mo nkonimdie akofena!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Mo atamfoɔ bɛkoto mo anim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">na moatiatia wɔn so.”<verse eid="DEU 33:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Mose Owuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1"/>Na Mose firi Moab asase tata so foro kɔɔ Nebo Bepɔ so, sane foroo Pisga kokoɔ no wɔ Yeriko ntentenesoɔ. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ no asase no nyinaa, ɛfiri Gilead kɔsi Dan; <verse eid="DEU 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2"/>Naftali nsase nyinaa; Efraim ne Manase nsase; Yuda nsase nyinaa kɔsi Ntam Po no ho; <verse eid="DEU 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3"/>Negeb; ne nsase a ɛfiri Yeriko bɔnhwa no de kɔsi Soar. <verse eid="DEU 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ, “Yei ne asase a mekaa ntam hyɛɛ ho bɔ kyerɛɛ Abraham, Isak ne Yakob sɛ mede bɛma wɔn asefoɔ no. Afei, mama wo de wʼani ahunu, nanso wo nan rensi so.”<verse eid="DEU 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5"/>Enti Mose, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ɔsomfoɔ wuu wɔ Moab asase so sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaeɛ no. <verse eid="DEU 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6"/>Wɔsiee no wɔ bɔnhwa bi a ɛbɛn Bet-Peor nanso ɛbɛsi ɛnnɛ, obiara nnim beaeɛ ko pɔtee. <verse eid="DEU 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7"/>Mose dii mfirinhyia ɔha ne aduonu, na ɔwuiɛ nanso na nʼani hunu adeɛ yie na ne ho nso yɛ den. <verse eid="DEU 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8"/>Israelfoɔ suu no nnafua aduasa de wiee nʼayie wɔ Moab tata so.<verse eid="DEU 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9"/>Afei, Nun babarima Yosua nyaa nyansa honhom ɛfiri sɛ, Mose de ne nsa guu ne so. Enti, Israelfoɔ yɛɛ ɔsetie maa no na wɔyɛɛ biribiara sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛɛ Mose no ara pɛ.<verse eid="DEU 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10"/>Mose akyi no, odiyifoɔ biara mmaeɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nim no animu ne animu. <verse eid="DEU 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa Mose ma ɔkɔyɛɛ anwanwadeɛ ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛyɛ hu wɔ Misraim asase so de tiaa Farao, nʼasomfoɔ ne asase no nyinaa. <verse eid="DEU 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12"/>Na ɛnam Mose so na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> daa ne tumi kɛseɛ ne ahodwirie nneyɛɛ adi kyerɛɛ Israel nyinaa.<verse eid="DEU 34:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34"/>
</usx>
